#: apps/accounts/admin.py
msgid ""
"A secure login entrance is set: log in to the site through it, then open the "
"Django admin. If you forgot the entrance, running hfile resetadmin on the "
"server shows it."
msgstr ""
"设了登录安全入口：请从安全入口登录网站，再打开后台。忘了入口的话，在服务器上"
"运行 hfile resetadmin 会显示它。"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py apps/captchas/apps.py apps/captchas/models.py
msgid "Captcha"
msgstr "验证码"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py
#, python-format
msgid "Too many logins. Please try again in %(wait)s second."
msgid_plural "Too many logins. Please try again in %(wait)s seconds."
msgstr[0] "登录太频繁了，请 %(wait)s 秒后再试。"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py
msgid ""
"This account has to log in through the site's login box (there is one more "
"step), then open the Django admin."
msgstr "这个账号要在网站的登录框里登录（还要再验证一步），登录后再打开后台。"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py
msgid "HFile admin"
msgstr "HFile 后台"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py apps/web/navigation.py
#: apps/web/templates/web/manage.html
msgid "Manage"
msgstr "管理"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py
msgid "Only superusers can make a user an admin."
msgstr "只有超级管理员可以把用户设为管理员。"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py
msgid "You can't disable your own account or take away your own admin role."
msgstr "不能停用自己的账号，也不能去掉自己的管理员身份。"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py
msgid ""
"This is the last working superuser: it can't be disabled or lose its admin "
"role."
msgstr "这是最后一个能用的超级管理员：不能停用，也不能去掉管理员身份。"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py
msgid "Profile"
msgstr "资料"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py apps/storages/models.py
msgid "Permissions"
msgstr "权限"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py apps/accounts/templates/accounts/admin_login.html
#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/login.html apps/captchas/models.py
#: apps/web/templates/401.html apps/web/templates/web/base.html
#: apps/web/templates/web/dialogs/login.html
msgid "Log in"
msgstr "登录"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py apps/accounts/models.py
msgid "Last login IP"
msgstr "最近登录 IP"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(ip)s (%(location)s)"
msgstr "%(ip)s（%(location)s）"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py
msgid "Not every working superuser can be deleted; nothing was deleted."
msgstr "不能删掉所有能用的超级管理员，什么都没有删除。"

#: apps/accounts/admin.py apps/accounts/managing.py
msgid "Built-in users have no password and can't log in."
msgstr "内置用户没有密码，也不能登录。"

#: apps/accounts/apps.py
msgid "Accounts"
msgstr "账号"

#: apps/accounts/apps.py
msgid "Expired sessions"
msgstr "过期的会话"

#: apps/accounts/login.py
#, python-format
msgid "One more step to log in: %(label)s."
msgstr "还要%(label)s才能登录。"

#: apps/accounts/login.py
msgid "The login has expired. Please enter your username and password again."
msgstr "登录已经过期了，请重新输入用户名和密码。"

#: apps/accounts/login.py
#, python-format
msgid "The step needed now is \"%(step)s\"."
msgstr "现在要的是「%(step)s」这一步。"

#: apps/accounts/login.py
msgid "Too many wrong tries. Please enter your username and password again."
msgstr "错了太多次，请重新输入用户名和密码。"

#: apps/accounts/login_steps.py
msgctxt "login step"
msgid "Captcha"
msgstr "图片验证码"

#: apps/accounts/login_steps.py
msgid "Please enter the 6 digits shown on your phone."
msgstr "请输入手机上显示的 6 位数字。"

#: apps/accounts/login_steps.py
msgid ""
"Too many wrong two-step verification codes. Please try again in 15 minutes."
msgstr "两步验证码错了太多次，请过 15 分钟再试。"

#: apps/accounts/login_steps.py
msgid ""
"The two-step verification key can't be read any more (secret_key in the "
"settings file has changed). Please run hfile resetadmin on the server to "
"turn two-step verification off."
msgstr ""
"两步验证的密钥读不出来了（设置文件里的 secret_key 换过）。请在服务器上运行 "
"hfile resetadmin 关掉两步验证。"

#: apps/accounts/login_steps.py
msgid ""
"The two-step verification code is wrong or already used. Please enter a new "
"one."
msgstr "两步验证码不对，或者已经用过了，请输入新的。"

#: apps/accounts/login_steps.py apps/web/templates/web/base.html
msgid "Two-step verification"
msgstr "两步验证"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py
msgid "No such user"
msgstr "没有这个用户"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py
msgid "Wrong password"
msgstr "密码不对"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py apps/sso/flow.py
msgid "Account disabled"
msgstr "账号已停用"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py
msgid "Built-in users can't log in"
msgstr "内置用户不能登录"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py
msgid "Wrong captcha"
msgstr "验证码不对"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py
msgid "Two-step verification failed"
msgstr "两步验证没通过"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py
msgid "Stopped: too many"
msgstr "太频繁，被拦下"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py
msgid "The Django admin's login page can't do two-step verification"
msgstr "后台的登录页不能两步验证"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py
msgid "Single sign-on: account not linked"
msgstr "单点登录：账号还没有绑定"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py
msgid "Single sign-on: the provider refused"
msgstr "单点登录：服务商没有同意"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py
msgid "Single sign-on: provider error"
msgstr "单点登录：服务商出错"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py
msgid "Single sign-on: no usable ID in the user info"
msgstr "单点登录：用户信息里没有可用的 ID"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py apps/installer/templates/installer/done.html
#: apps/installer/templates/installer/install.html
#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "Site"
msgstr "网站"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py apps/web/templates/web/manage.html
msgid "Django admin"
msgstr "后台"

#: apps/accounts/loginlog.py apps/accounts/templates/accounts/manage/users.html
#: apps/sso/apps.py apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
#: apps/web/navigation.py
msgid "Single sign-on"
msgstr "单点登录"

#: apps/accounts/manage_serializers.py apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid "Permissions should be a list."
msgstr "权限应该是一个列表。"

#: apps/accounts/manage_serializers.py
msgid "The permission list is too long."
msgstr "权限列表太长了。"

#: apps/accounts/manage_serializers.py
msgid "Superuser"
msgstr "超级管理员"

#: apps/accounts/manage_serializers.py
#: apps/installer/templates/installer/install.html
msgid "Admin"
msgstr "管理员"

#: apps/accounts/manage_serializers.py apps/accounts/models.py
msgid "Regular user"
msgstr "普通用户"

#: apps/accounts/manage_serializers.py apps/accounts/models.py
#: apps/office/editor.py
msgid "Anonymous user"
msgstr "匿名用户"

#: apps/accounts/manage_serializers.py apps/accounts/models.py
msgid "New user template"
msgstr "虚拟新用户"

#: apps/accounts/manage_serializers.py apps/accounts/serializers.py
msgid "A username is required."
msgstr "要填用户名。"

#: apps/accounts/manage_serializers.py apps/accounts/serializers.py
msgid "The username can't be empty."
msgstr "用户名不能为空。"

#: apps/accounts/manage_serializers.py
msgid "The username is too long."
msgstr "用户名太长了。"

#: apps/accounts/manage_serializers.py
msgid "The nickname is too long."
msgstr "昵称太长了。"

#: apps/accounts/manage_serializers.py apps/accounts/serializers.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The password is at most {max_length} character."
msgid_plural "The password is at most {max_length} characters."
msgstr[0] "密码最多 {max_length} 个字符。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid ""
"Gives a superuser a new password and turns off their two-step verification "
"(for a forgotten password or a lost phone)."
msgstr ""
"给超级管理员设一个新密码，并关掉他的两步验证（忘了密码、手机丢了时用）。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid ""
"the superuser's username; can be left out when there is only one superuser"
msgstr "超级管理员的用户名；只有一个超级管理员时可以不写"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid ""
"HFile isn't installed yet: install it with the setup wizard first, which "
"creates the first admin."
msgstr "HFile 还没有安装：先用安装向导装好，安装时会建第一个管理员。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid ""
"Run this command in a terminal: the new password is entered twice and isn't "
"shown."
msgstr "要在终端里运行这个命令：新密码要输入两遍，不会显示出来。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(username)s has a new password; their logins elsewhere have ended."
msgstr "已经给 %(username)s 设了新密码，他在别处的登录都已失效。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid ""
"Their two-step verification is off; after logging in it can be set up again "
"from the menu at the top right."
msgstr "他的两步验证已经关掉了；登录后可以在右上角的菜单里重新设置。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid "This account was disabled and is enabled again now."
msgstr "这个账号原来是停用的，现在重新启用了。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid "This account couldn't open the Manage page before; now it can."
msgstr "这个账号原来进不了管理页，现在可以了。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
#, python-format
msgid "There is no account with the username \"%(username)s\"."
msgstr "没有用户名是「%(username)s」的账号。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(username)s\" isn't a superuser. %(listing)s"
msgstr "「%(username)s」不是超级管理员。%(listing)s"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid "There is no superuser yet: create one with the createsuperuser command."
msgstr "还没有超级管理员：用 createsuperuser 命令建一个。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"There is %(count)s superuser; please give the username: resetadmin USERNAME. "
"%(listing)s"
msgid_plural ""
"There are %(count)s superusers; please give the username: resetadmin "
"USERNAME. %(listing)s"
msgstr[0] ""
"有 %(count)s 个超级管理员，请写上用户名：resetadmin 用户名。%(listing)s"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
#, python-format
msgid "There is %(count)s superuser:"
msgid_plural "There are %(count)s superusers:"
msgstr[0] "有 %(count)s 个超级管理员："

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid "Which one gets a new password? Enter a number or username: "
msgstr "给哪一个设新密码？输入编号或用户名："

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid "There is no such one. Please try again."
msgstr "没有这一个，请重新输入。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid "Nothing was chosen; nothing was changed."
msgstr "没有选好，什么都没有改。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/manage/users.html
msgid "disabled"
msgstr "停用的"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid "two-step verification on"
msgstr "开着两步验证"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(username)s (%(nickname)s)"
msgstr "%(username)s（%(nickname)s）"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s: %(notes)s"
msgstr "%(name)s：%(notes)s"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py apps/accounts/permissions.py
#: apps/activity/describe.py apps/core/cleanup.py apps/core/filters.py
#: apps/core/images.py apps/core/parsers.py apps/core/query.py
#: apps/installer/service.py apps/siteconf/serializers.py
#: apps/siteconf/views.py apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#: apps/storages/instances.py apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#: apps/upgrades/service.py apps/upgrades/startup.py config/configfile.py
msgid ", "
msgstr "、"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid "Superusers: "
msgstr "超级管理员有："

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
#, python-format
msgid "New password for %(username)s: "
msgstr "%(username)s 的新密码："

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py apps/accounts/serializers.py
msgid "The password can't be empty."
msgstr "密码不能为空。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid "Again: "
msgstr "再输一次："

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid "The two don't match."
msgstr "两次输入的不一样。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid "No new password was set; nothing was changed."
msgstr "没有设好新密码，什么都没有改。"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Login address: %(url)s (a secure login entrance is set; logging in only "
"works here)"
msgstr "登录地址：%(url)s（设了登录安全入口，只能从这里登录）"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
#, python-format
msgid "Login address: %(url)s"
msgstr "登录地址：%(url)s"

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/resetadmin.py
msgid "Logging in asks for a captcha (it's on in \"Security settings\")."
msgstr "登录要输入图片验证码（「安全设置」里开着）。"

#: apps/accounts/managing.py
msgid "Only superusers can change other admins' accounts."
msgstr "只有超级管理员可以修改其他管理员的账号。"

#: apps/accounts/managing.py
msgid "A built-in user's username and nickname can't be changed."
msgstr "内置用户的用户名和昵称不能改。"

#: apps/accounts/managing.py
msgid "Built-in users can't be deleted."
msgstr "内置用户不能删除。"

#: apps/accounts/managing.py
msgid "The new user template doesn't log in, so it isn't enabled or disabled."
msgstr "虚拟新用户不登录，没有启用和停用。"

#: apps/accounts/managing.py
msgid ""
"To change your own password, use \"Change password\" in the menu at the top "
"right."
msgstr "改自己的密码请用右上角菜单里的「修改密码」。"

#: apps/accounts/managing.py
msgid "You can't disable your own account."
msgstr "不能停用自己的账号。"

#: apps/accounts/managing.py
msgid "You can't delete your own account."
msgstr "不能删除自己的账号。"

#: apps/accounts/managing.py
msgid "This is the last working superuser; it can't be disabled."
msgstr "这是最后一个能用的超级管理员，不能停用。"

#: apps/accounts/managing.py
msgid "This is the last working superuser; it can't be deleted."
msgstr "这是最后一个能用的超级管理员，不能删除。"

#: apps/accounts/managing.py apps/accounts/models.py
msgid "This username is taken."
msgstr "这个用户名已经被别人用了。"

#: apps/accounts/managing.py apps/sso/views.py
msgid "This user doesn't exist any more; it may have just been deleted."
msgstr "这个用户已经不存在了，可能刚被删除。"

#: apps/accounts/models.py apps/accounts/templates/accounts/manage/users.html
#: apps/accounts/validators.py apps/activity/describe.py
msgid "Nickname"
msgstr "昵称"

#: apps/accounts/models.py
msgid ""
"Only for display, and others may have the same one; logging in uses the "
"username."
msgstr "只用于显示，可以和别人重复；登录用用户名。"

#: apps/accounts/models.py
msgid "Last login IP location"
msgstr "最近登录 IP 归属地"

#: apps/accounts/models.py apps/links/templates/links/manage/download_logs.html
#: apps/storages/models.py
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

#: apps/accounts/models.py
msgid ""
"The anonymous user's permissions are what people who aren't logged in can "
"do; the new user template's are what new single sign-on users start with. "
"These two users can't log in or be deleted."
msgstr ""
"匿名用户的权限是没登录的人能做的事，虚拟新用户的权限是单点登录新用户一开始的"
"权限。这两个用户不能登录，也不能删除。"

#: apps/accounts/models.py apps/accounts/templates/accounts/manage/users.html
msgid "Default permissions"
msgstr "默认权限"

#: apps/accounts/models.py
msgid ""
"The permissions this user gets on storage sources added later (existing ones "
"aren't affected). With none, new storage sources aren't given to this user."
msgstr ""
"以后新增存储源时，这个用户自动得到的权限（已有的存储源不受影响）。一项都没有"
"时，新增的存储源不授予这个用户使用。"

#: apps/accounts/models.py
msgid "Login generation"
msgstr "登录批次"

#: apps/accounts/models.py
msgid "Two-step verification key"
msgstr "两步验证的密钥"

#: apps/accounts/models.py
msgid "Last two-step verification time step used"
msgstr "两步验证最后用过的时段"

#: apps/accounts/models.py
msgid "Two-step verification turned on at"
msgstr "两步验证开启时间"

#: apps/accounts/models.py apps/accounts/templates/accounts/manage/users.html
#: apps/activity/models.py
#: apps/activity/templates/activity/manage/activity_log.html
#: apps/links/models.py apps/links/templates/links/manage/download_logs.html
#: apps/sso/models.py apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "User"
msgstr "用户"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py apps/activity/models.py
#: apps/files/templates/files/browser.html
msgid "New folder"
msgstr "新建文件夹"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py apps/activity/models.py apps/uploads/apps.py
msgid "Upload"
msgstr "上传"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py apps/preview/apps.py
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "预览"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid "Download"
msgstr "下载"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid "Copy download link"
msgstr "复制下载链接"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py apps/activity/models.py apps/files/service.py
msgid "Rename"
msgstr "重命名"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py apps/activity/models.py apps/files/service.py
#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/diagnostics.html
#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "复制"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py apps/activity/models.py apps/files/service.py
msgid "Move"
msgstr "移动"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py apps/activity/models.py apps/files/service.py
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "删除"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid "Get direct links"
msgstr "获取直链"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid "Create short links"
msgstr "生成短链"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid "Create share links"
msgstr "创建分享链接"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid "Choose share link keys"
msgstr "自定义分享链接 key"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid "Ignore passwords"
msgstr "忽略密码"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid "Ignore hiding"
msgstr "忽略隐藏"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid "Turning this off also turns off uploading folders."
msgstr "关闭这项会同时关掉上传文件夹。"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid ""
"Upload files, and save after editing online. Overwriting an existing file "
"also needs the \"Delete\" permission."
msgstr "上传文件；也包括在线编辑后保存。覆盖已有的文件还要「删除」权限。"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid ""
"Preview images, video, audio, text, Office files and more in the browser."
msgstr "在网页上预览图片、视频、音频、文本、Office 等文件。"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid ""
"Download files. Previewing, copying download links and getting direct or "
"short links hand out the files' content too, so they need it first."
msgstr ""
"下载文件。预览、复制下载链接、获取直链和生成短链也会把文件内容交出去，所以要"
"先有它。"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid ""
"Adds \"Copy download link\" to the right-click menu: it copies the file's "
"current download address, not a direct or short link."
msgstr ""
"右键菜单里多一项「复制下载链接」：复制的是这个文件当前的下载地址，不是直链或"
"短链。"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid "Allows creating share links."
msgstr "允许创建分享链接。"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid ""
"When creating a share link, the key in the link can be chosen instead of "
"generated."
msgstr "创建分享链接时可以自己定链接里的 key，而不是由系统生成。"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid ""
"Ignores every folder password of this storage source; no passwords needed."
msgstr "忽略这个存储源的所有目录密码，不用输密码。"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
msgid ""
"Ignores every filter rule of this storage source; every folder and file can "
"be seen."
msgstr "忽略这个存储源的所有过滤规则，能看到所有的文件夹和文件。"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
#, python-format
msgid " and others (%(count)s in all)"
msgid_plural " and others (%(count)s in all)"
msgstr[0] " 等 %(count)s 个"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
#, python-format
msgid "Unknown permissions: %(codes)s"
msgstr "不认识的权限：%(codes)s"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py apps/core/exceptions.py
msgid " or "
msgstr "或"

#: apps/accounts/permissions.py
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(label)s\""
