#: apps/ipgeo/templates/ipgeo/manage/ip_geo.html
msgid ""
"Turned on, the IPs of the user list, the activity log and the download log "
"show where they are: the country or region and, with the city database, for "
"many IPs the province or state and the city too. The lookup happens on this "
"server, in MaxMind's GeoLite2 database; IPs aren't sent anywhere."
msgstr ""
"启用后，用户列表、操作日志和下载日志里的 IP 旁边显示它在哪里：国家或地区，用"
"城市数据库时很多 IP 还有省（州）和城市。查询在本机完成，用的是 MaxMind 的 "
"GeoLite2 数据库，IP 不会发给别人。"

#: apps/ipgeo/templates/ipgeo/manage/ip_geo.html
msgid "Turn on IP location"
msgstr "启用 IP 归属地"

#: apps/ipgeo/templates/ipgeo/manage/ip_geo.html
msgid ""
"Takes effect at once. Turned off, nothing is looked up or shown; the "
"locations stored stay, and show again when it is turned on again."
msgstr ""
"打开后马上生效。停用后不再查询，也不显示；已经记下的归属地会留着，再启用时照"
"常显示。"

#: apps/ipgeo/templates/ipgeo/manage/ip_geo.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"It can be downloaded once IP location is on, from <a href=\"%(url)s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">%(host)s</a>, which copies "
"MaxMind's files every day. MaxMind updates the data every Tuesday and "
"Friday; the site doesn't update it by itself. \"Update the database\" "
"downloads the whole file again, and changes nothing when it is the same."
msgstr ""
"启用 IP 归属地以后才能下载，从 <a href=\"%(url)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">%(host)s</a> 下载，它每天转存一次 MaxMind 的文"
"件。MaxMind 每周二、周五更新数据，网站不会自己更新。「更新数据库」会把整个文"
"件重新下一遍，和正在用的一样时什么都不改。"

