msgid ""
"Once downloaded, it takes the place of the database in use, whose file is "
"deleted. Locations recorded before stay as they are; \"Fill in locations\" "
"below, with its box ticked, looks them up again."
msgstr ""
"下载好以后替换正在用的数据库，原来那个文件删掉。以前记下的归属地不变；在下面"
"勾上「已有归属地的也重新查一遍」再「补全归属地」，就会重新查。"

