"href=\"https://www.maxmind.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">https://www.maxmind.com</a>."
msgstr ""
"本产品包含 MaxMind 制作的 GeoLite 数据，可从 <a href=\"https://"
"www.maxmind.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://"
