#: apps/links/templates/links/manage/download_logs.html
msgid ""
"Three kinds of downloads are logged: direct links, short links, and "
"downloads passed on by this site when someone clicks \"Download\" in the "
"file list or a preview (page downloads). When the browser downloads straight "
"from the storage source's own address after \"Download\" (an object "
"storage's direct address or download domain), the download doesn't go "
"through this site and isn't logged; previews, image viewing, playing, copied "
"download links and shares aren't logged either, nor are downloads that were "
"stopped or failed (over the rate limit, hotlink protection, no permission, "
"an expired short link and so on). Each entry is logged when the download "
"starts; whether it finished, the site can't see. \"User\" is the account "
"logged in at the time; visitors who weren't logged in show as \"—\"."
msgstr ""
"记录三种下载：直链、短链，以及在文件列表或预览里点「下载」、经过本站转发的下"
"载（页面下载）。点「下载」时浏览器直接从存储源自己的地址下载的（对象存储的直"
"连地址、下载域名）不经过本站，不记；预览、看图、播放、复制出去的下载链接和分"
"享也不记；被拦下或失败的（超出下载频率、防盗链、没有权限、短链失效等）也不"
"记。每条在下载开始时记下，之后有没有下完，网站看不到。「用户」是下载时登录着"
"的账号，没登录的访客是「—」。"

