#: apps/links/templates/links/manage/short_links.html
msgid ""
"Short links (/s/Key) that users created in the file list. When a short link "
"is opened, the user who created it is checked again: if the account is "
"disabled, has lost the \"Create short links\" or \"Download\" permission, "
"the file is no longer in their root folder or is hidden by a filter rule, or "
"the folder has a new password, the short link stops working. Whether short "
"links are allowed, and the lifetimes to choose from, are set in <a "
"href=\"#links\">\"Direct and short links\"</a>."
msgstr ""
"用户在文件列表里生成的短链（/s/Key）。打开短链时会重新检查生成它的用户：账号"
