"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"OnlyOffice 开了 JWT 认证时填它的 Secret（JWT 密钥），没开可以空着。加密保存，"
"保存后不再显示；空着就是不改。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"Like https://kk.example.com; when empty, kkFileView isn't used. kkFileView "
"must be able to download the files to preview from this site."
msgstr ""
"比如 https://kk.example.com，空着就不用 kkFileView。kkFileView 要能从这个网站"
"下载到要预览的文件。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"Shown above the home and file pages; visitors can close it (it shows again "
"when it changes). Markdown works, and HTML too; the page doesn't run scripts "
"or use inline styles in it (<script>, onclick, style attributes): put "
"analytics code in \"Custom JS\" and styles in \"Custom CSS\"."
msgstr ""
"显示在首页和文件页上方，访客可以关掉（内容改了会重新显示）。支持 Markdown，也"
"可以写 HTML；页面不运行其中的脚本，也不用内联样式（<script>、onclick、style "
"属性），统计代码请写在「自定义 JS」里，样式写在「自定义 CSS」里。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"Added to the home, file and share pages, without <style></style>. The "
"Manage, login and setup pages don't have it."
msgstr ""
"加在首页、文件页和分享页上，不用写 <style></style>。管理页、登录页和安装页上"
"没有它。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"Analytics code, say, added to the home, file and share pages. <script></"
"script> is optional: scripts run in their order, and external scripts need "
"https addresses; inline event attributes (onclick and the like) don't run. "
"With custom JS, these pages may load scripts, pictures and APIs over https. "
"The Manage, login and setup pages don't have it, so if a script breaks, you "
"can still log in and fix it. It can do anything the site's own code can "
"(including reading what's typed on the page): only put code you trust here."
msgstr ""
"比如统计代码，加在首页、文件页和分享页上。<script></script> 写不写都行：写了"
"的按原来的顺序执行，外部的脚本要用 https 地址；内联的事件属性（onclick 等）不"
"会运行。有了自定义 JS，这些页面允许加载 https 上的脚本、图片和接口。管理页、"
"登录页和安装页上没有它：脚本出了问题，也能从登录页登录、把它改掉。它和网站自"
"己的代码一样什么都能做（包括读到页面上输入的内容），只放信得过的代码。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"How the file list looks on computers: Full width fills the window, Centered "
"is a column in the middle, Card puts it on a card."
msgstr ""
"文件列表在电脑上的样子：全屏铺满窗口，居中是中间的一栏，卡片放在一张卡片里。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid "Only for the list view."
msgstr "只对列表视图有效。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid "When off, downloads start right away without asking."
msgstr "关掉后点下载会直接开始，不再问一遍。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid "Whether a single or double click opens folders and previews files."
msgstr "单击还是双击打开文件夹、预览文件。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"With many files in a folder, this many are shown first, then \"Load more\", "
"so the page doesn't stall."
msgstr "一个文件夹里的文件很多时先显示这么多，再点「加载更多」，防止页面卡顿。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid "Files and folders sort separately; folders always come first."
msgstr "文件和文件夹分开排，文件夹总在前面。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"Text files larger than this aren't previewed but downloaded. 1 to 10240."
msgstr "比这大的文本文件不预览，直接下载。1 到 10240。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid "The secret can't contain line breaks or control characters."
msgstr "Secret 里不能有换行和控制字符。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/_announcement.html
#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/view.html
msgid "Announcement"
msgstr "公告"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"One per line, with the scheme; * is a wildcard: https://*.example.com is "
"example.com and all its subdomains, *://example.com matches http and https, "
"https://example.com/** is every page of that site (the same as no path). "
"When a link is opened from another site, browsers usually send only that "
"site's address without the path, so rules with paths mostly matter for this "
"site's own pages."
msgstr ""
"每行一个，要写协议头，* 是通配符：https://*.example.com 是 example.com 和它所"
"有的子域名，*://example.com 不管 http 还是 https，https://example.com/** 是这"
"个网站的所有页面（不写路径也一样）。浏览器从别的网站打开链接时一般只带那个网"
"站的地址、不带路径，所以写了路径的规则多半只对本站的页面有用。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"A direct link is: site address/prefix/storage-alias/file-path. English "
"letters, digits, - and _ only, at most 32 characters, and it can't be one of "
"the site's own addresses, a storage source's alias or the Django admin "
"address. Once changed, old direct links stop working right away."
msgstr ""
"直链的地址是：网站地址/前缀/存储源别名/文件路径。只能用英文字母、数字、- 和 "
"_，最多 32 个字符，不能和网站自己的地址、存储源的别名、后台地址重名。改了以"
"后，旧的直链马上就打不开了。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"The lifetimes to choose from when creating a short link, listed in this "
"order; the first is the default."
msgstr "生成短链时可以选的有效期，按这个顺序列出，第一个是默认的。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"Logs every download through direct and short links, and downloads through "
"this site after clicking \"Download\" in the file list or a preview; see "
"them in \"Download log\"."
msgstr ""
"记下直链和短链的每一次下载，以及在文件列表或预览里点「下载」、经过本站的下"
"载，在「下载日志」里查看。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"Checks the referring site (Referer) when direct and short links are opened. "
"Once a download is sent on to the storage source's own address, it can't be "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"打开直链和短链时检查来源网站（Referer）。下载跳转到存储源自己的地址以后，就检"
"查不到了。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"Opening a link straight in the browser, and some download tools, send no "
"Referer."
msgstr "直接在浏览器里打开链接，和一些下载工具，都不带 Referer。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid "Seconds"
msgstr "秒数"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"Each IP can download at most this many times in this many seconds, direct "
"and short links together; either one 0 means no limit. The storage source's "
"own addresses that downloads are sent on to don't go through HFile and can't "
"be limited."
msgstr ""
"单个 IP 在这么多秒内最多下载这么多次，直链和短链一起算；有一个是 0 就不限制。"
"跳转后的存储源原始地址不经过 HFile，限制不了。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"A switch for the whole site: when off, \"Get direct links\" isn't shown and "
"existing direct links don't download, whatever the storage source "
"permissions."
msgstr ""
"全局开关：关掉后不显示「获取直链」，已有的直链也不能下载，比存储源的权限优"
"先。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"When off, opening a direct link needs the download permission for the file "
"(the anonymous user's when not logged in), the file in your root folder, and "
"its folder's password entered in this browser; when on, anyone who knows the "
"address can download files from any enabled storage source (including those "
"the anonymous user has no permission on), and only filter rules still apply "
"(folder passwords don't)."
msgstr ""
"关着时，打开直链要有这个文件的下载权限（没登录时算匿名用户的权限），文件在自"
"己的根目录里，所在文件夹的密码在这个浏览器里输入过；开着时，知道地址的人都能"
"下载任何启用的存储源里的文件（包括匿名用户没有权限的存储源），只有过滤规则还"
"管用（目录密码不管用）。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"A switch for the whole site: when off, \"Create short links\" isn't shown "
"and existing short links don't download, whatever the storage source "
"permissions."
msgstr ""
"全局开关：关掉后不显示「生成短链」，已有的短链也不能下载，比存储源的权限优"
"先。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid "Must start with http://, https:// or *://, with no spaces."
msgstr "要以 http://、https:// 或 *:// 开头，中间不能有空格。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"The direct link prefix can only have English letters, digits, - and _, 1 to "
"32 characters."
msgstr "直链地址前缀只能用英文字母、数字、- 和 _，1 到 32 个字符。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/proxy.html apps/web/navigation.py
msgid "Proxy download"
msgstr "代理下载"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"How many downloads through this site one IP can have going at once; each "
"connection of a download tool counts, and so does each picture a gallery "
"page loads. One more gets 429 (Too Many Requests). 0 means no limit."
msgstr ""
"一个 IP 同时能有几个经过本站的下载：下载工具开的每个连接都算一个，画廊加载的"
"每张图片也算一个。再多的会得到 429（请求过多）。0 是不限。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"How fast all of one IP's downloads through this site go together, however "
"many connections it opens; 1024 KB/s is 1 MB/s. 0 means no limit."
msgstr ""
"一个 IP 所有经过本站的下载加起来最快多少，不管它开几个连接；1024 KB/s 是 1 "
"MB/s。0 是不限。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/security.html apps/web/navigation.py
msgid "Security settings"
msgstr "安全设置"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"When set, logging in only works at \"site address/login/entrance/\" and "
"there is no login box anywhere else, so the login can't be found by "
"scanning. English letters, digits, - and _ only, at most 32 characters; "
"empty means none. Note the address down (it also shows in \"Site settings\" "
"in the Django admin)."
msgstr ""
"设了以后只能从「网站地址/login/入口/」登录，别处都没有登录框，防止登录入口被"
"扫描。只能用英文字母、数字、- 和 _，最多 32 个字符；空着就是不用。请记下这个"
"地址（Django 后台的「站点设置」里也看得到）。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"With \"Custom page\", the whole page people who aren't logged in see on the "
"home and file pages. It can be just the body, which gets the site's name, "
"icon and styles, and HFile's style classes work, like <a class=\"btn btn-"
"filled\" href=\"/login/\">Log in</a>; or a whole HTML page. Inline scripts "
"don't run (to send people to the login page, choose \"Go to the login "
"page\"), and external scripts need https addresses."
msgstr ""
"选「自定义页面」时，没登录的人打开首页和文件页看到的整个页面。可以只写正文："
"会套上网站的名称、图标和样式，HFile 的样式类也能用，比如 <a class=\"btn btn-"
"filled\" href=\"/login/\">登录</a>；也可以写一个完整的 HTML 页面。内联脚本不"
"会运行（要跳到登录页请选「跳转到登录页」），外部的脚本要用 https 地址。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"Shows a \"Log in\" button at the top right of the page. Only the button: "
"opening the login page \"site address/login/\" works either way. Never shown "
"when a secure login entrance is set."
msgstr ""
"在页面右上角显示「登录」按钮。这里只管显示：直接打开登录页「网站地址/login/」"
"照样能登录。设了登录安全入口时总是不显示。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"What people who aren't logged in see on the home and file pages. Shares, "
"direct and short links aren't affected."
msgstr "没登录的人打开首页和文件页时看到什么。分享、直链和短链不受影响。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"Logging in with a password also asks for the characters in a picture, "
"against mass password guessing. A strong password for every account still "
"works best."
msgstr ""
"用密码登录时要输入图片里的字，防止批量猜密码。最有效的还是给每个账号设一个强"
"密码。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"The secure login entrance can only have English letters, digits, - and _, at "
"most 32 characters."
msgstr "登录安全入口只能用英文字母、数字、- 和 _，最多 32 个字符。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid "With \"Custom page\" chosen, the page's HTML is needed."
msgstr "选了「自定义页面」，要写这个页面的 HTML。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/access.html apps/web/navigation.py
msgid "Access control"
msgstr "访问控制"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"One IP or range per line, like 203.0.113.7, 192.168.0.0/24 or 2001:db8::/32 "
"(IPv6 works); lines starting with # are comments. IPs on the list get 403 "
"for every address of this site."
msgstr ""
"每行一个 IP 或 IP 段，比如 203.0.113.7、192.168.0.0/24、2001:db8::/32（支持 "
"IPv6）；# 开头的行是注释。名单上的 IP 打开这个网站的任何地址都是 403。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid ""
"One browser identifier (User-Agent) per line; * is any characters, the rule "
"must match the whole UA, and case matters, like *Thunder*; lines starting "
"with # are comments."
msgstr ""
"每行一个浏览器标识（User-Agent），* 是任意几个字符，要和整个 UA 对得上，分大"
"小写，比如 *Thunder*；# 开头的行是注释。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\"%(rule)s\" would block you: the site sees your IP as %(ip)s. After saving, "
"you couldn't open this site. If that isn't your IP (a reverse proxy's, say), "
"check the settings file's [server] proxies in \"Diagnostics\" first."
msgstr ""
"「%(rule)s」会挡住你自己：网站看到的你的 IP 是 %(ip)s。保存以后你就打不开这个"
"网站了。如果这不是你的 IP（比如是反向代理的），先在「诊断信息」里检查设置文件"
"的 [server] proxies。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\"%(rule)s\" would block the browser you're using; after saving, you "
"couldn't open this site."
msgstr "「%(rule)s」会挡住你现在用的浏览器，保存以后你就打不开这个网站了。"

#: apps/siteconf/serializers.py
msgid "Not an IP address."
msgstr "不是 IP 地址。"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/_announcement.html
msgid "Close the announcement"
msgstr "关闭公告"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/_field.html
#, python-format
msgid "Preview of %(label)s"
msgstr "%(label)s的预览"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/_field.html
#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid "Upload picture"
msgstr "上传图片"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/_field.html
msgid "Restore the default"
msgstr "恢复默认"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/_field.html
msgid "Picture address (optional)"
msgstr "图片地址（可选）"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/_field.html
msgid "Not set"
msgstr "未设置"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/_field.html
msgid "Only superusers can change this."
msgstr "只有超级管理员可以改这一项。"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/_field.html
msgid "Empty means unchanged"
msgstr "空着就是不改"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/_field.html
msgid "Clear the saved secret"
msgstr "清除已保存的 Secret"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/_field.html
msgid "Add a lifetime"
msgstr "添加有效期"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/_save.html
msgid "Unsaved changes"
msgstr "有修改还没保存"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/access.html
msgid ""
"IPs and browsers on the lists get 403 for every address of this site. The IP "
"the site sees depends on the settings file's [server] proxies; see "
"\"Diagnostics\"."
msgstr ""
"名单上的 IP 和浏览器打开这个网站的任何地址都是 403。网站看到的 IP 按设置文件"
"的 [server] proxies 算，见「诊断信息」。"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/access.html
msgid "Your IP as the site sees it: …"
msgstr "网站看到的你的 IP：…"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/access.html
msgid "Test an IP"
msgstr "测试一个 IP"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/access.html
msgid "Like 192.168.0.8"
msgstr "比如 192.168.0.8"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/access.html
msgid "The browser you're using (User-Agent): …"
msgstr "你现在用的浏览器（User-Agent）：…"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/access.html
msgid "Block Thunder downloads"
msgstr "屏蔽迅雷下载"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/access.html
msgid ""
"Downloads with Thunder can take up the server's CPU and bandwidth for a long "
"time. Click to add Thunder's UA rules to the list, then save. It may not "
"work forever: Thunder can change its UA."
msgstr ""
"用迅雷下载会长时间占满服务器的 CPU 和带宽。点一下把迅雷的 UA 规则加进名单，再"
"保存。不保证一直有效：迅雷可能会换 UA。"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/access.html
msgid "Test a User-Agent"
msgstr "测试一个 User-Agent"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/access.html
msgid "Like Mozilla/5.0 …"
msgstr "比如 Mozilla/5.0 …"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/diagnostics.html
#: apps/web/navigation.py
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断信息"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/diagnostics.html
msgid ""
"You as the site sees you in this request: the IP, scheme and address. "
"Compare them with [site] url and [server] proxies in the settings file to "
"see whether the reverse proxy is set up right. Cookies, login credentials "
"and tokens in the headers are hidden, so it's safe to copy for others."
msgstr ""
"网站从这个请求看到的你：IP、协议和地址，和设置文件里的 [site] url、[server] "
"proxies 对一对，就知道反向代理配得对不对。请求头里的 Cookie、登录凭证和令牌都"
"隐藏了，可以放心复制给别人看。"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/diagnostics.html
msgid "Your IP"
msgstr "你的 IP"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/diagnostics.html
msgid "Request headers"
msgstr "请求头"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/diagnostics.html
msgid "Value"
msgstr "值"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/links.html
msgid ""
"A direct link is a fixed address that opens a file by its path; a short link "
"is a short random address. Here are their switches, address prefix, "
"lifetimes, hotlink protection and download rate."
msgstr ""
"直链是按路径打开文件的固定地址，短链是一段随机的短地址；这里是它们的开关、地"
"址前缀、有效期、防盗链和下载频率。"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/links.html
msgid "General"
msgstr "通用设置"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/links.html
msgid "Direct links"
msgstr "直链设置"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/links.html
msgctxt "settings tab"
msgid "Short links"
msgstr "短链设置"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/links.html
msgid "Download rate limit"
msgstr "下载频率限制"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/proxy.html
msgid ""
"Downloads through this site: those of storage sources with \"Download "
"through the site\" on, and those of local, FTP, SFTP, WebDAV and Google "
"Drive storage sources without a download domain. They run on threads of "
"their own, not the [server] threads of the settings file, so they don't hold "
"up the pages. How many each storage source sends at once, and what happens "
"when it has no more, is in its own settings."
msgstr ""
"经过本站的下载：打开了「代理下载」的存储源的下载，以及没有设置下载域名的本"
"地、FTP、SFTP、WebDAV 和 Google Drive 存储源的下载。它们用自己的线程，不占设"
"置文件里 [server] 的 threads，所以不会卡住页面。每个存储源同时发送几个、满了"
"以后怎么办，在它自己的设置里。"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/security.html
msgid ""
"The login entrance, the home page for people who aren't logged in and the "
"captcha. Admins set up their two-step verification in their own menu at the "
"top right."
msgstr ""
"登录入口、没登录的人看到的首页和图片验证码。管理员的两步验证在右上角自己的菜"
"单里设。"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/site.html
msgid ""
"The site's name, icon and logo at the top left, the first part of the path "
"above the file list, and the ICP number at the bottom of the page."
msgstr ""
"网站的名称、图标和左上角的 Logo，文件列表上方路径的第一段，页面底部的备案号。"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/view.html
msgid ""
"How the file list looks and works, which files preview how, OnlyOffice and "
"kkFileView, the announcement, and custom CSS and JS."
msgstr ""
"文件列表的样子和用法、哪些文件用什么预览、OnlyOffice 和 kkFileView、公告、自"
"定义 CSS 和 JS。"

#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/view.html
msgid "Habits"
msgstr "使用习惯"

