#: apps/siteconf/templates/siteconf/manage/view.html
msgid ""
"Suffixes aren't case-sensitive and are separated by commas, like "
"mp4,webm,mkv; empty means the default. With a kind's switch off, those files "
"aren't previewed and download when opened. A suffix listed doesn't guarantee "
"a preview: it depends on the browser supporting the format, and HFile "
"doesn't convert."
msgstr ""
"后缀不分大小写，用逗号分开，比如 mp4,webm,mkv；空着就用默认的。关掉一类的开"
"关，这类文件就不预览，点开直接下载。填了后缀不等于一定能预览：要看浏览器支不"
"支持这种格式，HFile 不转码。"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
