msgstr "没有这一页设置。"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
msgid "Only one picture can be uploaded."
msgstr "只能上传一张。"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
msgid "There is no such picture setting."
msgstr "没有这个图片设置。"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The picture can't be saved: the folder of [paths] uploads in the settings "
"file (%(folder)s) can't be written to (%(error)s)."
msgstr ""
"图片存不下：设置文件 [paths] uploads 的文件夹（%(folder)s）写不进去"
"（%(error)s）。"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(cookie)s=<hidden>"
msgstr "%(cookie)s=<已隐藏>"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
msgid "<hidden>"
msgstr "<已隐藏>"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The request has headers a reverse proxy adds (%(headers)s), but [server] "
"proxies in the settings file is 0: the site doesn't trust those headers and "
"sees every visitor's IP as %(remote_addr)s (the proxy's own), so rate "
"limits, logs and the IP blocklist go wrong. Set proxies to the number of "
"proxies in front."
msgstr ""
"请求里有反向代理加的请求头（%(headers)s），但设置文件的 [server] proxies 是 "
"0：网站不信这些请求头，看到的访问者 IP 都是 %(remote_addr)s（代理自己的），频"
"率限制、日志和 IP 黑名单都会算错。前面有几层代理，就把 proxies 改成几。"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"[server] proxies in the settings file is %(proxies)s, but the request has no "
"X-Forwarded-For: either there is no reverse proxy in front after all (set "
"proxies to 0), or the proxy doesn't pass the header (Nginx needs "
"proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;)."
msgstr ""
"设置文件的 [server] proxies 是 %(proxies)s，但请求里没有 X-Forwarded-For：要"
"么前面其实没有反向代理（把 proxies 改成 0），要么代理没传这个请求头（Nginx 要"
"写 proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;）。"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"X-Forwarded-For has only %(count)s address, fewer than [server] proxies = "
"%(proxies)s: the visitor's IP is taken from the leftmost one, which the "
"client fills in itself and can fake. proxies must equal the number of "
"proxies in front."
msgid_plural ""
"X-Forwarded-For has only %(count)s addresses, fewer than [server] proxies = "
"%(proxies)s: the visitor's IP is taken from the leftmost one, which the "
"client fills in itself and can fake. proxies must equal the number of "
"proxies in front."
msgstr[0] ""
"X-Forwarded-For 里只有 %(count)s 个地址，比 [server] proxies = %(proxies)s "
"少：访问者的 IP 用的是最左边的那个，它是客户端自己填的，可以伪造。proxies 要"
"和前面代理的层数一样。"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
msgid ""
"[site] url isn't set: full links copied out (direct links, shares) use each "
"request's own address."
msgstr ""
"没有设 [site] url：复制出去的完整链接（直链、分享）用的是每个请求自己的地址。"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
msgid ""
"the proxy must pass X-Forwarded-Proto (Nginx: proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-"
"Proto $scheme;), and [server] proxies must be right for the site to trust it"
msgstr ""
"代理要传 X-Forwarded-Proto（Nginx：proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto "
"$scheme;），[server] proxies 也要设对，网站才信它"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
msgid "the site gets https, but [site] url says http"
msgstr "网站收到的是 https，[site] url 却写的 http"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
msgid ""
"the proxy must pass the domain the browser used in Host (Nginx: "
"proxy_set_header Host $host;)"
msgstr ""
"代理要把浏览器用的域名放在 Host 里传过来（Nginx：proxy_set_header Host "
"$host;）"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"[site] url in the settings file is %(site_url)s, but this request sees "
"%(origin)s. If you're using the [site] url address: %(hints)s."
msgstr ""
"设置文件的 [site] url 是 %(site_url)s，这个请求看到的地址是 %(origin)s。用的"
"就是 [site] url 这个地址的话，%(hints)s。"

#: apps/siteconf/views.py
msgid ""
"No problems found: how the site sees its address and visitors' IPs matches "
"the settings file."
msgstr "没看出问题：网站看到的地址和访问者 IP 的取法和设置文件一致。"

