#: apps/sso/presets.py
msgid ""
"Create an app in GitHub's Settings → Developer settings → OAuth Apps, with "
"the callback URL below as its Authorization callback URL. Scope isn't "
"needed: reading the public profile (ID, username, name) is enough."
msgstr ""
"在 GitHub 的 Settings → Developer settings → OAuth Apps 里新建一个应用，"
"Authorization callback URL 填下面的回调地址。不用填 Scope：读公开的资料（ID、"
"用户名、名字）就够了。"

#: apps/sso/presets.py
msgid ""
"Create an app in Gitee's Settings → Third-party apps, with the callback URL "
"below as its callback address, and check the user_info permission."
msgstr ""
"在 Gitee 的 设置 → 第三方应用 里创建应用，应用回调地址填下面的回调地址，权限"
"勾上 user_info。"

#: apps/sso/presets.py
msgid ""
"Create an application in GitLab's Preferences → Applications (check "
"Confidential, choose the openid and profile scopes), with the callback URL "
"below as its Redirect URI. For a GitLab of your own, replace gitlab.com with "
"its address, or fill in from its .well-known address."
msgstr ""
"在 GitLab 的 Preferences → Applications 里新建应用（勾上 Confidential，"
"Scopes 选 openid 和 profile），Redirect URI 填下面的回调地址。自己部署的 "
"GitLab 把 gitlab.com 换成自己的地址，或者用 .well-known 地址自动填写。"

#: apps/sso/presets.py
msgid ""
"Create a \"Traditional web\" application in the Logto console, with the "
"callback URL below as its Redirect URI. Replace your-tenant in the three "
"endpoints with your tenant, or fill in from the .well-known address (https://"
"your-tenant.logto.app/oidc/.well-known/openid-configuration). Logto's "
"traditional web applications only take the Client Secret over HTTP Basic."
msgstr ""
"在 Logto 控制台新建一个「传统网页应用」，Redirect URI 填下面的回调地址。把三"
"个端点里的 your-tenant 换成自己的租户，或者用 .well-known 地址自动填写"
"（https://你的租户.logto.app/oidc/.well-known/openid-configuration）。Logto "
"的传统网页应用只接受 HTTP Basic 发送 Client Secret。"

#: apps/sso/presets.py
msgid "Generic OpenID Connect"
msgstr "通用 OpenID Connect"

#: apps/sso/presets.py
msgid ""
"OpenID Connect services such as Keycloak, Authentik, Authelia and Casdoor: "
"click \"Fill in from a .well-known address\" first and enter its OpenID "
"configuration address (usually issuer-address/.well-known/openid-"
"configuration), then fill in the Client ID and Secret."
msgstr ""
"Keycloak、Authentik、Authelia、Casdoor 这类 OpenID Connect 服务：先点「通"
"过 .well-known 地址自动填写」，填它的 OpenID 配置地址（一般是 发行者地"
"址/.well-known/openid-configuration），再填 Client ID 和 Secret。"

