msgstr "账号绑定"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/links_dialog.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Once linked, these accounts can log in to %(site_name)s without a password. "
"One account per provider."
msgstr ""
"绑定以后，就能用这些账号登录 %(site_name)s，不用输密码。一个服务商只能绑定一"
"个账号。"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid "Add"
msgstr "新增"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid "Blank"
msgstr "空白的"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid ""
"Log in with GitHub, Gitee, GitLab or OpenID Connect (Logto, Keycloak and "
"others) accounts. Register an app with the provider first, giving it the "
"callback URL from the form, then fill in the Client ID and Secret it gives "
"you here. Accounts are linked by the provider's user ID that never changes, "
"not by username: a user with the same name at the provider doesn't log in as "
"the user here."
msgstr ""
"用 GitHub、Gitee、GitLab 或者 OpenID Connect 服务（Logto、Keycloak 等）的账号"
"登录。先在服务商那里登记一个应用，把表单里的回调地址填进去，再把它给的 "
"Client ID 和 Secret 填到这里。账号按服务商那边不会变的用户 ID 绑定，不按用户"
"名：服务商那边的同名用户不会登录成这里的用户。"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid ""
"Users that single sign-on creates get the permissions of the \"New user "
"template\" in \"Users\" (default permissions and storage source "
"permissions), and are never admins. Whether they can be created is \"Let "
"single sign-on register new users\" in \"Security settings\", which is "
"<strong>on</strong> now."
msgstr ""
"单点登录自动新建的用户，权限照「用户」里的「虚拟新用户」（默认权限和存储源权"
"限），不会是管理员。允许不允许自动新建是「安全设置」里的「允许单点登录自动注"
"册新用户」，现在<strong>开着</strong>。"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid ""
"Users that single sign-on creates get the permissions of the \"New user "
"template\" in \"Users\" (default permissions and storage source "
"permissions), and are never admins. Whether they can be created is \"Let "
"single sign-on register new users\" in \"Security settings\", which is "
"<strong>off</strong> now: people who haven't linked an account can't log in "
"with single sign-on; they log in with a password and link it themselves "
"first, or an admin links it in the user's \"Single sign-on\"."
msgstr ""
"单点登录自动新建的用户，权限照「用户」里的「虚拟新用户」（默认权限和存储源权"
"限），不会是管理员。允许不允许自动新建是「安全设置」里的「允许单点登录自动注"
"册新用户」，现在<strong>关着</strong>：没绑定的人用单点登录登录不了，要先用密"
"码登录后自己绑定，或者由管理员在用户的「单点登录」里绑定。"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid ""
"Only superusers can change the single sign-on settings: a provider's "
"settings decide which of its accounts logs in as which user. Here they can "
"only be viewed."
msgstr ""
"只有超级管理员可以修改单点登录的设置：服务商的设置决定了它的哪个账号登录成哪"
"个用户。这里只能看。"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The settings file has no [site] url, so the callback URL comes from the "
"address you opened this page with (%(origin)s); opened from another address, "
"it changes, and no longer matches the one registered with the provider. Set "
"the site's real address as [site] url in config.toml."
msgstr ""
"设置文件里没有写 [site] url，回调地址是按你现在打开这个页面的地址"
"（%(origin)s）算的；从别的地址打开网站时，它会跟着变，服务商那里登记的地址就"
"对不上了。建议在 config.toml 的 [site] url 里写上网站的正式地址。"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid "Linked users"
msgstr "绑定的用户"

