msgstr "清除已保存的 Client Secret（改成公开客户端）"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid "Fill in from a .well-known address"
msgstr "通过 .well-known 地址自动填写"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid ""
"For OpenID Connect, the three endpoints below can be read from its "
"configuration address"
msgstr "OpenID Connect 服务可以从它的配置地址读出下面三个端点"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid "Separated by spaces; they must allow reading the user info"
msgstr "几个之间用空格隔开，要能读到用户信息"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid "HTTP Basic (client_secret_basic)"
msgstr "HTTP Basic（client_secret_basic）"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid "The unique ID that never changes: sub or id"
msgstr "不会变的唯一 ID：sub 或 id"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid "New users' username; optional"
msgstr "新用户的用户名，可以不填"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid "New users' nickname; optional"
msgstr "新用户的昵称，可以不填"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid "Smallest first on the login page"
msgstr "登录页上小的在前"

#: apps/sso/templates/sso/manage/providers.html
msgid ""
"The three fields are positions in the JSON the userinfo endpoint returns: "
"<code>sub</code>, <code>data.login</code>, <code>$.user.id</code>, "
"<code>['user-name']</code>, <code>emails[0]</code>. The values must be text "
"or integers."
msgstr ""
"三个字段写用户信息端点返回的 JSON 里的位置：<code>sub</code>、"
"<code>data.login</code>、<code>$.user.id</code>、<code>['user-name']</code>、"
"<code>emails[0]</code>。值要是文字或整数。"

#: apps/sso/validation.py
msgid ""
"Lowercase letters, digits, - and _ only, 1 to 32 characters, like github."
msgstr "只能用小写字母、数字、- 和 _，1 到 32 个字符，比如 github。"

