msgstr ""
"图标要写成 http(s) 地址，或者 data:image/png;base64,… 这样的地址（PNG、JPEG、"
"GIF、WebP、SVG）。"

#: apps/sso/validation.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\"%(token)s\" has characters a scope can't have (only English letters, "
