msgstr "路径太长，Azure 复制不了这个文件：复制来源的地址最多 2 KiB。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Azure didn't finish copying %(name)s in %(minutes)s minute, so the copy was "
