msgid_plural ""
"Azure didn't finish copying %(name)s in %(minutes)s minutes, so the copy was "
"cancelled. Please try again later."
msgstr[0] ""
"Azure %(minutes)s 分钟内没有复制完 %(name)s，已取消这次复制，请稍后再试。"

