msgstr "存储的文件列表里有不对的文件大小。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid "The storage's file list pages are wrong (NextMarker didn't change)."
msgstr "存储的文件列表分页不对（NextMarker 没有变）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid "Azure Blob Storage"
msgstr "Azure Blob 存储"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid ""
"The storage account's Blob service endpoint, as \"Endpoints\" in the "
"account's page in the Azure portal shows it, like https://"
"mystorageaccount.blob.core.windows.net (Azure operated by 21Vianet in China: "
"https://mystorageaccount.blob.core.chinacloudapi.cn)."
msgstr ""
"存储帐户的 Blob 服务终结点，即 Azure 门户里帐户页面「终结点」显示的地址，例"
"如 https://mystorageaccount.blob.core.windows.net；世纪互联运营的 Azure 中国"
"是 https://mystorageaccount.blob.core.chinacloudapi.cn。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid "Storage account name"
msgstr "存储帐户名"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid ""
"The storage account's name, the first part of the endpoint's host name: 3 to "
"24 lowercase letters and digits."
msgstr "存储帐户的名称，也就是终结点主机名的第一段：3 到 24 个小写字母和数字。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid "Account key"
msgstr "帐户密钥"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid ""
"key1 or key2 under \"Security + networking → Access keys\" in the storage "
"account's page in the Azure portal. The account's \"Allow storage account "
"key access\" (under Configuration) must be on."
msgstr ""
"Azure 门户里存储帐户页面「安全性 + 网络 → 访问密钥」下的 key1 或 key2。帐户"
"「配置」里的「允许存储帐户密钥访问」要开着。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid "Container"
msgstr "容器"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid ""
"A container of the account (\"Data storage → Containers\" in the Azure "
"portal): 3 to 63 lowercase letters, digits and hyphens."
msgstr ""
"这个帐户里的一个容器（Azure 门户里的「数据存储 → 容器」）：3 到 63 个小写字"
"母、数字和连字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid ""
"The folder in the container that is this storage source's root, like / or /"
"folder1."
msgstr "容器里的哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid "Private container"
msgstr "私有容器"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid ""
"Turn off only when the container can be read anonymously (the account's "
"\"Allow Blob anonymous access\" is on and the container's access level is "
"Blob or Container): download links are then plain addresses that don't "
"expire. Otherwise they carry a SAS signed with the account key, and expire."
msgstr ""
"只有容器能匿名读取时才关掉（帐户的「允许 Blob 匿名访问」开着，容器的访问级别"
"是「Blob」或「容器」）：这时下载链接是不过期的普通地址。否则下载链接带用帐户"
"密钥签名的 SAS，会过期。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py apps/storages/models.py
msgid "Download domain"
msgstr "下载域名"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid ""
"Optional, written as https://domain: a custom domain or a CDN (Azure Front "
"Door, say) whose origin is this storage account's Blob service endpoint. "
"Download links then use it, as https://domain/container/path; those of a "
"private container keep their SAS, so the CDN must pass the query string on "
"to the origin."
msgstr ""
"可选，写成 https://域名：自定义域名，或者以这个存储帐户的 Blob 服务终结点为源"
"站的 CDN（比如 Azure Front Door）。填了以后下载链接改用它，形如 https://域名/"
"容器/路径；私有容器的链接仍带着 SAS，所以 CDN 回源时要把查询参数一起转发。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid "Please fill in %(label)s."
msgstr "请填写%(label)s。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid "The storage account name has 3 to 24 lowercase letters and digits."
msgstr "存储帐户名由 3 到 24 个小写字母和数字组成。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
#, python-format
msgid "The Endpoint belongs to the storage account %(other)s, not %(account)s."
msgstr "这个 Endpoint 属于存储帐户 %(other)s，不是 %(account)s。"

