msgstr "路径里有无法编码的字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
#, python-format
msgid "The path is too long: a full blob name is at most %(limit)s character."
msgid_plural ""
"The path is too long: a full blob name is at most %(limit)s characters."
msgstr[0] "路径太长了：完整的 Blob 名字最多 %(limit)s 个字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "The range the storage returned (Content-Range) is wrong."
msgstr "存储返回的范围（Content-Range）不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
msgid ""
"The file is too large: Azure Blob Storage takes at most 190.7 TiB per file."
msgstr "文件太大了：Azure Blob 存储的单个文件最大 190.7 TiB。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s has a . or .. part in its name, which can't be sent to Azure in an "
"address, so this folder isn't deleted. Please delete that blob in the Azure "
"portal first."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s 的名字里有 . 或 .. 这样的一段，没法放进发给 Azure 的地址里，所以这个"
"文件夹没有删除。请先在 Azure 门户里删掉这个 Blob。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "The root folder can't be renamed."
msgstr "不能重命名根目录。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "The root folder can't be moved or copied."
msgstr "不能移动或复制根目录。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "The target isn't a folder."
msgstr "目标不是文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The target folder doesn't exist."
msgstr "目标文件夹不存在。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/azure_blob.py apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "A folder can't be moved or copied into itself."
msgstr "不能把文件夹移动或复制到它自己里面。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid "Baidu Netdisk"
msgstr "百度网盘"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Baidu Netdisk refused the authorization (%(code)s). Please authorize again "
"in the storage source's settings and allow access to Baidu Netdisk."
msgstr ""
"百度网盘拒绝了授权（%(code)s），请在存储源设置里重新授权，并允许访问百度网"
"盘。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Baidu Netdisk doesn't accept this name, or doesn't let the app use this path "
"(%(code)s)."
msgstr "百度网盘不接受这个名字，或者不允许应用使用这个路径（%(code)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid "Baidu Netdisk is out of space."
msgstr "百度网盘的空间不够了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Baidu Netdisk doesn't let the app use this path (%(code)s): the base path "
"should be the app's folder, /apps/ followed by the app's name."
msgstr ""
"百度网盘不允许应用使用这个路径（%(code)s）：基路径应该是应用的文件夹，也就"
"是 /apps/ 后面跟应用名称。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The Baidu Netdisk open platform doesn't let the app do this (%(code)s). "
"Please check the app's state and permissions in the open platform's console."
msgstr ""
"百度网盘开放平台不允许这个应用这样做（%(code)s），请在开放平台的控制台里检查"
"应用的状态和权限。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Baidu Netdisk is limiting the app's requests (%(code)s). An app that hasn't "
"passed Baidu's review may only make a few. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"百度网盘限流了这个应用的请求（%(code)s）。没有通过百度上线审核的应用只能调用"
"很少的次数。请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid "Baidu Netdisk is busy (%(code)s). Please try again in a moment."
msgstr "百度网盘繁忙（%(code)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid "Baidu Netdisk refused the uploaded data (%(code)s). Please try again."
msgstr "百度网盘不接受上传的数据（%(code)s），请重试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The upload to Baidu Netdisk broke off because of a network failure "
"(%(code)s). Please try again."
msgstr "上传到百度网盘时因为网络故障中断了（%(code)s），请重试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid ""
"The file is larger than Baidu Netdisk takes for this account's membership "
"(31365)."
msgstr "文件超过了百度网盘给这个账号的会员等级的大小上限（31365）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid "Baidu Netdisk refused the download link (%(code)s). Please try again."
msgstr "百度网盘拒绝了下载链接（%(code)s），请重试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid "Baidu Netdisk refused this (%(code)s): %(message)s"
msgstr "百度网盘拒绝了这个操作（%(code)s）：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid "Baidu Netdisk refused this (%(code)s)."
msgstr "百度网盘拒绝了这个操作（%(code)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid "Baidu Netdisk failed (HTTP %(status)s). Please try again later."
msgstr "百度网盘出错了（HTTP %(status)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid ""
"The data from Baidu Netdisk couldn't be understood. Please try again later."
msgstr "百度网盘返回的数据看不懂，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid ""
"Create an app on the Baidu Netdisk open platform (pan.baidu.com/union): a "
"software app for \"personal use\", which works at once without Baidu's "
"review, for up to 10 users. In its \"Security settings\", add this site's "
"authorization callback URL to the OAuth callback addresses (Baidu takes "
"public addresses only, and a change takes up to an hour to work). Then enter "
"the app's AppKey here."
msgstr ""
"在百度网盘开放平台（pan.baidu.com/union）上创建一个应用：类型选「软件」，用途"
"选「个人使用」，这样不用百度审核就能直接用，最多 10 个用户。在应用详情的「安"
"全设置」里，把本站的授权回调地址加到「授权回调页」（百度只接受公网地址，改了"
"以后最多一小时生效）。然后把应用的 AppKey 填在这里。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid "The SecretKey of the same app."
msgstr "同一个应用的 SecretKey。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid ""
"With the AppKey and SecretKey filled in, click \"Authorize\", log in to "
"Baidu and allow the app: it's filled in for you."
msgstr ""
"填好 AppKey 和 SecretKey 后点「授权」，登录百度账号并允许这个应用，就会自动填"
"好。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid ""
"Filled in when authorizing. Baidu gives a new one on every refresh and the "
"old one stops working; HFile saves the new one itself."
msgstr ""
"授权后自动填写。百度每次刷新都会换一个新的，旧的随即失效，HFile 会自动保存新"
"的。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid ""
"The app's own folder: /apps/ followed by the app's name (Baidu Netdisk shows "
"it under \"My app data\"), or a folder in it. Baidu only lets apps use their "
"own folder and may restrict apps that touch others. HFile makes the folder "
"when it doesn't exist yet."
msgstr ""
"应用自己的文件夹：/apps/ 后面跟应用名称（百度网盘里显示在「我的应用数据」下"
"面），或者它里面的文件夹。百度只允许应用使用自己的文件夹，动别的文件夹的应用"
"可能会被限制。这个文件夹还不存在时，HFile 会自动创建。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid ""
"The AppKey should be the letters and digits that the Baidu Netdisk open "
"platform shows for the app."
msgstr "AppKey 应该是百度网盘开放平台上这个应用的那串字母和数字。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid ""
"The base path should be the app's folder, /apps/ followed by the app's name, "
"or a folder in it."
msgstr ""
"基路径应该是应用的文件夹（/apps/ 后面跟应用名称），或者它里面的文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid "Please fill in the AppKey and SecretKey first."
msgstr "请先填写 AppKey 和 SecretKey。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Baidu's authorization service is unavailable for now (HTTP %(status)s). "
"Please try again later."
msgstr "百度的授权服务暂时不可用（HTTP %(status)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid ""
"The authorization doesn't include Baidu Netdisk. Please authorize again and "
"allow access to Baidu Netdisk."
msgstr "这次授权不包括百度网盘，请重新授权，并允许访问百度网盘。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Baidu's authorization service gave no token (HTTP %(status)s). Please try "
"again later."
msgstr "百度的授权服务没有给出令牌（HTTP %(status)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Baidu doesn't accept the AppKey or SecretKey (%(code)s). Please check them."
msgstr "百度不接受这个 AppKey 或 SecretKey（%(code)s），请检查。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Baidu's authorization has expired or been withdrawn (%(code)s). Please "
"authorize again in the storage source's settings."
msgstr "百度的授权已经失效或者被取消了（%(code)s），请在存储源设置里重新授权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid "Baidu refused the authorization (%(code)s): %(message)s"
msgstr "百度拒绝了授权（%(code)s）：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid ""
"Not authorized yet: click \"Authorize\" in the storage source's settings and "
"log in to Baidu."
msgstr "还没有授权：请在存储源设置里点「授权」登录百度账号。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid ""
"The file list from Baidu Netdisk couldn't be understood. Please try again "
"later."
msgstr "百度网盘返回的文件列表看不懂，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid "The Baidu Netdisk file list never ends. Please try again later."
msgstr "百度网盘的文件列表一直翻不完，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid "Baidu Netdisk gave no download address for this file."
msgstr "百度网盘没有给出这个文件的下载地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid ""
"Baidu Netdisk gave an address that isn't Baidu's, so the access token wasn't "
"sent there."
msgstr "百度网盘给了一个不是百度的地址，所以没有把访问令牌发过去。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The file is too large for Baidu Netdisk: this account takes files of at most "
"%(limit)s."
msgstr "文件太大了：百度网盘的这个账号最多只能存 %(limit)s 的文件。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid ""
"Baidu Netdisk received an upload part that isn't what was sent. Please try "
"again."
msgstr "百度网盘收到的分片和发出去的不一样，请重试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid "Baidu Netdisk's upload start gave no upload ID. Please try again later."
msgstr "百度网盘的预上传没有给出上传任务 ID，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/baidu_netdisk.py
msgid "Baidu Netdisk doesn't accept empty files."
msgstr "百度网盘不接受空文件。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/base.py
msgid "The storage operation failed."
msgstr "存储操作失败。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/base.py
msgid "A file or folder with that name already exists."
msgstr "已经有同名的文件或文件夹了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/base.py
msgid ""
"The storage's account or key is wrong, or its authorization has expired. "
"Please ask the administrator to check the storage source's settings."
msgstr "存储的账号或密钥不对，或者授权已经失效，请管理员检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/base.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The rename stopped halfway: it is called \"%(name)s\" now. Please rename it "
"again."
msgstr "重命名做到一半停下了：它现在叫「%(name)s」，请再重命名一次。"

