#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py
msgid "Storage zone name"
msgstr "存储区名称"

#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py
msgid ""
"The storage zone's name, as the zone's Access tab (API / HTTP) in the "
"bunny.net dashboard shows it."
msgstr ""
"存储区（Storage Zone）的名称，见 bunny.net 控制台里这个存储区的「Access」页"
"（API / HTTP）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py
msgid ""
"The storage zone's password, from the same tab: not its read-only password, "
"nor the account's API key."
msgstr "存储区的密码，也在这一页：不是它的只读密码，也不是账号的 API 密钥。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Region"
msgstr "区域（Region）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py
msgid ""
"The storage zone's main region: the same tab shows its endpoint, given in "
"brackets here."
msgstr "存储区的主区域。同一页上有它的 Endpoint，就是这里括号里的地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py
msgid ""
"The folder in the storage zone that is this storage source's root, like / "
"or /folder1."
msgstr "存储区里的哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py
msgid "Pull zone address"
msgstr "Pull Zone 地址"

#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py
msgid ""
"Optional: a pull zone whose origin is this storage zone, written as https://"
"hostname (its b-cdn.net hostname, or a custom one). Downloads then come from "
"it; when empty, they go through this site. Without Token Authentication on "
"the pull zone, anyone can download any file of the zone by its address, also "
"files this site hides."
msgstr ""
"可选：一个以这个存储区为源站的 Pull Zone，写成 https://主机名（它的 b-"
"cdn.net 主机名，或者自定义的主机名）。填了以后从它下载；不填时经过本站下载。"
"Pull Zone 没有打开 Token Authentication 时，任何人知道地址都能下载这个存储区"
"里的任何文件，包括本站隐藏的文件。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py
msgid "Token authentication key"
msgstr "Token 认证密钥"

#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py
msgid ""
"When Token Authentication is on in the pull zone's Security settings: its "
"URL Token Authentication Key. Download links then carry a token that expires."
msgstr ""
"在 Pull Zone 的「Security」设置里打开了「Token Authentication」时，把那里的"
"「URL Token Authentication Key」填在这里，下载链接就会带上会过期的令牌。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py
msgid "A storage zone's name has only English letters, digits and hyphens."
msgstr "存储区名称只能有英文字母、数字和连字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "Names in %(service)s can't start or end with a space."
msgstr "%(service)s 的名字开头和结尾不能是空格。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py
msgid ""
"The key signs the pull zone's links: please fill in the pull zone address "
"too."
msgstr "这个密钥是给 Pull Zone 的链接签名用的：请把 Pull Zone 地址也填上。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py apps/uploads/service.py
#, python-format
msgid "The path is too long: at most %(limit)s character."
msgid_plural "The path is too long: at most %(limit)s characters."
msgstr[0] "路径太长了：最多 %(limit)s 个字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/bunny.py
msgid ""
"Bunny Storage can't rename folders. Please make a folder with the new name, "
"copy the files into it, then delete the old folder."
msgstr ""
"Bunny Storage 不能重命名文件夹。请新建一个用新名字的文件夹，把文件复制进去，"
"再删掉原来的文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid "ImgBed"
msgstr "ImgBed"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"ImgBed would change the name \"%(name)s\": it doesn't keep spaces, \"..\" or "
"these characters in names: %(chars)s"
msgstr ""
"ImgBed 会改掉「%(name)s」这个名字：名字里不能有空格、「..」或这些字符："
"%(chars)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The answer from %(service)s couldn't be understood: is the address that of "
"an ImgBed site?"
msgstr "%(service)s 返回的数据看不懂：这个地址是 ImgBed 站点吗？"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid "CloudFlare ImgBed"
msgstr "CloudFlare ImgBed"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid ""
"The address of the ImgBed site, as it is opened in a browser. Browsers get "
"its file links (/file/...) as they are, so it must be one they can open."
msgstr ""
"ImgBed 站点的地址，就是在浏览器里打开它的那个地址。它的文件链接（/file/...）"
"会原样交给浏览器，所以要是浏览器能打开的地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py apps/storages/drivers/example.py
msgid "API token"
msgstr "API Token"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid ""
"In ImgBed's admin panel, open System settings → Security settings → API "
"Token Management and create a token (ImgBed shows it only once) with the "
"list, upload and delete permissions, and manage for renaming, moving and "
"replacing files. Manage also lets the token manage ImgBed's tokens and "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"在 ImgBed 的管理界面打开「系统设置 → 安全设置 → API Token 管理」，创建一个 "
"Token（ImgBed 只显示一次），给它 list、upload 和 delete 权限；要重命名、移动"
"和替换文件，还要给 manage 权限。有 manage 权限的 Token 也能管理 ImgBed 的 "
"Token 和设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid ""
"The folder in ImgBed that is this storage source's root, like / or /folder1."
msgstr "ImgBed 里哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid "Upload channel"
msgstr "上传渠道"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid ""
"The kind of ImgBed channel that keeps the files uploaded here; ImgBed must "
"have one (System settings → Upload settings). Files over 20 MiB (9 MiB for "
"Discord) are uploaded in chunks, or straight to Hugging Face. WebDAV "
"channels take each file in one request, on Cloudflare at most 100 MB."
msgstr ""
"在这里上传的文件存进 ImgBed 的哪种渠道；ImgBed 里要有这种渠道（「系统设置 → "
"上传设置」）。大于 20 MiB 的文件（Discord 是 9 MiB）分块上传，或者直接传到 "
"Hugging Face。WebDAV 渠道的文件要用一个请求传完，在 Cloudflare 上最大 100 "
"MB。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid "Channel name"
msgstr "渠道名称"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid ""
"The name of one channel of that kind, when ImgBed has several. Empty: the "
"first one, or one at random when ImgBed balances the load."
msgstr ""
"这种渠道在 ImgBed 里有好几个时，填要用的那个的名称。不填：用第一个，ImgBed 开"
"了负载均衡时随机选一个。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid ""
"The address should start with http:// or https://, like https://"
"img.example.com."
msgstr "地址要以 http:// 或 https:// 开头，比如 https://img.example.com。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid ""
"An ImgBed API token has only ASCII letters, digits and symbols. Please copy "
"it again from ImgBed."
msgstr ""
"ImgBed 的 API Token 只有英文字母、数字和半角符号，请从 ImgBed 重新复制一遍。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid ""
"ImgBed refused the API token for this: renaming, moving and replacing files "
"need a token with the manage permission (System settings → Security settings "
"→ API Token Management)."
msgstr ""
"ImgBed 不让这个 API Token 做这件事：重命名、移动和替换文件要用有 manage 权限"
"的 Token（「系统设置 → 安全设置 → API Token 管理」）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"ImgBed refused the API token: it may be wrong, deleted or expired, or lack "
"the %(permission)s permission. Please check it in ImgBed (System settings → "
"Security settings → API Token Management)."
msgstr ""
"ImgBed 不接受这个 API Token：它可能填错了、已被删除或已经过期，或者没有 "
"%(permission)s 权限。请在 ImgBed 里检查一下（「系统设置 → 安全设置 → API "
"Token 管理」）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid ""
"ImgBed, or Cloudflare or a proxy in front of it, refused an upload request "
"as too large (HTTP 413). Cloudflare takes requests of at most 100 MB, so "
"larger files can't be uploaded to a WebDAV channel."
msgstr ""
"ImgBed，或者它前面的 Cloudflare 或代理，嫌上传的请求太大，拒绝了（HTTP "
"413）。Cloudflare 的请求最大 100 MB，所以更大的文件传不到 WebDAV 渠道。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
#, python-format
msgid "ImgBed failed (HTTP %(status_code)s): %(message)s"
msgstr "ImgBed 出错了（HTTP %(status_code)s）：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
#, python-format
msgid "ImgBed refused this (HTTP %(status_code)s): %(message)s"
msgstr "ImgBed 拒绝了这个操作（HTTP %(status_code)s）：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"ImgBed can't list the folder \"%(name)s\": it reads \"..\" in a folder's "
"name as \"_\", so the folder and the files in it can't be opened, renamed, "
"moved or deleted here."
msgstr ""
"ImgBed 列不出文件夹「%(name)s」：它会把文件夹名字里的「..」当成「_」，所以这"
"个文件夹和里面的文件在这里打不开，也不能改名、移动或删除。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid ""
"No ImgBed API answered at this address (HTTP 404). Please check the address: "
"it must be that of the ImgBed site."
msgstr ""
"这个地址上没有 ImgBed 的接口（HTTP 404）。请检查地址：要是 ImgBed 站点的地"
"址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
#, python-format
msgid "ImgBed stored the file as \"%(stored)s\", not as \"%(name)s\"."
msgstr "ImgBed 把文件存成了「%(stored)s」，而不是「%(name)s」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
#, python-format
msgid "ImgBed refused this: %(message)s"
msgstr "ImgBed 拒绝了这个操作：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid ""
"ImgBed can't read its file index right now, so not all of the folder's files "
"can be found. Please try again later."
msgstr "ImgBed 现在读不了它的文件索引，找不全文件夹里的文件，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid ""
"ImgBed won't serve this file: it is on ImgBed's block list or labelled adult "
"content, or ImgBed serves whitelisted files only (System settings → Security "
"settings → Access management)."
msgstr ""
"ImgBed 不提供这个文件：它在 ImgBed 的黑名单里，或者被标成了成人内容，或者 "
"ImgBed 只提供白名单里的文件（「系统设置 → 安全设置 → 访问管理」）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
#, python-format
msgid "Hugging Face's storage failed (HTTP %(status_code)s): %(message)s"
msgstr "Hugging Face 的存储出错了（HTTP %(status_code)s）：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hugging Face's storage refused the upload (HTTP %(status_code)s): %(message)s"
msgstr "Hugging Face 的存储拒绝了上传（HTTP %(status_code)s）：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The file was uploaded as \"%(stored)s\", but ImgBed didn't rename it to "
"\"%(name)s\" in place of the old one: %(message)s"
msgstr ""
"文件已经传成了「%(stored)s」，但 ImgBed 没能把它改名为「%(name)s」来替换旧文"
"件：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"ImgBed couldn't delete %(count)s of the folder's files. Please try again."
msgstr "ImgBed 没能删掉文件夹里的 %(count)s 个文件，请再试一次。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
msgid ""
"ImgBed can't rename or move files kept in its old Telegram channel or on "
"Telegraph."
msgstr "ImgBed 不能重命名或移动存在它旧版 Telegram 渠道或 Telegraph 上的文件。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"ImgBed listed no file in \"%(name)s\", so nothing was moved. Please try "
"again later."
msgstr "ImgBed 没有列出「%(name)s」里的文件，什么也没有移动，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cf_imgbed.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Only %(done)s of the folder's %(total)s files were moved before ImgBed "
"refused one (%(message)s); the others are still in \"%(name)s\"."
msgstr ""
"文件夹里的 %(total)s 个文件只移动了 %(done)s 个，ImgBed 就拒绝了下一个"
"（%(message)s）；其余的还在「%(name)s」里。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid "Cloudreve"
msgstr "Cloudreve"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#, python-format
msgid "Cloudreve failed: %(message)s (%(code)s). Please try again later."
msgstr "Cloudreve 出错了：%(message)s（%(code)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Cloudreve failed without giving a reason (its log has it under the "
"correlation ID %(id)s). Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Cloudreve 出错了，没有给出原因（它的日志里有，请求 ID 是 %(id)s），请稍后再"
"试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py
msgid ""
"Cloudreve failed without giving a reason (its log has it). Please try again "
"later."
msgstr "Cloudreve 出错了，没有给出原因（它的日志里有），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py
msgid ""
"The address of the Cloudreve site, as it is opened in a browser. Cloudreve "
"v4 only: for Cloudreve v3, choose the type Cloudreve v3."
msgstr ""
"Cloudreve 站点的地址，就是在浏览器里打开它的那个地址。只支持 Cloudreve v4；"
"Cloudreve v3 请选「Cloudreve v3」类型。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid "Email"
msgstr "邮箱"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py
msgid ""
"The email address of a Cloudreve account. HFile logs in as Cloudreve's login "
"page does, which works only while its \"Captcha for logins\" is off "
"(Dashboard → Settings → Captcha), and not for accounts with two-factor "
"authentication."
msgstr ""
"Cloudreve 账号的邮箱。HFile 像 Cloudreve 的登录页那样登录，这只在它的「登录验"
"证码」关着时才行（「仪表盘 → 参数设置 → 验证码」），开了两步验证的账号也不"
"行。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
msgid ""
"The folder of the account's own space that is this storage source's root, "
"like / or /folder1."
msgstr "账号的个人空间里哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/example.py
msgid ""
"The address should start with http:// or https://, like https://"
"cloud.example.com."
msgstr "地址要以 http:// 或 https:// 开头，比如 https://cloud.example.com。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid "Cloudreve logs in with the account's email address."
msgstr "Cloudreve 用账号的邮箱登录。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid ""
"This Cloudreve account uses two-factor authentication, which HFile can't log "
"in with (Cloudreve asks for a one-time code). Please use an account without "
"it."
msgstr ""
"这个 Cloudreve 账号开了两步验证，HFile 登录不了（Cloudreve 要一次性验证码）。"
"请用没开两步验证的账号。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py
msgid ""
"Cloudreve asks for a captcha to log in. Its administrator must turn off "
"\"Captcha for logins\" in Dashboard → Settings → Captcha for HFile to log in."
msgstr ""
"Cloudreve 登录要验证码。要由它的管理员在「仪表盘 → 参数设置 → 验证码」里关掉"
"「登录验证码」，HFile 才能登录。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid "Cloudreve refused the email or password."
msgstr "Cloudreve 不接受这个邮箱或密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#, python-format
msgid "Cloudreve says the account is blocked or not activated yet: %(message)s"
msgstr "Cloudreve 说这个账号被封禁了，或者还没激活：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#, python-format
msgid "Cloudreve refused the login: %(message)s (%(code)s)"
msgstr "Cloudreve 拒绝了登录：%(message)s（%(code)s）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s gave no token for the login."
msgstr "%(service)s 登录后没有给出令牌。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py
msgid ""
"The address has no Cloudreve v4 API (it answered HTTP 404). A Cloudreve v3 "
"site answers so: for one, choose the type Cloudreve v3. Please check the "
"address."
msgstr ""
"这个地址没有 Cloudreve v4 的接口（它回答 HTTP 404）。Cloudreve v3 的站点就是"
"这样回答的，v3 的站点请选「Cloudreve v3」类型。请检查地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py
msgid ""
"Cloudreve's web server refused an upload request as too large (HTTP 413). "
"Its administrator must raise the web server's limit on request size above "
"the storage policy's chunk size, or above the largest file when the policy "
"relays uploads."
msgstr ""
"Cloudreve 的网页服务器嫌上传的请求太大，拒绝了（HTTP 413）。要由它的管理员把"
"网页服务器对请求大小的限制调得比存储策略的分片大小更大；存储策略开了中转上传"
"时，要比最大的文件更大。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/example.py apps/storages/drivers/febbox.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py apps/storages/drivers/pan123_link.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s failed (HTTP %(status_code)s). Please try again later."
msgstr "%(service)s 出错了（HTTP %(status_code)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The answer from %(service)s couldn't be understood: is the address that of a "
"Cloudreve v4 site?"
msgstr "%(service)s 返回的数据看不懂：这个地址是 Cloudreve v4 站点吗？"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Cloudreve still says HFile isn't logged in, right after its login "
"(%(message)s). Please check the storage source's settings."
msgstr ""
"HFile 刚登录完，Cloudreve 还是说没有登录（%(message)s）。请检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#, python-format
msgid "Cloudreve doesn't accept this name: %(message)s"
msgstr "Cloudreve 不接受这个名字：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s is out of space."
msgstr "%(service)s 的空间不够了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid "The file is larger than Cloudreve's storage policy allows."
msgstr "文件超过了 Cloudreve 存储策略允许的大小。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py
msgid ""
"Cloudreve has locked the file or folder: it is open in an online editor, "
"being uploaded, or locked by a WebDAV client. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Cloudreve 锁定了这个文件或文件夹：它正在在线编辑器里打开着、正在上传，或者被 "
"WebDAV 客户端锁着。请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#, python-format
msgid "Cloudreve doesn't let this account do this: %(message)s"
msgstr "Cloudreve 不让这个账号做这个操作：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#, python-format
msgid "Cloudreve refused this: %(message)s (%(code)s)"
msgstr "Cloudreve 拒绝了这个操作：%(message)s（%(code)s）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "The base path %(base)s is a file, not a folder."
msgstr "基路径 %(base)s 是文件，不是文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/example.py apps/storages/drivers/febbox.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s gave no download address for this file."
msgstr "%(service)s 没有给出这个文件的下载地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This file is too large for HFile to upload to Cloudreve: its storage policy "
"(%(policy)s) has files sent straight to its own storage, which HFile doesn't "
"do, and Cloudreve takes them in itself only up to its \"Max size of editable "
"document files\" (Dashboard → File System → Settings). Its administrator can "
"turn on \"Upload relay\" in the storage policy's settings."
msgstr ""
"这个文件太大，HFile 传不到 Cloudreve：它的存储策略（%(policy)s）要把文件直接"
"传到存储那边，HFile 不这样传，而 Cloudreve 自己收的文件最大只到「文档在线编辑"
"最大大小」（「仪表盘 → 文件系统 → 参数设置」）。它的管理员可以在存储策略的设"
"置里打开「中转上传」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve.py apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s gave no upload session."
msgstr "%(service)s 没有给上传会话。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#, python-format
msgid "Names in %(service)s can't end with a space."
msgstr "%(service)s 的名字结尾不能是空格。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid "Cloudreve v3"
msgstr "Cloudreve v3"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid ""
"The address of the Cloudreve site, as it is opened in a browser. Cloudreve "
"3.5 or a later 3.x version; for Cloudreve v4 choose the type Cloudreve."
msgstr ""
"Cloudreve 站点的地址，就是在浏览器里打开它的那个地址。支持 Cloudreve 3.5 及以"
"后的 3.x 版本；Cloudreve v4 请选「Cloudreve」类型。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid ""
"The email address of a Cloudreve account. HFile logs in as Cloudreve's login "
"page does, which works only while its \"Captcha for logins\" is off "
"(Dashboard → Settings → Public Access), and not for accounts with two-factor "
"authentication."
msgstr ""
"Cloudreve 账号的邮箱。HFile 像 Cloudreve 的登录页那样登录，这只在它的「登录验"
"证码」关着时才行（「仪表盘 → 参数设置 → 注册与登录」），开了两步验证的账号也"
"不行。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid "Cloudreve answered the login without a session cookie."
msgstr "Cloudreve 回答了登录，却没有给出会话 Cookie。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid ""
"Cloudreve asks for a captcha to log in. Its administrator must turn off "
"\"Captcha for logins\" in Dashboard → Settings → Public Access for HFile to "
"log in."
msgstr ""
"Cloudreve 登录要验证码。要由它的管理员在「仪表盘 → 参数设置 → 注册与登录」里"
"关掉「登录验证码」，HFile 才能登录。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid ""
"The address has no Cloudreve v3 API (it answered HTTP 404). Cloudreve v4 "
"sites answer so: for them, choose the type Cloudreve. Otherwise please check "
"the address."
msgstr ""
"这个地址没有 Cloudreve v3 的接口（它回答 HTTP 404）。Cloudreve v4 的站点就是"
"这样回答的，它们要选「Cloudreve」类型；不是的话，请检查地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid ""
"Cloudreve's web server refused an upload request as too large (HTTP 413). "
"Its administrator must raise the web server's limit on request size "
"(client_max_body_size in nginx) above the chunk size of the local storage "
"policy, or above the largest file for the other storage policies."
msgstr ""
"Cloudreve 的网页服务器嫌上传的请求太大，拒绝了（HTTP 413）。要由它的管理员把"
"网页服务器对请求大小的限制（nginx 的 client_max_body_size）调大：本机存储策略"
"要比它的分片大小更大，其他存储策略要比最大的文件更大。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The answer from %(service)s couldn't be understood: is the address that of a "
"Cloudreve v3 site?"
msgstr "%(service)s 返回的数据看不懂：这个地址是 Cloudreve v3 站点吗？"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Cloudreve says HFile isn't logged in (%(message)s). Please try again; if it "
"keeps happening, check the storage source's settings."
msgstr ""
"Cloudreve 说 HFile 没有登录（%(message)s）。请再试一次；一直这样的话，请检查"
"存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid "Cloudreve's storage policy doesn't take files of this type."
msgstr "Cloudreve 的存储策略不接受这种类型的文件。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid ""
"Cloudreve is already receiving an upload of a file with this name. Please "
"try again later."
msgstr "Cloudreve 正在接收一个同名文件的上传，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#, python-format
msgid "Cloudreve did only part of this: %(message)s"
msgstr "Cloudreve 只做完了一部分：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
msgid ""
"This Cloudreve site has no upload sessions (it answered HTTP 404): they came "
"with Cloudreve 3.5, and HFile uploads to Cloudreve 3.5 or later only."
msgstr ""
"这个 Cloudreve 站点没有上传会话（它回答 HTTP 404）：上传会话是 Cloudreve 3.5 "
"才有的，HFile 只能上传到 Cloudreve 3.5 及以后的版本。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/cloudreve_v3.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The upload stopped halfway: the old file was deleted, and the new one is "
"called \"%(name)s\" now. Please rename it."
msgstr ""
"上传做到一半停下了：旧文件已经删掉，新文件现在叫「%(name)s」，请把它重命名。"

