#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
msgid "DogeCloud"
msgstr "多吉云"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
msgid "The AccessKey from DogeCloud's \"User center → Key management\"."
msgstr "多吉云「用户中心 → 密钥管理」里的 AccessKey。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
msgid "The SecretKey that goes with the AccessKey."
msgstr "和 AccessKey 配对的 SecretKey。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgctxt "Aliyun, DogeCloud"
msgid "Bucket name"
msgstr "存储空间名称"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
msgid ""
"The bucket name shown in the DogeCloud console. It must be a standard "
"bucket: in basic buckets, files can't be uploaded or managed through the "
"API. Direct uploads from the browser use addresses signed with temporary "
"keys, so DogeCloud buckets need no CORS settings."
msgstr ""
"多吉云控制台里看到的存储空间名称。必须是标准型存储空间：基础型存储空间不能通"
"过 API 上传、管理文件。浏览器直传用临时密钥签名的地址，多吉云的存储空间不用另"
"外设置跨域。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
msgid ""
"Optional. The CDN domain bound to the bucket, written as https://domain. "
"When set, download links are this domain plus the file path (unsigned; set "
"hotlink protection in the DogeCloud console); otherwise links are signed "
"with temporary keys and last about two hours at most. The storage underneath "
"is Tencent Cloud COS, whose buckets created since 2024 don't allow "
"downloading .apk and .ipa files through their default domain: newer buckets "
"may need this domain for such files, and downloads through the site may fail "
"for them."
msgstr ""
"可选。存储空间绑定的加速域名，写成 https://域名。填了以后下载链接是这个域名加"
"文件路径（不签名，防盗链在多吉云的控制台设置）；不填时用临时密钥签名的链接，"
"最长约两小时有效。多吉云底层是腾讯云 COS，2024 年起创建的 COS 存储桶不允许通"
"过默认域名下载 .apk、.ipa 文件：较新的存储空间下载这类文件可能要用这里的域"
"名，代理下载也可能失败。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
msgctxt "Aliyun, DogeCloud"
msgid "List buckets"
msgstr "列出存储空间"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Please fill in the SecretKey."
msgstr "请填写 SecretKey。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
msgid "Please fill in the SecretKey first."
msgstr "请先填写 SecretKey。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
msgid "The DogeCloud bucket list answer is missing fields."
msgstr "多吉云存储空间列表的回应缺少字段。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
msgid "This account has no buckets yet."
msgstr "这个账号还没有存储空间。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
#, python-format
msgid "Connecting to the DogeCloud API failed (%(error)s)."
msgstr "连接多吉云接口失败（%(error)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The DogeCloud API's answer couldn't be understood (HTTP %(status_code)s)."
msgstr "多吉云接口的回应看不懂（HTTP %(status_code)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"DogeCloud refused the request (%(code)s %(message)s): please check the "
"AccessKey and SecretKey."
msgstr ""
"多吉云拒绝了请求（%(code)s %(message)s）：请检查 AccessKey 和 SecretKey。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
#, python-format
msgid "The DogeCloud API failed (%(code)s %(message)s)."
msgstr "多吉云接口出错（%(code)s %(message)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
#, python-format
msgid "DogeCloud has no bucket named %(bucket)s. Please check the bucket name."
msgstr "多吉云没有叫 %(bucket)s 的存储空间，请检查存储空间名称。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dogecloud.py
msgid "The DogeCloud temporary key API's answer is missing fields."
msgstr "多吉云临时密钥接口的回应缺少字段。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid ""
"Dropbox's upload session is at another offset than expected. Please upload "
"again."
msgstr "Dropbox 上传会话的进度和预期的对不上，请重新上传。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "Dropbox"
msgstr "Dropbox"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "App key"
msgstr "App key"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid ""
"Create an app in the Dropbox App Console (www.dropbox.com/developers/apps) "
"with \"Full Dropbox\" access (\"App folder\" limits the storage to the app's "
"own folder). On its \"Permissions\" tab turn on files.metadata.read, "
"files.content.read and files.content.write and submit; on its \"Settings\" "
"tab add this site's authorization callback URL to \"Redirect URIs\" (Dropbox "
"takes https:// addresses only, or localhost). Enter the \"App key\" from the "
"\"Settings\" tab here."
msgstr ""
"在 Dropbox 的 App Console（www.dropbox.com/developers/apps）里新建一个应用，"
"访问类型选「Full Dropbox」（选「App folder」的话，存储源只能用这个应用自己的"
"文件夹）。在它的「Permissions」页勾选 files.metadata.read、"
"files.content.read 和 files.content.write，点「Submit」；在「Settings」页把本"
"站的授权回调地址加进「Redirect URIs」（Dropbox 只收 https:// 的地址，或者 "
"localhost）。这里填「Settings」页上的「App key」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "The \"App secret\" from the same \"Settings\" tab (click \"Show\")."
msgstr "同一个「Settings」页上的「App secret」（点「Show」显示）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid ""
"After saving the settings above, click \"Authorize\", log in to the Dropbox "
"account and allow access: it's filled in for you. Disconnecting the app in "
"the Dropbox account's settings ends it; just authorize again."
msgstr ""
"保存上面的设置后点「授权」，登录 Dropbox 账号并允许访问，就会自动填好。在 "
"Dropbox 账号设置里断开这个应用，令牌就失效了，重新授权即可。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid ""
"The folder in Dropbox that is this storage source's root, like / or /"
"folder1. It must already exist. On a team with a team space, paths start at "
"the team space, as on the Dropbox website: your own folder is /your name."
msgstr ""
"Dropbox 里作为这个存储源根目录的文件夹，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。这个文件夹必须已"
"经存在。团队用了团队空间的，路径从团队空间算起，和 Dropbox 网页版一样：自己的"
"文件夹是 /你的名字。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "The app key can't contain spaces."
msgstr "App key 里不能有空格。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "Fill in the app key first."
msgstr "先填 App key。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "Dropbox gave no refresh token. Please authorize again."
msgstr "Dropbox 没有给刷新令牌，请重新授权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "Fill in the app key and app secret first."
msgstr "先填 App key 和 App secret。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Dropbox's authorization service is unavailable for now (HTTP "
"%(status_code)s). Please try again later."
msgstr "Dropbox 的授权服务暂时不可用（HTTP %(status_code)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid ""
"Dropbox doesn't accept this app key or app secret (invalid_client). Please "
"check them in the storage source's settings."
msgstr ""
"Dropbox 不认这个 App key 或 App secret（invalid_client），请检查存储源设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid ""
"Dropbox's authorization has expired or been revoked (invalid_grant). Please "
"authorize again in the storage source's settings."
msgstr ""
"Dropbox 的授权已经失效或者被撤销了（invalid_grant），请在存储源设置里重新授"
"权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
#, python-format
msgid "Dropbox refused the authorization (%(code)s): %(detail)s"
msgstr "Dropbox 拒绝了授权（%(code)s）：%(detail)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
#, python-format
msgid "Dropbox refused the authorization (%(code)s)."
msgstr "Dropbox 拒绝了授权（%(code)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "Dropbox's authorization service returned no access token."
msgstr "Dropbox 的授权服务没有返回访问令牌。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid ""
"Not authorized yet: click \"Authorize\" in the storage source's settings and "
"log in to the Dropbox account."
msgstr "还没有授权：请在存储源设置里点「授权」登录 Dropbox 账号。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s returned content that couldn't be understood."
msgstr "%(service)s 返回了看不懂的内容。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "Dropbox's access token expired during the request. Please try again."
msgstr "Dropbox 的访问令牌在请求途中过期了，请再试一次。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The Dropbox app lacks the permission %(scope)s: turn it on in the "
"\"Permissions\" tab of the app in the App Console, then authorize again."
msgstr ""
"Dropbox 应用缺少 %(scope)s 权限：在 App Console 里这个应用的「Permissions」页"
"勾选它，再重新授权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s doesn't accept the current authorization%(detail)s. Please "
"authorize again in the storage source's settings."
msgstr "%(service)s 不接受现在的授权%(detail)s，请在存储源设置里重新授权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "Dropbox is busy with too many changes at once. Please try again later."
msgstr "Dropbox 同时在做的改动太多了，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "The file is too large: Dropbox takes files of at most 350 GB."
msgstr "文件太大了：Dropbox 的文件最大 350 GB。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "The %(service)s upload session has expired. Please upload again."
msgstr "%(service)s 的上传会话已经过期，请重新上传。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
#, python-format
msgid "Dropbox's upload session failed (%(code)s). Please upload again."
msgstr "Dropbox 的上传会话出错了（%(code)s），请重新上传。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid ""
"The Dropbox account's root folder has changed (it joined or left a team). "
"Please try again."
msgstr "Dropbox 账号的根目录变了（加入或者离开了团队），请再试一次。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "Dropbox has a file where a folder of this path should be."
msgstr "Dropbox 里这个路径上该是文件夹的地方是一个文件。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
#, python-format
msgid "Dropbox doesn't accept this name or path (%(code)s)."
msgstr "Dropbox 不接受这个名字或路径（%(code)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
#, python-format
msgid "The Dropbox account has no permission to change this (%(code)s)."
msgstr "这个 Dropbox 账号没有权限改动这里（%(code)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid ""
"Dropbox doesn't allow transferring this file: its content is restricted "
"(after a copyright claim, say)."
msgstr "Dropbox 不允许传输这个文件：它的内容受限（比如因为版权投诉）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid ""
"This file can't be downloaded from Dropbox as it is (a Google Docs file, "
"say)."
msgstr "这个文件不能从 Dropbox 直接下载（比如 Google 文档）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid ""
"Dropbox gives download links only to accounts with a verified email address."
msgstr "Dropbox 只给验证过邮箱的账号提供下载链接。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "The file is locked in Dropbox. Please try again later."
msgstr "这个文件在 Dropbox 里被锁定了，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid ""
"Dropbox can't do this with so many files and folders at once (a move or copy "
"takes at most 10,000)."
msgstr ""
"Dropbox 一次处理不了这么多文件和文件夹（移动或复制一次最多 10,000 个）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "Names in Dropbox can't end with a space."
msgstr "Dropbox 的名字结尾不能是空格。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py
msgid "Dropbox repeated a listing cursor. Please try again later."
msgstr "Dropbox 的分页标记重复了，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "The download address from %(service)s is wrong."
msgstr "%(service)s 给的下载地址不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/dropbox.py apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s gave no upload address."
msgstr "%(service)s 没有给上传地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid "Emby"
msgstr "Emby"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid "Emby / Jellyfin"
msgstr "Emby / Jellyfin"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid ""
"The address of the Emby or Jellyfin server, as it is opened in a browser."
msgstr "Emby 或 Jellyfin 服务器的地址，就是在浏览器里打开它的那个地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
msgid "API key"
msgstr "API 密钥"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid ""
"Instead of a username and password: an API key from the server's settings, "
"with the user's ID below."
msgstr "代替用户名和密码：服务器设置里的 API 密钥，再在下面填用户的 ID。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid "User ID"
msgstr "用户 ID"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid ""
"With an API key: the ID of the user whose libraries to show (in the address "
"of the user's page in the server's settings)."
msgstr ""
"用 API 密钥时：要显示谁的媒体库，填这个用户的 ID（在服务器设置里这个用户页面"
"的地址里）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid "Fetch files as"
msgstr "取文件的方式"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid "Original files (needs the user's download permission)"
msgstr "原始文件（用户要有下载权限）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid "Static streams (the same bytes, without the download permission)"
msgstr "静态流（内容一样，不需要下载权限）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid "How files are fetched from the server."
msgstr "从服务器取文件用哪种方式。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid ""
"The library or folder that is this storage source's root, like / or /Movies."
msgstr "哪个媒体库或文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /Movies。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid ""
"The address should start with http:// or https://, like http://"
"192.168.1.10:8096."
msgstr "地址要以 http:// 或 https:// 开头，比如 http://192.168.1.10:8096。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid "An API key needs the user's ID."
msgstr "用 API 密钥时要填用户的 ID。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid "Give the username and password, or an API key with the user's ID."
msgstr "请填写用户名和密码，或者 API 密钥和用户 ID。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid "The media server refused the username or password."
msgstr "媒体服务器不接受这个用户名或密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
#, python-format
msgid "The media server failed (HTTP %(status)s). Please try again later."
msgstr "媒体服务器出错了（HTTP %(status)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid ""
"The media server refused the access token or API key. Please check the "
"storage source's settings."
msgstr "媒体服务器不接受这个访问令牌或 API 密钥，请检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The media server doesn't know this user (HTTP %(status)s): the user ID, or "
"the address, is wrong. Please check the storage source's settings."
msgstr ""
"媒体服务器不认识这个用户（HTTP %(status)s）：用户 ID 或者地址填错了。请检查存"
"储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/emby.py
msgid ""
"The media server refused the download: the user may lack the permission to "
"download media (or choose static streams in the settings)."
msgstr ""
"媒体服务器拒绝了下载：这个用户可能没有下载媒体的权限（也可以在设置里改用静态"
"流）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/example.py
msgid "Example Drive"
msgstr "示例网盘"

#: apps/storages/drivers/example.py
msgid "The address of the Example Drive server, as it is opened in a browser."
msgstr "示例网盘服务器的地址，就是在浏览器里打开它的那个地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/example.py
msgid ""
"Made on the server's settings page (Settings → API tokens), allowed to read "
"and write."
msgstr "在服务器的设置页面（「设置 → API Token」）里新建，要允许读和写。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/example.py apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid ""
"The folder of the server that is this storage source's root, like / or /"
"folder1."
msgstr "那个服务器上的哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/example.py apps/storages/drivers/febbox.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s refused this (%(code)s): %(message)s"
msgstr "%(service)s 拒绝了这个操作（%(code)s）：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/febbox.py
msgid "FebBox"
msgstr "FebBox"

#: apps/storages/drivers/febbox.py apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "客户端 ID"

#: apps/storages/drivers/febbox.py
msgid ""
"On FebBox's \"Secret Key\" page (https://www.febbox.com/open/clients), "
"generate a key: any app name will do, and http://localhost as its redirect "
"URI, which HFile doesn't use. Enter the key's client_id here; the page shows "
"it below client_secret. HFile shows the files of the FebBox account that "
"generated the key."
msgstr ""
"在 FebBox 的「Secret Key」页面（https://www.febbox.com/open/clients）生成一个"
"密钥：应用名称随便填，重定向 URI 填 http://localhost，HFile 用不到它。这里填"
"这个密钥的 client_id，页面上它在 client_secret 下面。HFile 显示的是生成这个密"
"钥的 FebBox 账号里的文件。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/febbox.py apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid "Client secret"
msgstr "客户端密钥"

#: apps/storages/drivers/febbox.py
msgid "The client_secret of the same key."
msgstr "同一个密钥的 client_secret。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/febbox.py
msgid ""
"The folder in FebBox that is this storage source's root, like / or /folder1."
msgstr "FebBox 里哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/febbox.py apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid "Please fill in the client ID and client secret first."
msgstr "请先填写客户端 ID 和客户端密钥。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/febbox.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"FebBox refused the client ID or secret%(detail)s. Please check them on "
"FebBox's \"Secret Key\" page (https://www.febbox.com/open/clients), which "
"lists client_secret above client_id."
msgstr ""
"FebBox 不接受这个客户端 ID 或密钥%(detail)s。请到 FebBox 的「Secret Key」页面"
"（https://www.febbox.com/open/clients）核对一下，那里 client_secret 列在 "
"client_id 上面。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/febbox.py
msgid ""
"FebBox's open platform can't upload files: upload them in FebBox's apps or "
"on its website."
msgstr "FebBox 开放平台不能上传文件：请在 FebBox 的应用或网站上传。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/febbox.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s didn't confirm the new folder. Please refresh to see whether it "
"is there."
msgstr "%(service)s 没有确认新文件夹，请刷新看看它是否已经建好。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "UTF-8 (recommended)"
msgstr "UTF-8（推荐）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "GBK (Simplified Chinese)"
msgstr "GBK（简体中文）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "GB18030 (Simplified Chinese)"
msgstr "GB18030（简体中文）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "Big5 (Traditional Chinese)"
msgstr "Big5（繁体中文）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "Shift_JIS (Japanese)"
msgstr "Shift_JIS（日文）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "EUC-KR (Korean)"
msgstr "EUC-KR（韩文）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "ISO-8859-1 (Western European)"
msgstr "ISO-8859-1（西欧）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "No encryption"
msgstr "不加密"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "Explicit FTPS (AUTH TLS, usually port 21)"
msgstr "显式 FTPS（AUTH TLS，一般用 21 端口）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "Implicit FTPS (usually port 990)"
msgstr "隐式 FTPS（一般用 990 端口）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid ""
"A line of the FTP server's file list couldn't be read, so to be safe nothing "
"in this folder was deleted."
msgstr ""
"FTP 服务器的文件列表里有一行认不出来，为了安全，这个文件夹里的东西一个都没有"
"删。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "The FTP server ended the transfer early."
msgstr "FTP 服务器提前结束了传输。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "The FTP server ended the transfer early; the file may be cut short."
msgstr "FTP 服务器提前结束了传输，文件可能变短了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "Server address"
msgstr "服务器地址"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "The FTP server's domain or IP, without ftp://."
msgstr "FTP 服务器的域名或 IP，不带 ftp://。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "Usually 21; 990 for implicit FTPS."
msgstr "一般是 21；隐式 FTPS 一般是 990。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "Leave empty to log in anonymously (anonymous)."
msgstr "不填就匿名登录（anonymous）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid ""
"The folder on the FTP server that is the storage's root, like / or /pub/"
"files."
msgstr "FTP 服务器上的哪个文件夹作为存储的根目录，例如 / 或 /pub/files。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "File name encoding"
msgstr "文件名编码"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid ""
"The encoding of file names on the server, not of the files' contents. Older "
"Chinese Windows FTP servers usually use GBK."
msgstr ""
"服务器上文件名的编码，不是文件内容的编码。较老的中文 Windows FTP 服务器一般"
"是 GBK。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "Passive mode"
msgstr "被动模式"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid ""
"Passive mode is the usual one. Active mode needs the FTP server to connect "
"back to the machine this program runs on, which usually doesn't work behind "
"a firewall or NAT."
msgstr ""
"一般都用被动模式。主动模式要 FTP 服务器能反过来连到本程序所在的机器，在防火墙"
"或 NAT 后面通常用不了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "Encryption (FTPS)"
msgstr "加密（FTPS）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid ""
"Turn it on when the server supports FTPS; otherwise passwords and files "
"travel in plain text."
msgstr "服务器支持 FTPS 时建议打开，否则密码和文件都是明文传输。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "Verify the server certificate"
msgstr "校验服务器证书"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid ""
"Verifies the server's certificate with FTPS. It can be turned off for a self-"
"signed certificate, but then someone could pose as the server."
msgstr ""
"用 FTPS 时校验服务器的证书。服务器用自签名证书时可以关掉，但这样连接可能被人"
"冒充。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "Resumable transfers (REST)"
msgstr "支持断点续传（REST）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid ""
"When on, videos can be seeked and downloads resumed or split. Turn it off "
"for the rare servers without REST."
msgstr ""
"打开后能拖动视频进度、断点续传和多线程下载。极少数不支持 REST 的服务器要关"
"掉。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "Max connections"
msgstr "最大连接数"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid ""
"The most connections to the server at once; keep it below what the server "
"allows per user (or per IP). Each download in progress takes one connection."
msgstr ""
"同时连到服务器的连接数上限，要小于服务器允许每个用户（或每个 IP）的连接数。每"
"个正在进行的下载占用一个连接。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid ""
"All connections to the FTP server are in use (downloads hold theirs until "
"done). Please try again later, or raise \"Max connections\"."
msgstr ""
"FTP 服务器的连接都在使用中（下载会一直占着连接），请稍后再试，或者调大「最大"
"连接数」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "Please fill in the server address."
msgstr "请填写服务器地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "Only the domain or IP, like ftp.example.com, without ftp:// or a path."
msgstr "只填域名或 IP，例如 ftp.example.com，不要带 ftp:// 或路径。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "The port is a number from 1 to 65535."
msgstr "端口是 1 到 65535 之间的数字。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "This encoding isn't supported."
msgstr "不支持这种编码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "Please choose an encryption mode."
msgstr "请选择一种加密方式。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "It can't contain line breaks."
msgstr "不能有换行符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "The FTP storage has no server address set."
msgstr "FTP 存储没有设置服务器地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid ""
"The FTP storage's base path is set wrong. Please ask the administrator to "
"check the storage source's settings."
msgstr "FTP 存储的基路径设置得不对，请管理员检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"FTP login failed: wrong username or password. (The server answered: "
"%(reply)s)"
msgstr "FTP 登录失败：用户名或密码不对。（服务器回答：%(reply)s）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The FTP server's certificate didn't pass verification. If the server uses a "
"self-signed certificate, you can turn off \"Verify the server certificate\" "
"in the storage source's \"More settings\". (%(verify_message)s)"
msgstr ""
"FTP 服务器的证书没通过校验。如果服务器用的是自签名证书，可以在存储源的「更多"
"设置」里关掉「校验服务器证书」。（%(verify_message)s）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "The FTP server refused the connection: %(reply)s"
msgstr "FTP 服务器拒绝了连接：%(reply)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid ""
"The FTP server sent text that isn't in the chosen encoding. Please check the "
"storage source's \"File name encoding\"."
msgstr "FTP 服务器发来的文字不是所选的编码，请检查存储源的「文件名编码」设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "Couldn't connect to the FTP server %(host)s:%(port)s: %(error)s"
msgstr "连不上 FTP 服务器 %(host)s:%(port)s：%(error)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "The FTP server wants a new login: %(text)s"
msgstr "FTP 服务器要求重新登录：%(text)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "The FTP server is out of space: %(text)s"
msgstr "FTP 服务器的空间不够了：%(text)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "The FTP server doesn't accept this name: %(text)s"
msgstr "FTP 服务器不接受这个名字：%(text)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "The FTP server refused this: %(text)s"
msgstr "FTP 服务器拒绝了这个操作：%(text)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "The FTP server can't do this for now: %(text)s"
msgstr "FTP 服务器暂时没法完成这个操作：%(text)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "The FTP server's answer is wrong: %(reply)s"
msgstr "FTP 服务器的回答不对：%(reply)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "The name has characters the chosen encoding can't represent."
msgstr "名字里有所选编码表示不了的字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "The encrypted connection to the FTP server failed: %(error)s"
msgstr "和 FTP 服务器的加密连接出错了：%(error)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "The connection to the FTP server failed: %(error)s"
msgstr "和 FTP 服务器的连接出错了：%(error)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "Names in FTP storage can't contain \\."
msgstr "FTP 存储的名字里不能有 \\。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "FTP file names can't contain line breaks."
msgstr "FTP 的文件名里不能有换行符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "The name has characters %(encoding)s can't represent."
msgstr "名字里有 %(encoding)s 编码表示不了的字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "This folder's listing is too large."
msgstr "这个文件夹的列表太大了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid ""
"The base path set doesn't exist on the FTP server. Please ask the "
"administrator to check the storage source's settings."
msgstr "FTP 服务器上没有设置的基路径，请管理员检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The old file was deleted, but the new one couldn't take the original name; "
"it is now called \"%(spare_name)s\"."
msgstr "旧文件已经删掉了，新文件没能改回原来的名字，现在叫「%(spare_name)s」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/local.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
#, python-format
msgid "The uploaded data is incomplete: %(missing)s byte missing."
msgid_plural "The uploaded data is incomplete: %(missing)s bytes missing."
msgstr[0] "上传的数据不完整：少了 %(missing)s 字节。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(name)s\" is a file, not a folder."
msgstr "「%(name)s」是文件，不是文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/local.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "This is the storage's root folder."
msgstr "这里是存储的根文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/local.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Names starting with %(prefix)s are for the program's own use. Please choose "
"another name."
msgstr "以 %(prefix)s 开头的名字是程序内部用的，请换一个名字。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/local.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "There is already a folder with that name there."
msgstr "那里已经有一个同名的文件夹了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid ""
"This item couldn't be recognized in the FTP server's file list, so to be "
"safe it wasn't deleted."
msgstr "没能在 FTP 服务器的文件列表里认出这一项，为了安全没有删除它。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py
msgid "The FTP server couldn't list the folder to delete."
msgstr "FTP 服务器没能列出要删除的文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/local.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The storage's root folder can't be deleted."
msgstr "不能删除存储的根文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/local.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The storage's root folder can't be renamed."
msgstr "不能重命名存储的根文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ftp.py apps/storages/drivers/local.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The storage's root folder can't be moved."
msgstr "不能移动存储的根文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid "GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
#, python-format
msgid "Line %(line)s: write owner/repo, or folder/path:owner/repo."
msgstr "第 %(line)s 行：请写成 所有者/仓库，或者 文件夹/路径:所有者/仓库。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
#, python-format
msgid "Line %(line)s: the folder is wrong: %(message)s"
msgstr "第 %(line)s 行：文件夹不对：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
#, python-format
msgid "Line %(line)s: %(path)s already has a repository."
msgstr "第 %(line)s 行：%(path)s 已经有一个仓库了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
msgid "Give at least one repository."
msgstr "请至少填一个仓库。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
msgid "GitHub Releases"
msgstr "GitHub Releases"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
msgid ""
"One per line: owner/repo shows the repository at the root, folder/path:owner/"
"repo in that folder."
msgstr ""
"一行一个：写 所有者/仓库 显示在根目录，写 文件夹/路径:所有者/仓库 显示在那个"
"文件夹里。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
msgid ""
"Optional: a GitHub personal access token (https://github.com/settings/"
"tokens), for private repositories, and 5,000 requests an hour instead of 60. "
"Read access to the repositories' contents is enough."
msgstr ""
"选填：GitHub 的个人访问令牌（https://github.com/settings/tokens），用来访问私"
"有仓库，并且每小时能请求 5000 次，而不是 60 次。只要仓库内容的读权限就够了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
msgid "Download mirror"
msgstr "下载镜像"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
msgid ""
"Optional, for files of public repositories: a GitHub mirror that download "
"links go through instead of https://github.com, for places where GitHub is "
"slow."
msgstr ""
"选填，用于公开仓库的文件：下载链接改走这个 GitHub 镜像，而不是 https://"
"github.com，适合访问 GitHub 慢的地方。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
msgid "The download mirror should be an http:// or https:// address."
msgstr "下载镜像要写 http:// 或 https:// 开头的地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"GitHub's rate limit for this token is used up until %(time)s (UTC). Please "
"try again then."
msgstr "这个 Token 的 GitHub 请求次数用完了，%(time)s（UTC）恢复，请到时再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"GitHub's rate limit is reached until %(time)s (UTC). A token raises it from "
"60 to 5,000 requests an hour."
msgstr ""
"GitHub 的请求次数用完了，%(time)s（UTC）恢复。填了 Token 以后，每小时的次数"
"从 60 次提高到 5000 次。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"GitHub is holding back the requests of this storage for now. Please try "
"again in %(seconds)s seconds."
msgstr "GitHub 暂时限制了这个存储的请求，请 %(seconds)s 秒后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid ""
"GitHub refused the token. Please check it in the storage source's settings."
msgstr "GitHub 拒绝了这个 Token，请在存储源设置里检查一下。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The repository %(repo)s doesn't exist, or it is private: that needs a token "
"that can see it."
msgstr "仓库 %(repo)s 不存在，或者是私有仓库：要填一个能看到它的 Token。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
#, python-format
msgid "GitHub failed%(detail)s. Please try again later."
msgstr "GitHub 出错了%(detail)s，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_releases.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid "The answer from GitHub couldn't be understood. Please try again later."
msgstr "GitHub 返回的数据看不懂，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid "GitHub repository"
msgstr "GitHub 仓库"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid "Repository owner"
msgstr "仓库所有者"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid ""
"The user or organization the repository belongs to: the first part of "
"github.com/owner/repository."
msgstr "仓库所属的用户或组织：github.com/所有者/仓库 的第一段。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid "Repository"
msgstr "仓库"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid "The repository's name: the second part of github.com/owner/repository."
msgstr "仓库的名字：github.com/所有者/仓库 的第二段。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid ""
"A personal access token of a GitHub account that may push to the repository. "
"A fine-grained one (https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new): "
"give it this repository, with the repository permission Contents set to Read "
"and write; with Read-only the storage can only be read, and changes are "
"refused. A classic one (https://github.com/settings/tokens): the repo scope."
msgstr ""
"能推送到这个仓库的 GitHub 账号的个人访问令牌。细粒度令牌（https://github.com/"
"settings/personal-access-tokens/new）：仓库选上这个仓库，仓库权限「Contents」"
"选「Read and write」；选「Read-only」时这个存储只能读，改动都会被拒绝。经典令"
"牌（https://github.com/settings/tokens）：勾选 repo。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid "Branch"
msgstr "分支"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid ""
"The branch shown and changed; every change is a commit on it. Empty: the "
"repository's default branch."
msgstr ""
"显示和修改的分支，每次改动都是它上面的一次提交。留空时用仓库的默认分支。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid ""
"The folder of the repository that is this storage source's root, like / or /"
"folder1. It must already exist."
msgstr ""
"仓库里哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。这个文件夹必须已"
"经存在。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid "API address"
msgstr "API 地址"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid ""
"Only for GitHub Enterprise Server: its REST API address, like https://"
"github.example.com/api/v3. Empty: GitHub.com. Files of GitHub Enterprise "
"Server are always downloaded through this site."
msgstr ""
"只有 GitHub Enterprise Server 要填：它的 REST API 地址，例如 https://"
"github.example.com/api/v3。留空时是 GitHub.com。GitHub Enterprise Server 上的"
"文件都经过本站下载。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid ""
"The owner is a GitHub user or organization name, as in github.com/owner/"
"repository."
msgstr ""
"所有者是 GitHub 的用户名或组织名，就是 github.com/所有者/仓库 里的那一段。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid ""
"The repository is its name as in github.com/owner/repository, without .git."
msgstr "仓库填它的名字，就是 github.com/所有者/仓库 里的那一段，不带 .git。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid ""
"The API address should start with http:// or https://, like https://"
"github.example.com/api/v3."
msgstr ""
"API 地址要以 http:// 或 https:// 开头，比如 https://github.example.com/api/"
"v3。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"GitHub says the repository %(repo)s has moved (renamed or transferred): "
"please put its new owner and name in the storage source's settings."
msgstr ""
"GitHub 说仓库 %(repo)s 已经搬走了（改了名或者转给了别人），请在存储源设置里改"
"成新的所有者和仓库名。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid ""
"GitHub didn't let the token do this. A fine-grained token needs access to "
"this repository with the Contents permission set to Read and write (Read-"
"only can only read), and Workflows too for files in .github/workflows; a "
"classic token needs the repo scope, and workflow for those files."
msgstr ""
"GitHub 不让这个 Token 这样做。细粒度令牌要能访问这个仓库，「Contents」权限选"
"「Read and write」（选「Read-only」只能读），改 .github/workflows 里的文件还"
"要「Workflows」权限；经典令牌要勾选 repo，改那些文件还要勾选 workflow。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The repository %(repo)s is empty, or GitHub is still making it: give it a "
"first commit on GitHub (a README, say), then try again."
msgstr ""
"仓库 %(repo)s 是空的，或者 GitHub 还在创建它：请先在 GitHub 上给它做一次提交"
"（比如加一个 README），再试一次。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
#, python-format
msgid "GitHub refused this: %(message)s"
msgstr "GitHub 拒绝了这个操作：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
#, python-format
msgid "The repository %(repo)s has no branch %(branch)s."
msgstr "仓库 %(repo)s 里没有 %(branch)s 分支。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"GitHub gives only a part of the folder %(path)s: it holds too many entries."
msgstr "GitHub 只给出了文件夹 %(path)s 的一部分：里面的东西太多了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
#, python-format
msgid "The branch %(branch)s of %(repo)s has no folder %(path)s."
msgstr "%(repo)s 的 %(branch)s 分支里没有文件夹 %(path)s。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\"%(name)s\" is kept for the empty folders of this storage; please choose "
"another name."
msgstr "「%(name)s」留给这个存储的空文件夹用了，请换一个名字。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
#, python-format
msgid "Git doesn't allow a file or folder named \"%(name)s\"."
msgstr "Git 不允许文件或文件夹叫「%(name)s」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
msgid ""
"The branch kept changing while this change was being saved. Please try again."
msgstr "保存这次改动时分支一直在变，请再试一次。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/github_repo.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"GitHub takes no files over %(limit)s MB in a repository; this one is "
"%(size)s MB."
msgstr "GitHub 仓库里不能放超过 %(limit)s MB 的文件，这个文件有 %(size)s MB。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"Google refused the access token. Please authorize again in the storage "
"source's settings."
msgstr "Google 拒绝了访问令牌，请在存储源设置里重新授权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"Too many requests: Google Drive is rate-limiting them. Please try again "
"later."
msgstr "请求太频繁，被 Google Drive 限流了，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"The Google Drive API quota is used up. Please try again later, or raise the "
"quota in the Google Cloud console."
msgstr ""
"Google Drive API 的配额用完了，请稍后再试，或在 Google Cloud 控制台提高配额。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "Google Drive is out of space."
msgstr "Google Drive 的空间不够了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The Google Drive API isn't enabled in the Google Cloud project of this "
"client ID. Enable it at %(url)s, wait a few minutes, then try again."
msgstr ""
"这个客户端 ID 所在的 Google Cloud 项目没有启用 Google Drive API：请在 "
"%(url)s 启用，等几分钟再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"This Google document is too large to export: Google only exports documents "
"up to 10 MB."
msgstr "这个 Google 文档太大，导出不了：Google 只能导出 10 MB 以内的文档。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"Google considers this file possibly harmful and doesn't allow downloading it."
msgstr "Google 认为这个文件可能有害，不让下载。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#, python-format
msgid "Permission denied: Google Drive refused this (%(reason)s). %(detail)s"
msgstr "没有权限：Google Drive 拒绝了这个操作（%(reason)s）。%(detail)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#, python-format
msgid "Permission denied: Google Drive refused this (%(reason)s)."
msgstr "没有权限：Google Drive 拒绝了这个操作（%(reason)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#, python-format
msgid "Google Drive failed (HTTP %(status)s). Please try again later."
msgstr "Google Drive 出错了（HTTP %(status)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#, python-format
msgid "Google Drive refused the request (%(code)s): %(detail)s"
msgstr "Google Drive 拒绝了这个请求（%(code)s）：%(detail)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#, python-format
msgid "Google Drive refused the request (%(code)s)."
msgstr "Google Drive 拒绝了这个请求（%(code)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"In the Google Cloud console (console.cloud.google.com): enable the Google "
"Drive API, create an \"OAuth client ID\" of type \"Web application\" in "
"\"APIs & Services → Credentials\", add this site's authorization callback "
"URL to its \"Authorized redirect URIs\", then enter its client ID here."
msgstr ""
"在 Google Cloud 控制台（console.cloud.google.com）里：启用 Google Drive API，"
"在「API 和服务 → 凭据」创建「OAuth 客户端 ID」，类型选「Web 应用」，把本站的"
"授权回调地址加进「已获授权的重定向 URI」，然后填这里的客户端 ID。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "The client secret of the same OAuth client."
msgstr "同一个 OAuth 客户端的客户端密钥。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"With the client ID and secret filled in, click \"Authorize\", log in to the "
"Google account and agree: it's filled in for you. For apps whose OAuth "
"consent screen is still \"Testing\", Google's refresh tokens expire after 7 "
"days, so publish the app to \"In production\"."
msgstr ""
"填好客户端 ID 和密钥后点「授权」，登录 Google 账号并同意，会自动填写。OAuth "
"同意屏幕还处于「测试」状态的应用，Google 给的刷新令牌 7 天后失效，请把应用发"
"布为「正式版」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "Shared drive"
msgstr "共享云端硬盘"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"Leave empty for \"My Drive\". For a shared drive, authorize, then click "
"\"List shared drives\" and choose one."
msgstr ""
"留空用「我的云端硬盘」。要用共享云端硬盘，授权后点「列出共享云端硬盘」选一"
"个。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"The folder in the drive that is this storage source's root, like / or /"
"folder1."
msgstr "云端硬盘里哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "Show shortcuts pointing outside the base path"
msgstr "显示指向基路径之外的快捷方式"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"Google Drive shortcuts can point anywhere. By default only shortcuts into "
"the base path are shown, like symbolic links in local storage; when on, "
"those pointing elsewhere (folders in \"Shared with me\", say) are shown too, "
"and through them files outside the base path can be seen, uploaded and "
"deleted."
msgstr ""
"Google Drive 的快捷方式可以指向任何地方。默认只显示指向基路径以内的快捷方式，"
"就像本地存储的符号链接；打开后也显示指向别处的（例如「与我共享」里的文件"
"夹），通过它们能看到、上传和删除基路径以外的文件。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "List shared drives"
msgstr "列出共享云端硬盘"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "The client ID can't contain spaces."
msgstr "客户端 ID 里不能有空格。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"A shared drive ID can only have letters, digits, - and _. Please choose one "
"with \"List shared drives\"."
msgstr ""
"共享云端硬盘的 ID 只能有字母、数字、- 和 _，请点「列出共享云端硬盘」选择。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"Google gave no refresh token: remove this app in the Google account's "
"\"Third-party apps & services\", then authorize again."
msgstr ""
"Google 没有给刷新令牌：请在 Google 账号的「第三方应用和服务」里移除这个应用，"
"再重新授权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"Please click \"Authorize\" and log in to the Google account before listing "
"shared drives."
msgstr "请先点「授权」登录 Google 账号，再列出共享云端硬盘。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "My Drive"
msgstr "我的云端硬盘"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "The shared drive list from Google Drive is wrong."
msgstr "Google Drive 返回的共享云端硬盘列表不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "This account has no shared drives."
msgstr "这个账号没有共享云端硬盘。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Google's authorization service is unavailable for now (HTTP "
"%(status_code)s). Please try again later."
msgstr "Google 的授权服务暂时不可用（HTTP %(status_code)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"Google doesn't recognize this client ID or client secret (invalid_client). "
"Please check the storage source's settings."
msgstr ""
"Google 不认这个客户端 ID 或客户端密钥（invalid_client），请检查存储源设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"Google's authorization has expired or been revoked (invalid_grant). Please "
"authorize again in the storage source's settings."
msgstr ""
"Google 的授权已经失效或者被撤销了（invalid_grant），请在存储源设置里重新授"
"权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#, python-format
msgid "Google refused the authorization (%(code)s): %(detail)s"
msgstr "Google 拒绝了授权（%(code)s）：%(detail)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#, python-format
msgid "Google refused the authorization (%(code)s)."
msgstr "Google 拒绝了授权（%(code)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "Google's authorization service returned no access token."
msgstr "Google 的授权服务没有返回访问令牌。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"Not authorized yet: click \"Authorize\" in the storage source's settings and "
"log in to the Google account."
msgstr "还没有授权：请在存储源设置里点「授权」登录 Google 账号。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "The data from Google Drive is wrong."
msgstr "Google Drive 返回的数据不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "The file list from Google Drive is wrong."
msgstr "Google Drive 返回的文件列表不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "Google Drive repeated a page token. Please try again later."
msgstr "Google Drive 的分页标记重复了，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "The shared drive wasn't found, or this account has no permission on it."
msgstr "找不到这个共享云端硬盘，或者这个账号没有权限。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "The root folder from Google Drive is wrong."
msgstr "Google Drive 返回的根目录不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#, python-format
msgid "The base path %(base)s doesn't exist in Google Drive."
msgstr "基路径 %(base)s 在 Google Drive 里不存在。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#, python-format
msgid "The base path %(base)s isn't a folder."
msgstr "基路径 %(base)s 不是文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(path)s isn't a folder."
msgstr "%(path)s 不是文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "The data Google Drive returned for the new folder is wrong."
msgstr "Google Drive 新建文件夹后返回的数据不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "The shortcut target from Google Drive is wrong."
msgstr "Google Drive 返回的快捷方式目标不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "Uploading to Google Drive failed. Please try again later."
msgstr "Google Drive 上传失败，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "The Google Drive upload session has expired. Please upload again."
msgstr "Google Drive 的上传会话已经过期，请重新上传。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "The upload progress from Google Drive is wrong."
msgstr "Google Drive 返回的上传进度不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "The Google Drive upload progress doesn't match. Please upload again."
msgstr "Google Drive 的上传进度对不上，请重新上传。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "Google Drive isn't taking the uploaded data. Please try again later."
msgstr "Google Drive 不接收上传的数据，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "Google Drive gave no upload address."
msgstr "Google Drive 没有给出上传地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "Google Drive didn't confirm the upload finished."
msgstr "Google Drive 没有确认上传完成。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "Google Drive ended the upload early."
msgstr "Google Drive 提前结束了上传。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid ""
"This is a Google Docs, Sheets or Slides file and can't be overwritten by an "
"upload."
msgstr "这是 Google 文档、表格或幻灯片这类文件，不能用上传覆盖。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "This is a Google Drive shortcut and can't be overwritten by an upload."
msgstr "这是 Google Drive 的快捷方式，不能用上传覆盖。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This is a Google Docs, Sheets or Slides file, listed with the extension of "
"the format it downloads in: the new name has to end in %(extension)s too."
msgstr ""
"这是 Google 文档、表格或幻灯片这类文件，显示时带着下载格式的扩展名：新名字也"
"要以 %(extension)s 结尾。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "The data Google Drive returned for the copy is wrong."
msgstr "Google Drive 复制后返回的数据不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/google.py
msgid "The folders are nested too deep to copy."
msgstr "文件夹嵌套太深，复制不了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/http.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(host)s is an address inside this site's own network: a server on the "
"Internet can't send this site there."
msgstr "%(host)s 是本站所在网络里的地址：互联网上的服务器不能把本站引到那里。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ipfs.py
msgid "IPFS"
msgstr "IPFS"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ipfs.py
msgid "IPFS (MFS)"
msgstr "IPFS（MFS）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ipfs.py
msgid "RPC API address"
msgstr "RPC API 地址"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ipfs.py
msgid ""
"The Kubo node's RPC API (port 5001 by default). It controls the whole node: "
"don't make it reachable from the internet."
msgstr ""
"Kubo 节点的 RPC API（默认端口 5001）。它能控制整个节点，不要让它能从互联网访"
"问。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ipfs.py
msgid ""
"For a node whose RPC API asks for one (API.Authorizations): sent as "
"Authorization: Bearer."
msgstr ""
"用于要求令牌的节点（API.Authorizations）：以 Authorization: Bearer 发送。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ipfs.py
msgid "Gateway"
msgstr "网关"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ipfs.py
msgid ""
"Optional: an IPFS HTTP gateway that browsers can reach. Downloads then go "
"there, by the file's CID, which anyone who knows it can open."
msgstr ""
"选填：浏览器能访问的 IPFS HTTP 网关。填了以后下载走网关，按文件的 CID 下载，"
"知道 CID 的人都能打开。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ipfs.py
msgid "The MFS folder that is this storage source's root, like / or /folder1."
msgstr "MFS 里的哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ipfs.py
msgid ""
"The address should start with http:// or https://, like http://"
"127.0.0.1:5001."
msgstr "地址要以 http:// 或 https:// 开头，比如 http://127.0.0.1:5001。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ipfs.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The IPFS node refused the request (HTTP %(status)s): check the token, or the "
"node's API.Authorizations."
msgstr ""
"IPFS 节点拒绝了请求（HTTP %(status)s）：请检查令牌，或者节点的 "
"API.Authorizations。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ipfs.py
msgid "The address isn't an IPFS node's RPC API (HTTP 404)."
msgstr "这个地址不是 IPFS 节点的 RPC API（HTTP 404）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ipfs.py
#, python-format
msgid "The IPFS node failed (HTTP %(status)s). Please try again later."
msgstr "IPFS 节点出错了（HTTP %(status)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/ipfs.py
#, python-format
msgid "The IPFS node refused this: %(message)s"
msgstr "IPFS 节点拒绝了这个操作：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
msgid "KodBox"
msgstr "可道云"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
msgid "The address of the KodBox site, as it is opened in a browser."
msgstr "可道云站点的地址，就是在浏览器里打开它的那个地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
msgid ""
"An account of that site. HFile logs in as its login page does, which works "
"only while KodBox's login captcha is off: its administrator turns off \"Need "
"verification\" in System settings → Security."
msgstr ""
"那个站点上的账号。HFile 像它的登录页那样登录，这只在可道云的登录验证码关着时"
"才行：要由它的管理员在「系统设置 → 安全设置」里关掉「登录验证码开启」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
msgid ""
"The address should start with http:// or https://, like https://"
"kod.example.com."
msgstr "地址要以 http:// 或 https:// 开头，比如 https://kod.example.com。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
msgid ""
"KodBox asks for a captcha to log in. Its administrator must turn off \"Need "
"verification\" in System settings → Security for HFile to log in."
msgstr ""
"可道云登录要验证码。要由它的管理员在「系统设置 → 安全设置」里关掉「登录验证码"
"开启」，HFile 才能登录。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
#, python-format
msgid "KodBox says the account is disabled or not enabled yet: %(message)s"
msgstr "可道云说这个账号被禁用了，或者还没启用：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
#, python-format
msgid "KodBox refused the login: %(message)s"
msgstr "可道云拒绝了登录：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
msgid ""
"KodBox's web server refused an upload request as too large (HTTP 413). Its "
"administrator must make the web server's limit larger than KodBox's upload "
"chunk size (System settings → Basic → Upload Download)."
msgstr ""
"可道云的网页服务器嫌上传的请求太大，拒绝了（HTTP 413）。要由它的管理员把网页"
"服务器的限制调得比可道云的上传分片大小（「系统设置 → 基础设置 → 上传/下载」）"
"更大。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The answer from %(service)s couldn't be understood: is the address that of a "
"KodBox site?"
msgstr "%(service)s 返回的数据看不懂：这个地址是可道云站点吗？"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
msgid "The KodBox login expired during the upload. Please try again."
msgstr "可道云的登录在上传途中过期了，请再试一次。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"KodBox still says HFile isn't logged in, right after its login "
"(%(message)s). Please check the storage source's settings."
msgstr ""
"HFile 刚登录完，可道云还是说没有登录（%(message)s）。请检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"KodBox signed the account out: it is disabled, or logged in elsewhere "
"(%(message)s)."
msgstr ""
"可道云让这个账号退出了登录：账号被禁用了，或者在别处登录了（%(message)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
#, python-format
msgid "KodBox doesn't accept this name: %(message)s"
msgstr "可道云不接受这个名字：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
#, python-format
msgid "KodBox doesn't let this account do this: %(message)s"
msgstr "可道云不让这个账号做这个操作：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
msgid ""
"KodBox's PHP refused a part of the upload as too large. Its administrator "
"must make PHP's upload_max_filesize larger than KodBox's upload chunk size "
"(System settings → Basic → Upload Download)."
msgstr ""
"可道云的 PHP 嫌上传的一个分片太大，拒绝了。要由它的管理员把 PHP 的 "
"upload_max_filesize 调得比可道云的上传分片大小（「系统设置 → 基础设置 → 上传/"
"下载」）更大。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
#, python-format
msgid "KodBox refused this: %(message)s"
msgstr "可道云拒绝了这个操作：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
msgid ""
"KodBox can't keep characters such as emoji in names: unless its database "
"uses utf8mb4, it stores them as \"-\". Please use another name."
msgstr ""
"可道云的名字里放不了表情符号这类字符：除非它的数据库用 utf8mb4，否则会存成"
"「-」。请换一个名字。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"KodBox leaves \"%(name)s\" out of its listings (names starting with . or ~, "
"and the hidden names its administrator set), so it would vanish here. To use "
"such names, turn on \"Show hidden files\" in the KodBox account's settings."
msgstr ""
"可道云的文件列表不列出「%(name)s」（以 . 或 ~ 开头的名字，以及它的管理员设的"
"隐藏文件名），所以它在这里会看不到。要用这样的名字，请在可道云账号的设置里打"
"开「显示隐藏文件」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/kodbox.py
#, python-format
msgid "KodBox stored the file as \"%(stored)s\", not as \"%(name)s\"."
msgstr "可道云把文件存成了「%(stored)s」，而不是「%(name)s」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
msgid "Lenovo NAS"
msgstr "联想 NAS"

#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
msgid "Lenovo NAS share link"
msgstr "联想 NAS 分享"

#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
msgid "Share link or ID"
msgstr "分享链接或 ID"

#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
msgid "The share's link, or the part after #/ in it."
msgstr "分享链接，或者链接里 #/ 后面的那段。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid "Share password"
msgstr "分享密码"

#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
msgid "The extraction code that comes with the link."
msgstr "和分享链接一起给出的提取码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
msgid ""
"Lenovo's share server. A Lenovo device may serve the same at its address on "
"the local network, like http://192.168.1.10 (untested)."
msgstr ""
"联想的分享服务器。联想设备在局域网里的地址也许也能用，比如 http://"
"192.168.1.10（没有试过）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
msgid ""
"This link has the extraction code in it. Please give the link without it, "
"and the code as the share password."
msgstr "这个链接里带着提取码。请填不带提取码的链接，提取码填在「分享密码」里。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
msgid ""
"The share link or ID isn't right: give the share's link, or the part after "
"#/ in it."
msgstr "分享链接或 ID 不对：请填分享链接，或者链接里 #/ 后面的那段。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
msgid ""
"The server address should be like https://siot-share.lenovo.com.cn or http://"
"192.168.1.10, without a path."
msgstr ""
"服务器地址应该像 https://siot-share.lenovo.com.cn 或 http://192.168.1.10 这"
"样，不带路径。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s refused the extraction code. Please check the share password in "
"the storage source's settings."
msgstr "%(service)s 不接受这个提取码，请检查存储源设置里的分享密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
msgid ""
"The share doesn't exist. Please check the share link in the storage source's "
"settings."
msgstr "分享不存在，请检查存储源设置里的分享链接。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
msgid "The share link has been cancelled."
msgstr "分享链接已取消。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/lenovo_nas_share.py
msgid "The device sharing this is offline. Please try again later."
msgstr "分享设备已离线，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "The file permissions on the server don't allow this."
msgstr "服务器上的文件权限不允许这个操作。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "The server is out of disk space."
msgstr "服务器的磁盘空间不够了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "The storage's disk is read-only."
msgstr "存储所在的磁盘是只读的。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "The name or path is too long."
msgstr "名字或路径太长了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "Too many levels of symbolic links, or a loop."
msgstr "符号链接的层次太多，或者绕成了圈。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "The folder isn't empty."
msgstr "文件夹不是空的。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "The server has too many files open. Please try again later."
msgstr "服务器同时打开的文件太多了，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid ""
"The file or folder is in use on the server (another program may have it "
"open). Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"服务器上的这个文件或文件夹正在使用中（可能有别的程序打开着它），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
#, python-format
msgid "Reading or writing a file on the server failed: %(error)s"
msgstr "读写服务器上的文件出错：%(error)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
#, python-format
msgid "The path is too deep: at most %(limit)s folder level."
msgid_plural "The path is too deep: at most %(limit)s folder levels."
msgstr[0] "路径太深了：最多 %(limit)s 层文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "The file got shorter while being read. Please download it again."
msgstr "文件在读的时候变短了，请重新下载。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The name has characters that can't be used."
msgstr "名字里有不能用的字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid ""
"On this server (Windows) a name can't have < > : \" \\ | ? * or control "
"characters in it."
msgstr "这台服务器是 Windows，名字里不能有 < > : \" \\ | ? * 和控制字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "On this server (Windows) a name can't end with a dot or a space."
msgstr "这台服务器是 Windows，名字的最后不能是点或空格。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"On this server (Windows) %(name)s is a device's name, which files and "
"folders can't have."
msgstr "这台服务器是 Windows，%(name)s 是设备的名字，文件和文件夹都不能用。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid ""
"On this server (Windows) symbolic links and junctions can't be moved to "
"another disk."
msgstr "这台服务器是 Windows，符号链接和目录联接不能移动到另一个磁盘。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The folders are nested too deep (over %(limit)s level); only part was "
"deleted, so please delete the deeper part on the server."
msgid_plural ""
"The folders are nested too deep (over %(limit)s levels); only part was "
"deleted, so please delete the deeper part on the server."
msgstr[0] ""
"文件夹的层次太深了（超过 %(limit)s 层），只删掉了一部分，更深的部分请在服务器"
"上删除。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "Local storage"
msgstr "本地存储"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid ""
"A folder on the server, as an absolute path with its drive like D:\\files; "
"it must already exist. Choose a folder just for files, not the program's own "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"服务器上的一个文件夹，填带盘符的绝对路径，例如 D:\\files，文件夹要已经存在。"
"请选一个专门放文件的文件夹，不要选程序自己的文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid ""
"A folder on the server, as an absolute path like /data/files; it must "
"already exist. With Docker, enter the path inside the container, and mount "
"the host's folder into the container first. Choose a folder just for files, "
"not the program's own folder."
msgstr ""
"服务器上的一个文件夹，填绝对路径，例如 /data/files，文件夹要已经存在。用 "
"Docker 部署时填容器里的路径，并先把宿主机的文件夹挂载进容器。请选一个专门放文"
"件的文件夹，不要选程序自己的文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "Allow symbolic links pointing outside the folder"
msgstr "允许指向文件夹外的符号链接"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid ""
"Off by default: symbolic links in the folder that point outside it aren't "
"shown and can't be opened. When on, they work like ordinary files and "
"folders: they can be seen and downloaded, and people with the permissions "
"can upload, create, rename and delete through them in the folders outside "
"(copying refuses them). First make sure what they point to may be public and "
"may be changed."
msgstr ""
"默认关闭：文件夹里指向它外面的符号链接不显示，也打不开。打开后，这些链接和普"
"通的文件、文件夹一样：能看、能下载，有相应权限的人也能通过它们在外面的文件夹"
"里上传、新建、改名和删除（复制会拒绝它们）。请先确认链接指向的内容都可以公"
"开，也可以被改动。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid ""
"Local storage needs a system such as Linux or macOS: this server's system "
"doesn't support it."
msgstr "本地存储需要 Linux、macOS 这类系统：这台服务器的系统不支持。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "Please fill in the folder on the server."
msgstr "请填写服务器上的文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py apps/storages/drivers/paths.py
msgid "The path can't contain NUL characters."
msgstr "路径里不能有 NUL 字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "Enter an absolute path with its drive, like D:\\files."
msgstr "要填带盘符的绝对路径，例如 D:\\files。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "Enter an absolute path, like /data/files."
msgstr "要填绝对路径，例如 /data/files。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid ""
"The system's root can't be a storage. Please choose a folder just for files."
msgstr "不能把整个系统的根目录作为存储，请选一个专门放文件的文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "This folder doesn't exist, or isn't a folder."
msgstr "这个文件夹不存在，或者不是文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid ""
"The storage's folder is set wrong. Please ask the administrator to check the "
"storage source's settings."
msgstr "存储的文件夹设置得不对，请管理员检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid ""
"The storage's folder no longer exists. Please ask the administrator to check "
"the storage source's settings."
msgstr "存储的文件夹不存在了，请管理员检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
#, python-format
msgid "The folders are nested too deep (over %(limit)s level)."
msgid_plural "The folders are nested too deep (over %(limit)s levels)."
msgstr[0] "文件夹的层次太深了（超过 %(limit)s 层）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid ""
"The folder has device files or sockets, so it can't be moved to another disk."
msgstr "文件夹里有设备文件或者套接字，没法把它移到另一个磁盘上。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "The program has no permission to read this folder."
msgstr "程序没有权限读这个文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "The file's folder can't be written to (file permissions on the server)."
msgstr "文件所在的文件夹不能写入（服务器上的文件权限）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid ""
"This file is read-only (file permissions on the server) and can't be "
"overwritten."
msgstr "这个文件是只读的（服务器上的文件权限），不能覆盖。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid "Another program keeps changing the file. Please try again later."
msgstr "文件一直在被别的程序改动，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid ""
"It was copied to the new place, but not everything at the old place could be "
"deleted."
msgstr "已经复制到了新位置，但是原来位置的文件没能全部删掉。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/local.py
msgid ""
"This is a symbolic link pointing outside the storage's folder and can't be "
"copied."
msgstr "这是指向存储文件夹外面的符号链接，不能复制。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "Application ID (Client ID)"
msgstr "应用 ID（Client ID）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Register an app in \"App registrations\" in the Azure portal ({portal}): "
"choose \"Web\" for the redirect URI and enter this site's authorization "
"callback URL; in \"API permissions\" add the Microsoft Graph delegated "
"permissions offline_access, User.Read, Files.ReadWrite.All, Sites.Read.All "
"and Sites.ReadWrite.All. Enter the \"Application (client) ID\" from the "
"app's \"Overview\" page here."
msgstr ""
"在 Azure 门户（{portal}）的「应用注册」里注册一个应用：重定向 URI 选「Web」，"
"填本站的授权回调地址；「API 权限」里加 Microsoft Graph 的委托权限 "
"offline_access、User.Read、Files.ReadWrite.All、Sites.Read.All、"
"Sites.ReadWrite.All。这里填应用「概述」页上的「应用程序(客户端) ID」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "Client secret (Client Secret)"
msgstr "客户端密码（Client Secret）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"Create a client secret in the app's \"Certificates & secrets\" and enter its "
"\"Value\" (not the \"Secret ID\"). When it expires, create a new one, enter "
"it and authorize again."
msgstr ""
"应用的「证书和密码」里新建一个客户端密码，填它的「值」（不是「机密 ID」）。密"
"码过期后要新建一个，填进来再重新授权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "Tenant"
msgstr "租户"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"common when the app supports accounts of any organization or personal "
"Microsoft accounts; for a single-tenant app that only supports your "
"organization's accounts, the tenant ID or domain (like "
"contoso.onmicrosoft.com)."
msgstr ""
"应用支持任何组织的帐户或个人 Microsoft 帐户时用 common；只支持本组织帐户的单"
"租户应用，填租户 ID 或域名（例如 contoso.onmicrosoft.com）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"After saving the settings above, click \"Authorize\", log in to the "
"Microsoft account and agree: it's filled in for you. A changed password, a "
"revoked authorization or a long time unused ends the token; just authorize "
"again."
msgstr ""
"保存上面的设置后点「授权」，登录微软帐户并同意，就会自动填好。改了密码、撤销"
"了授权或者长时间没用，令牌会失效，重新授权即可。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"Choose one with \"List sites\", or enter the site's address, like https://"
"contoso.sharepoint.com/sites/team (.sharepoint.cn for 21Vianet). Needs "
"authorizing first."
msgstr ""
"点「列出网站」选一个；也可以直接填网站地址，例如 https://"
"contoso.sharepoint.com/sites/team（世纪互联是 .sharepoint.cn）。需要先授权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "Document library"
msgstr "文档库"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"Choose one with \"List document libraries\"; leave empty for the site's "
"default library (\"Documents\")."
msgstr "点「列出文档库」选择；留空就用网站默认的文档库（「文档」）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The folder in {service} that is this storage source's root, like / or /"
"folder1. It must already exist."
msgstr ""
"{service} 里作为这个存储源根目录的文件夹，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。这个文件夹必须"
"已经存在。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgctxt "OneDrive, SharePoint"
msgid "Download domain"
msgstr "下载加速域名"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"Fill in when a Cloudflare Worker or your own reverse proxy passes on "
"Microsoft's download addresses: direct links replace the domain of "
"Microsoft's download address with it. Leave empty to use Microsoft's "
"addresses."
msgstr ""
"用 Cloudflare Worker 或自建反向代理转发微软的下载地址时填写：直链会把微软下载"
"地址的域名换成它。留空就直接用微软的地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Register an app in \"App registrations\" in the Azure portal ({portal}); in "
"\"API permissions\" add the Microsoft Graph application permission "
"Files.ReadWrite.All (not a delegated one) and click \"Grant admin consent\". "
"Enter the \"Application (client) ID\" from the app's \"Overview\" page here. "
"It can then reach every user's OneDrive in the organization, without anyone "
"signing in."
msgstr ""
"在 Azure 门户（{portal}）的「应用注册」里注册一个应用，在「API 权限」里加 "
"Microsoft Graph 的应用程序权限 Files.ReadWrite.All（不是委托权限），再点「代"
"表组织授予管理员同意」。这里填应用「概述」页上的「应用程序(客户端) ID」。这样"
"它不用任何人登录，就能访问组织里每个用户的 OneDrive。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"Create a client secret in the app's \"Certificates & secrets\" and enter its "
"\"Value\" (not the \"Secret ID\"). When it expires, create a new one and "
"enter it."
msgstr ""
"在应用的「证书和密码」里新建一个客户端密码，填它的「值」（不是「机密 ID」）。"
"密码过期后新建一个填进来。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"The organization's tenant ID or domain, like contoso.onmicrosoft.com (an "
"app's own access needs it)."
msgstr ""
"组织的租户 ID 或域名，比如 contoso.onmicrosoft.com（用应用身份访问时必须"
"填）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"The user whose OneDrive to show: their email address (user principal name) "
"or object ID."
msgstr "要显示谁的 OneDrive：这个用户的邮箱（用户主体名称）或对象 ID。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"Click \"Authorize\" and log in to the Microsoft account before listing sites "
"and document libraries."
msgstr "先点「授权」登录微软帐户，再列出网站和文档库。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"This Microsoft account has no usable OneDrive: a personal account must have "
"opened OneDrive once, and a work or school account needs a OneDrive license."
msgstr ""
"这个微软帐户没有可用的 OneDrive：个人帐户要先打开过一次 OneDrive，工作或学校"
"帐户需要 OneDrive 的许可证。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "The tenant should be common, organizations, a tenant ID or a domain."
msgstr "租户应该是 common、organizations、租户 ID 或者域名。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"The download domain should look like https://dl.example.com (a port is fine, "
"no path)."
msgstr ""
"下载加速域名应该像 https://dl.example.com 这样（可以带端口，不带路径）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "The tenant is set wrong."
msgstr "租户设置得不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "Fill in the application ID (Client ID) first."
msgstr "先填应用 ID（Client ID）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"Microsoft gave no refresh token: make sure the app's API permissions include "
"offline_access, then authorize again."
msgstr ""
"微软没有给刷新令牌：请确认应用的 API 权限里有 offline_access，然后重新授权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "Fill in the application ID and client secret first."
msgstr "先填应用 ID 和客户端密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "the Microsoft login service"
msgstr "微软登录服务"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The Microsoft login service is unavailable for now (HTTP %(status_code)s). "
"Please try again later."
msgstr "微软登录服务暂时不可用（HTTP %(status_code)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Microsoft refused the authorization: %(reason)s. Please check the "
"application ID, client secret and tenant, and authorize again if needed."
msgstr ""
"微软拒绝了授权：%(reason)s。请检查应用 ID、客户端密码和租户，必要时重新授权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "The Microsoft login service's answer has no access token."
msgstr "微软登录服务的回答里没有访问令牌。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"Not authorized yet: click \"Authorize\" in the storage source's settings and "
"log in to the Microsoft account."
msgstr "还没有授权：请在存储源设置里点「授权」，登录微软帐户。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s gave an address that isn't on Graph."
msgstr "%(service)s 给了一个不在 Graph 上的地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The file is locked (it may be open for editing in Office)%(detail)s. Please "
"try again later."
msgstr "文件被锁定了（可能正在 Office 里编辑）%(detail)s，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s refused this%(detail)s: %(message)s"
msgstr "%(service)s 拒绝了这个操作%(detail)s：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "Permission denied."
msgstr "没有权限。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s gave no ID for the file."
msgstr "%(service)s 没有给出文件的 ID。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s doesn't allow %(name)s as a name."
msgstr "%(service)s 不允许用 %(name)s 作名字。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "Names in %(service)s can't start with ~$."
msgstr "%(service)s 的名字不能以 ~$ 开头。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "Names in %(service)s can't contain _vti_."
msgstr "%(service)s 的名字里不能有 _vti_。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s repeated a page address."
msgstr "%(service)s 的分页地址重复了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(folder)s is a file, not a folder."
msgstr "%(folder)s 是文件，不是文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s already has a file of that name, or an unfinished upload of it. "
"Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"%(service)s 上已经有同名的文件，或者有一次没传完的同名上传，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "Uploading to %(service)s failed."
msgstr "%(service)s 上传失败。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s ended the upload early."
msgstr "%(service)s 提前结束了上传。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "The upload range %(service)s wants doesn't match (%(range)s)."
msgstr "%(service)s 要的上传范围对不上（%(range)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s didn't confirm the upload finished."
msgstr "%(service)s 没有确认上传完成。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s gave no ID for the target folder."
msgstr "%(service)s 没有给出目标文件夹的 ID。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "Copying in %(service)s failed (%(code)s): %(message)s"
msgstr "%(service)s 复制失败（%(code)s）：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "Copying in %(service)s failed (%(code)s)."
msgstr "%(service)s 复制失败（%(code)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(service)s copy job is gone. Please refresh to see whether the copy is "
"there."
msgstr "%(service)s 的复制任务不见了，请刷新看看是否已经复制好。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s is still copying (after waiting %(seconds)s second); it goes on "
"in the background, so refresh later to see it."
msgid_plural ""
"%(service)s is still copying (after waiting %(seconds)s seconds); it goes on "
"in the background, so refresh later to see it."
msgstr[0] ""
"%(service)s 还在复制（已经等了 %(seconds)s 秒），它会在后台继续，请稍后刷新查"
"看。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "The copy progress address from %(service)s is wrong."
msgstr "%(service)s 给的复制进度地址不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s didn't start copying (HTTP %(status_code)s)."
msgstr "%(service)s 没有开始复制（HTTP %(status_code)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "OneDrive (21Vianet)"
msgstr "OneDrive 世纪互联"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "OneDrive (app access)"
msgstr "OneDrive（应用身份）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"This user's OneDrive wasn't found: check the user, whether the user has a "
"OneDrive (it is made when they first open it), and whether the app's "
"Files.ReadWrite.All application permission has admin consent."
msgstr ""
"找不到这个用户的 OneDrive：请检查用户填得对不对，这个用户有没有 OneDrive（第"
"一次打开时才会建），以及应用的 Files.ReadWrite.All 应用程序权限有没有得到管理"
"员同意。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"An app's own access needs the organization's tenant ID or domain, not common."
msgstr "用应用身份访问时要填组织的租户 ID 或域名，不能填 common。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "The user is their email address (user principal name) or object ID."
msgstr "用户填这个用户的邮箱（用户主体名称）或对象 ID。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "OneDrive (app access, 21Vianet)"
msgstr "OneDrive（应用身份，世纪互联）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "List sites"
msgstr "列出网站"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "List document libraries"
msgstr "列出文档库"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"The site's document library wasn't found: please check \"Site\" and "
"\"Document library\", and whether the account has access."
msgstr ""
"找不到这个网站的文档库：请检查「网站」和「文档库」，以及帐户有没有访问权限。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"The site should be an ID chosen in \"List sites\", or the site's address, "
"like https://contoso.sharepoint.com/sites/team."
msgstr ""
"网站应该是「列出网站」里选的 ID，或者网站地址，例如 https://"
"contoso.sharepoint.com/sites/team。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"The document library ID is wrong. Please choose again with \"List document "
"libraries\"."
msgstr "文档库的 ID 不对，请点「列出文档库」重新选择。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid ""
"Choose the site (or enter its address) before listing document libraries."
msgstr "先选网站（或者填网站地址），再列出文档库。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "SharePoint gave no ID for the site."
msgstr "SharePoint 没有给网站的 ID。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "The site's default library"
msgstr "网站默认的文档库"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(title)s (%(web_url)s)"
msgstr "%(title)s（%(web_url)s）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "The site isn't set, or is set wrong."
msgstr "还没有设置网站，或者网站设置得不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/microsoft.py
msgid "SharePoint (21Vianet)"
msgstr "SharePoint 世纪互联"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid "Misskey"
msgstr "Misskey"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid ""
"Misskey doesn't take this file name: file names there have at most 200 "
"characters and no \\, / or \"..\"."
msgstr ""
"Misskey 不接受这个文件名：文件名最多 200 个字符，不能有 \\、/ 或「..」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid "Misskey takes folder names of at most 128 characters."
msgstr "Misskey 的文件夹名最多 128 个字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid "The address of the Misskey server, as it is opened in a browser."
msgstr "Misskey 服务器的地址，就是在浏览器里打开它的那个地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid ""
"In Misskey, open Settings → Service integration (Settings → API in older "
"versions), press \"Generate access token\", turn on \"Access your Drive "
"files and folders\" and, to upload and change files, \"Edit or delete your "
"Drive files and folders\", and copy the token, which Misskey shows only "
"once. HFile then acts as that account."
msgstr ""
"在 Misskey 里打开「设置 → 连接服务」（旧版本是「设置 → API」），点「生成访问"
"令牌」，打开「查看网盘」，要上传和修改文件的话再打开「管理网盘文件」，然后复"
"制令牌（Misskey 只显示一次）。HFile 会以这个账号来操作。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid ""
"The address should start with http:// or https://, like https://"
"misskey.example."
msgstr "地址要以 http:// 或 https:// 开头，比如 https://misskey.example。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid ""
"A Misskey access token has only ASCII letters and digits. Please copy it "
"again from Misskey."
msgstr "Misskey 的访问令牌只有英文字母和数字，请从 Misskey 重新复制一遍。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The answer from %(service)s couldn't be understood: is the address that of a "
"Misskey server?"
msgstr "%(service)s 返回的数据看不懂：这个地址是 Misskey 服务器吗？"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid ""
"Misskey refused the access token: it may have been deleted. Please generate "
"a new one in Misskey (Settings → Service integration) and save it in the "
"storage source's settings."
msgstr ""
"Misskey 不接受这个访问令牌：它可能已被删除。请在 Misskey 里（「设置 → 连接服"
"务」）生成一个新的，填到存储源的设置里。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The Misskey access token lacks the permission %(permission)s. Please "
"generate one with \"Access your Drive files and folders\" and \"Edit or "
"delete your Drive files and folders\" in Misskey, and save it in the storage "
"source's settings."
msgstr ""
"Misskey 的访问令牌没有 %(permission)s 权限。请在 Misskey 里生成一个打开了「查"
"看网盘」和「管理网盘文件」的访问令牌，填到存储源的设置里。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid "The Misskey account is suspended."
msgstr "这个 Misskey 账号已被冻结。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid ""
"The Misskey account's drive is full (\"Drive capacity\" of its role). Please "
"delete files from it, or ask the server's administrator for more space."
msgstr ""
"这个 Misskey 账号的网盘满了（它的角色的「网盘容量」）。请删掉一些文件，或者请"
"服务器的管理员给更多空间。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid ""
"The file is larger than Misskey lets this account upload (\"Upload-able max "
"file size\" of its role, 30 MB by default)."
msgstr ""
"文件超过了 Misskey 允许这个账号上传的大小（它的角色的「可上传的最大文件大"
"小」，默认 30 MB）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid ""
"Misskey doesn't let this account upload this type of file. By default it "
"takes text, JSON, images, audio and video only; the server's administrator "
"can allow more in \"Uploadable file types\" of the role."
msgstr ""
"Misskey 不允许这个账号上传这种类型的文件。默认只能上传文本、JSON、图片、音频"
"和视频；服务器的管理员可以在角色的「可上传的文件类型」里允许更多类型。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid ""
"Misskey refused the file: its detection of sensitive media took it for "
"inappropriate content."
msgstr "Misskey 拒绝了这个文件：它的敏感内容检测认为这是不适当的内容。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid ""
"The folder couldn't be deleted: something was put in it meanwhile. Please "
"try again."
msgstr "文件夹没能删掉：删除期间又有东西放了进去，请再试一次。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid ""
"The Misskey account has moved to another account, and Misskey takes no "
"uploads from it."
msgstr "这个 Misskey 账号已经迁移到了别的账号，Misskey 不再接受它上传文件。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid ""
"The file is larger than the Misskey server, or a proxy in front of it, takes "
"(HTTP 413). Misskey's own limit is maxFileSize in its configuration file, "
"250 MiB by default."
msgstr ""
"文件超过了 Misskey 服务器或它前面的代理能接收的大小（HTTP 413）。Misskey 自己"
"的上限是它的配置文件里的 maxFileSize，默认 250 MiB。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Misskey limits the folders and files an account may make in an hour (by "
"default 10 folders and 120 uploads). Please try again in %(minutes)s minute."
msgid_plural ""
"Misskey limits the folders and files an account may make in an hour (by "
"default 10 folders and 120 uploads). Please try again in %(minutes)s minutes."
msgstr[0] ""
"Misskey 限制了每个账号每小时能新建的文件夹和上传的文件数（默认每小时 10 个文"
"件夹、120 个文件），请过 %(minutes)s 分钟再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
msgid ""
"No Misskey API answered at this address (HTTP 404). Please check the "
"address: it must be that of a Misskey server."
msgstr ""
"这个地址上没有 Misskey 的接口（HTTP 404）。请检查地址：要是 Misskey 服务器的"
"地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/misskey.py
#, python-format
msgid "Misskey refused this (HTTP %(status_code)s): %(message)s"
msgstr "Misskey 拒绝了这个操作（HTTP %(status_code)s）：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
msgid ""
"This link only opens for people who sign in. Share the folder with \"Anyone "
"with the link\" and use that link; the link may also have expired or been "
"turned off."
msgstr ""
"这个链接要登录才能打开。请把文件夹共享给「拥有链接的任何人」，用那个链接；也"
"可能是链接已经过期或被关闭了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
msgid ""
"SharePoint didn't show the shared folder: the link may have expired or been "
"turned off, or not be a link to a folder."
msgstr ""
"SharePoint 没有打开分享的文件夹：链接可能已经过期或被关闭了，也可能不是文件夹"
"的链接。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
msgid "SharePoint redirected too many times."
msgstr "SharePoint 的跳转太多了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
msgid "OneDrive share link"
msgstr "OneDrive 分享链接"

#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
msgid "Share link"
msgstr "分享链接"

#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
msgid ""
"A link to a folder in OneDrive for work or school or in SharePoint, shared "
"with \"Anyone with the link\" so that it opens without signing in (Share, "
"then Copy link). Links to a personal OneDrive and links that need signing in "
"don't work."
msgstr ""
"OneDrive 工作或学校版或者 SharePoint 里一个文件夹的链接，要共享给「拥有链接的"
"任何人」，不用登录就能打开（「共享」→「复制链接」）。OneDrive 个人版的链接和"
"要登录才能打开的链接用不了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid "When the share has one."
msgstr "分享设了密码时填写。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
msgid ""
"Links to a personal OneDrive (1drv.ms, onedrive.live.com) can't be used: "
"besides Microsoft's own OneDrive website, only apps someone has signed in to "
"can read them. Links from OneDrive for work or school and SharePoint work."
msgstr ""
"OneDrive 个人版的链接（1drv.ms、onedrive.live.com）用不了：除了微软自己的 "
"OneDrive 网站，只有登录了帐户的应用才能读取。OneDrive 工作或学校版和 "
"SharePoint 的链接可以用。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
msgid ""
"The share link should start with https:// and be on sharepoint.com "
"(sharepoint.cn for 21Vianet), as the links of OneDrive for work or school "
"and SharePoint are."
msgstr ""
"分享链接应该以 https:// 开头，在 sharepoint.com 上（世纪互联是 "
"sharepoint.cn），OneDrive 工作或学校版和 SharePoint 的链接都是这样的。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
msgid "This is a link to a file. Share the folder it is in and use that link."
msgstr "这是一个文件的链接。请共享它所在的文件夹，用那个链接。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
msgid "The share password is wrong."
msgstr "分享密码不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
msgid "The share link has a password: please fill in the share password."
msgstr "这个分享链接设了密码，请填写分享密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"SharePoint refused access through the share link (HTTP %(status)s): it may "
"have expired, been turned off, or had its password changed."
msgstr ""
"SharePoint 拒绝通过这个分享链接访问（HTTP %(status)s）：链接可能已经过期、被"
"关闭，或者改了密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/onedrive_share.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"SharePoint didn't send the file (HTTP %(status)s): the share link may not "
"allow downloads."
msgstr ""
"SharePoint 没有发送这个文件（HTTP %(status)s）：这个分享链接可能不允许下载。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "115"
msgstr "115 网盘"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "115's object storage"
msgstr "115 的对象存储"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"115 refused the access token%(detail)s. Please scan the QR code to log in "
"again."
msgstr "115 拒绝了访问令牌%(detail)s。请重新扫码登录。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Too many requests to 115: it is rate-limiting them%(detail)s. Please try "
"again later."
msgstr "请求 115 太频繁，被限流了%(detail)s，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "115 is out of space."
msgstr "115 网盘的空间不够了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
#, python-format
msgid "115 refused this%(detail)s."
msgstr "115 拒绝了这个操作%(detail)s。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid ""
"Too many requests to 115: it is rate-limiting them. Please try again later."
msgstr "请求 115 太频繁，被限流了，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
#, python-format
msgid "The 115 API failed (HTTP %(status_code)s). Please try again later."
msgstr "115 接口出错了（HTTP %(status_code)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "The data from 115 couldn't be understood. Please try again later."
msgstr "115 返回的数据看不懂，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid ""
"The 115 access token was refreshed too often. Please try again in a few "
"minutes."
msgstr "刷新 115 的访问令牌太频繁了，请过几分钟再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "115 gave no object storage address."
msgstr "115 没有给出对象存储的地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "The object storage address from 115 is wrong."
msgstr "115 给出的对象存储地址不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid ""
"The AppID you get after creating an app on the 115 open platform (https://"
"open.115.com)."
msgstr "在 115 开放平台（https://open.115.com）创建应用后得到的 AppID。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid ""
"Click \"Scan to log in\", scan the code with the 115 phone app and confirm: "
"it's filled in for you."
msgstr "点「扫码登录」，用 115 手机客户端扫码并确认后自动填写。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid ""
"Filled in after scanning to log in. 115 gives a new one on every refresh and "
"the old one stops working; HFile saves the new one itself."
msgstr ""
"扫码登录后自动填写。115 每次刷新都会换一个新的，旧的随即失效，HFile 会自动保"
"存新的。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid ""
"Unix time (seconds), filled in when scanning to log in and refreshing the "
"token; no need to change it."
msgstr "Unix 时间（秒），扫码登录和刷新令牌时自动填写，不用改。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "Requests per second"
msgstr "每秒请求数"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid ""
"How many requests a second HFile sends to 115 at most. 115 limits the call "
"rate of all its APIs and doesn't publish the limits, so keep it low: 1, the "
"lowest, is the safest. Its rules also strictly forbid sharing a developer "
"account or its membership among several people; see https://www.yuque.com/"
"115yun/open/vq62qwp8ia2efoli"
msgstr ""
"HFile 每秒最多向 115 发几个请求。115 对所有接口都限制调用频率，具体规则不公"
"开，所以请设得低一些：1 是最低值，也最稳妥。115 的规则还严禁多人共享开发者账"
"号及会员权益，详见 https://www.yuque.com/115yun/open/vq62qwp8ia2efoli"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid ""
"The folder in 115 that is this storage source's root, like / or /folder1."
msgstr "115 网盘里哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "Scan to log in"
msgstr "扫码登录"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid ""
"The AppID should be the string of digits or letters the 115 open platform "
"gave."
msgstr "AppID 应该是 115 开放平台给出的一串数字或字母。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "Requests per second should be an integer from 1 to 10."
msgstr "每秒请求数应该是 1 到 10 之间的整数。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "Fill in the AppID before scanning to log in."
msgstr "请先填 AppID，再扫码登录。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"115 gave no login QR code (%(code)s): %(message)s. Please check the AppID."
msgstr "115 没有给出登录二维码（%(code)s）：%(message)s。请检查 AppID。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "The login QR code from 115 is incomplete. Please try again."
msgstr "115 给出的登录二维码不完整，请重试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "Scan the code with the 115 phone app and confirm on the phone."
msgstr "请用 115 手机客户端扫码，并在手机上确认授权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid ""
"The scan login's details are wrong. Please click \"Scan to log in\" again."
msgstr "扫码登录的参数不对，请重新点「扫码登录」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "Waiting for the scan…"
msgstr "等待扫码……"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "The QR code has expired. Please click \"Scan to log in\" again."
msgstr "二维码已失效，请重新点「扫码登录」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "Scanned. Please confirm on the phone."
msgstr "已扫码，请在手机上确认授权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "The scan login was canceled. Please click \"Scan to log in\" again."
msgstr "扫码登录已取消，请重新点「扫码登录」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
#, python-format
msgid "115 gave no token (%(code)s): %(message)s. Please scan to log in again."
msgstr "115 没有给出令牌（%(code)s）：%(message)s。请重新扫码登录。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "115's answer has no token. Please scan to log in again."
msgstr "115 的回答里没有令牌，请重新扫码登录。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "Authorized. Please save the storage source."
msgstr "授权成功，请保存存储源。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid ""
"Not authorized yet: click \"Scan to log in\" in the storage source's "
"settings and scan with the 115 phone app."
msgstr "还没有授权：请在存储源设置里点「扫码登录」，用 115 手机客户端扫码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Refreshing the 115 access token failed (%(code)s). Please try again later."
msgstr "刷新 115 的访问令牌失败（%(code)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The 115 authorization has expired (%(code)s). Please scan to log in again."
msgstr "115 的授权已失效（%(code)s），请重新扫码登录。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"115 refused to refresh the access token (%(code)s): %(message)s. Please scan "
"to log in again."
msgstr "115 拒绝刷新访问令牌（%(code)s）：%(message)s。请重新扫码登录。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "115's token refresh answer has no token. Please try again later."
msgstr "115 刷新令牌的回答里没有令牌，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "115 asked for a second check but gave no range to check."
msgstr "115 要求二次校验，但没有给出校验范围。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "The range 115 asked to check is beyond the file's size."
msgstr "115 要求校验的范围超出了文件大小。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
#, python-format
msgid "115's upload start gave an unknown status (%(status)s)."
msgstr "115 的上传初始化给出了没见过的状态（%(status)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "115 kept asking for a second check, so the upload couldn't start."
msgstr "115 一直要求二次校验，上传没能开始。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "The upload credentials from 115 are incomplete."
msgstr "115 给出的上传凭证不完整。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid ""
"Uploading to 115's object storage failed: the server's clock is more than 15 "
"minutes off from the storage's (RequestTimeTooSkewed). Please correct the "
"server's time."
msgstr ""
"上传到 115 的对象存储失败：服务器的时间和存储相差超过 15 分钟"
"（RequestTimeTooSkewed），请校准服务器时间。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Uploading to 115's object storage failed (HTTP %(status)s, %(code)s). Please "
"try again later."
msgstr "上传到 115 的对象存储失败（HTTP %(status)s，%(code)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Uploading to 115's object storage failed (HTTP %(status)s). Please try again "
"later."
msgstr "上传到 115 的对象存储失败（HTTP %(status)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "115's upload start is missing the object storage location or callback."
msgstr "115 的上传初始化缺少对象存储的位置或回调。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid ""
"The file reached 115's object storage, but 115 didn't confirm it (the "
"callback failed). Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"文件已经传到了 115 的对象存储，但 115 没有确认（回调失败），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "115 gave no pick code for this file, so it can't be downloaded."
msgstr "115 没有给出这个文件的提取码，无法下载。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "115 gave no download address for this file."
msgstr "115 没有给出这个文件的下载地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "The file list from 115 couldn't be understood. Please try again later."
msgstr "115 返回的文件列表看不懂，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "The 115 file list never ends. Please try again later."
msgstr "115 的文件列表一直翻不完，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open115.py
msgid "115 gave no ID for the new folder."
msgstr "115 新建文件夹后没有给出它的 ID。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py apps/storages/drivers/pan123_link.py
msgid "123 Cloud Drive"
msgstr "123云盘"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s says the account is logged in in too many places%(detail)s. "
"Please log out of %(service)s where it isn't needed, then try again."
msgstr ""
"%(service)s 说账号登录的地方太多了%(detail)s。请在用不着的地方退出 "
"%(service)s，然后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s refused the access token%(detail)s. Please check the client ID "
"and secret, and that the account's developer package hasn't expired."
msgstr ""
"%(service)s 拒绝了访问令牌%(detail)s。请检查客户端 ID 和密钥，再看看账号的开"
"发者权益包是不是到期了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This account's download traffic on %(service)s is used up for "
"today%(detail)s."
msgstr "这个账号今天在 %(service)s 的下载流量用完了%(detail)s。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s failed%(detail)s. Please try again later."
msgstr "%(service)s 出错了%(detail)s，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
msgid "123 Cloud Drive (open platform)"
msgstr "123云盘（开放平台）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
msgid ""
"Once you buy a developer package on the 123 Cloud Drive open platform "
"(https://www.123pan.com/developer), 123 Cloud Drive sends the client_id and "
"client_secret to the account's messages."
msgstr ""
"在 123云盘开放平台（https://www.123pan.com/developer）买了开发者权益包以后，"
"123云盘会把 client_id 和 client_secret 发到账号的「站内信 → 消息」里。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
msgid "The client_secret from the same message."
msgstr "同一条消息里的 client_secret。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
msgid ""
"HFile gets it with the client ID and secret, and saves it: one client ID can "
"have at most 3 tokens in use (each storage source using it holds one), so "
"each is kept for its 30 days. No need to fill it in."
msgstr ""
"HFile 用客户端 ID 和密钥自动获取并保存：一个客户端 ID 同时最多只能有 3 个令牌"
"在用（用它的每个存储源各占一个），所以每个令牌都会用满 30 天。不用填。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
msgid ""
"Unix time (seconds), filled in when HFile gets the access token; no need to "
"change it."
msgstr "Unix 时间（秒），HFile 获取访问令牌时自动填写，不用改。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
msgid ""
"The folder in 123 Cloud Drive that is this storage source's root, like / or /"
"folder1."
msgstr "123云盘里哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
msgid "The client ID should be the letters and digits 123 Cloud Drive sent."
msgstr "客户端 ID 应该是 123云盘发来的一串字母和数字。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s refused the access token it gave a moment ago. One client ID can "
"have at most 3 tokens in use, and getting another logs the oldest out: other "
"storage sources or programs may be using this client ID (please stop them, "
"or give them other developer accounts), or the account's developer package "
"has expired."
msgstr ""
"%(service)s 刚给的访问令牌马上就被拒绝了。一个客户端 ID 同时最多只能有 3 个令"
"牌在用，再获取新的会把最早的挤下线：可能还有别的存储源或程序在用这个客户端 ID"
"（请停用它们，或者让它们换别的开发者账号），也可能是账号的开发者权益包到期"
"了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s refused the client ID or secret%(detail)s. Please check them, "
"and that the account's developer package hasn't expired."
msgstr ""
"%(service)s 不接受这个客户端 ID 或密钥%(detail)s。请检查一下，再看看账号的开"
"发者权益包是不是到期了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/open123.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s takes files of at most 10 GB from developer apps."
msgstr "%(service)s 限制开发者上传的单个文件最大 10 GB。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid "OpenList"
msgstr "OpenList"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid "OpenList / AList"
msgstr "OpenList / AList"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid ""
"The address of the OpenList or AList server, as it is opened in a browser."
msgstr "OpenList 或 AList 服务器的地址，就是在浏览器里打开它的那个地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid ""
"An account of that server. Leave the username, password and token empty to "
"use its guest account."
msgstr "那个服务器上的账号。用户名、密码和 Token 都不填时，用它的游客账号。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid ""
"Instead of a username and password: the token in the server's settings "
"(Settings → Other). It doesn't expire."
msgstr "代替用户名和密码：那个服务器设置里的令牌（设置 → 其他），不会过期。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py apps/storages/models.py
msgid "Folder password"
msgstr "目录密码"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid "For folders the server protects with a password."
msgstr "用于那个服务器上设了密码的文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid ""
"The address should start with http:// or https://, like https://"
"alist.example.com."
msgstr "地址要以 http:// 或 https:// 开头，比如 https://alist.example.com。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid "Give the password of that account too."
msgstr "请同时填写这个账号的密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(service)s account uses two-step verification, which HFile can't "
"answer. Please use the server's token instead, or an account without it."
msgstr ""
"这个 %(service)s 账号开了两步验证，HFile 没法填验证码。请改用服务器设置里的令"
"牌，或者换一个没开两步验证的账号。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s blocks logins from this server for a few minutes after failed "
"attempts. Please check the username and password in the storage source's "
"settings, then wait a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"登录失败几次以后，%(service)s 会有几分钟不让本站的服务器登录。请检查存储源设"
"置里的用户名和密码，再等几分钟。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s refused the account or token: %(message)s. Please check the "
"storage source's settings."
msgstr "%(service)s 不接受这个账号或令牌：%(message)s。请检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s refused this: %(message)s. The account may lack the permission, "
"or the folder password is wrong."
msgstr ""
"%(service)s 拒绝了这个操作：%(message)s。可能是账号没有权限，或者文件夹密码不"
"对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The web server of %(service)s, or a proxy in front of it, refused the upload "
"as too large (HTTP 413). Please ask its administrator to allow larger "
"requests (for nginx: client_max_body_size)."
msgstr ""
"%(service)s 的网页服务器或它前面的代理嫌上传的文件太大，拒绝了（HTTP 413）。"
"请让它的管理员放宽请求大小的限制（nginx 是 client_max_body_size）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The answer from %(service)s (HTTP %(status_code)s) couldn't be understood: "
"is the address that of an OpenList or AList server?"
msgstr ""
"%(service)s 返回的数据看不懂（HTTP %(status_code)s）：这个地址是 OpenList 或 "
"AList 服务器吗？"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(service)s couldn't finish this: %(error)s"
msgstr "%(service)s 没能完成这个操作：%(error)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s is still working on this in the background. Please refresh in a "
"while to see the result."
msgstr "%(service)s 还在后台处理，请过一会儿刷新看看结果。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid "OpenList share"
msgstr "OpenList 分享"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid "The address of the OpenList server, as it is opened in a browser."
msgstr "OpenList 服务器的地址，就是在浏览器里打开它的那个地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid "Share ID"
msgstr "分享 ID"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid ""
"The share's link, or the part after /@s/ in it: for https://"
"openlist.example.com/@s/AbC123 it is AbC123."
msgstr ""
"分享链接，或者链接里 /@s/ 后面的那段：https://openlist.example.com/@s/AbC123 "
"的就是 AbC123。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid ""
"The folder in the share that is this storage source's root, like / or /"
"folder1."
msgstr "分享里的哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid ""
"The share ID is the part after /@s/ in the share's link; the whole link can "
"be pasted too."
msgstr "分享 ID 是分享链接里 /@s/ 后面的那段；也可以直接粘贴整个链接。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/openlist.py
msgid ""
"This OpenList share is a single file, which can't be a storage source. "
"Please share a folder instead."
msgstr "这个 OpenList 分享只有一个文件，不能作为存储源。请改为分享一个文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/pan123_link.py
msgid "123 Cloud Drive direct links"
msgstr "123云盘直链"

#: apps/storages/drivers/pan123_link.py apps/storages/drivers/url_tree.py
msgid "Files and folders"
msgstr "文件和文件夹"

#: apps/storages/drivers/pan123_link.py
msgid ""
"Direct links copied in 123 Cloud Drive (\"Get direct link\" on a file in a "
"direct-link space), one per line, two spaces of indent a folder deeper. A "
"folder: name: (with the \":\"). A file: its link, or name:link, or name:size "
"in bytes:link."
msgstr ""
"在 123云盘复制的直链（直链空间里文件的「获取直链地址」），一行一个，每深一层"
"文件夹缩进两个空格。文件夹写成 名字:（带「:」）。文件写它的直链，或者 名字:直"
"链，或者 名字:字节数:直链。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/pan123_link.py
msgid "Account ID (UID)"
msgstr "账号 ID（UID）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/pan123_link.py
msgid ""
"The account ID on 123 Cloud Drive's personal center page; needed with the "
"URL authentication key."
msgstr "123云盘「个人中心」页面上的账号 ID；填了直链鉴权密钥时要填。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/pan123_link.py
msgid "URL authentication key"
msgstr "直链鉴权密钥"

#: apps/storages/drivers/pan123_link.py
msgid ""
"When URL authentication is on in 123 Cloud Drive's direct link management "
"(\"Authentication management\", bottom right), enter its key here: links "
"then get a time-limited auth_key signature, lasting as long as this "
"storage's download links. Leave empty when it is off."
msgstr ""
"在 123云盘「直链管理」页面右下角的「鉴权管理」里开启鉴权后，把那里的密钥填在"
"这里，链接就会带上有时效的 auth_key 签名，有效期和这个存储源的下载链接一样。"
"没开鉴权时留空。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/pan123_link.py
msgid "Give the account ID too: links are signed with it."
msgstr "请同时填写账号 ID：签名要用到它。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/pan123_link.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s refused the direct link (HTTP %(status_code)s). Please check the "
"account ID and the URL authentication key, the server's time, and that the "
"account has direct link traffic left."
msgstr ""
"%(service)s 拒绝了这个直链（HTTP %(status_code)s）。请检查账号 ID 和直链鉴权"
"密钥、服务器时间，以及账号还有没有直链流量。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/paths.py
msgid "The path should be text."
msgstr "路径应该是文字。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/paths.py
msgid "The path has invalid characters."
msgstr "路径里有无效的字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/paths.py
msgid "The path can't have a part of only dots and spaces, like . or .."
msgstr "路径里不能有 . 或 .. 这样只有点和空格的一段。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/paths.py
msgid "The path isn't inside this folder."
msgstr "路径不在这个文件夹里。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/paths.py
msgid "The name can't be only spaces."
msgstr "名字不能只有空格。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/paths.py
msgid "The name can't be only dots and spaces (like . or ..)."
msgstr "名字不能只有点和空格（比如 . 或 ..）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/paths.py
msgid "The name can't contain /."
msgstr "名字里不能有 /。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/paths.py
msgid "The name can't contain \\."
msgstr "名字里不能有 \\。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/paths.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The name can't contain text direction marks (found U+%(code)s): they make a "
"name show as something else."
msgstr ""
"名字里不能有文字方向控制符（发现了 U+%(code)s）：它会让名字显示成另一个样子。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/paths.py
msgid "The name can't contain control characters such as line breaks or tabs."
msgstr "名字里不能有换行、制表符这类控制字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/paths.py
#, python-format
msgid "Names in this kind of storage can't contain these characters: %(chars)s"
msgstr "这种存储的名字里不能有这些字符：%(chars)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/paths.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The name is too long: at most %(limit)s byte (a Chinese character counts as "
"3)."
msgid_plural ""
"The name is too long: at most %(limit)s bytes (a Chinese character counts as "
"3)."
msgstr[0] "名字太长了：最多 %(limit)s 个字节（一个汉字算 3 个）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/pool.py
msgid "All connections to the storage are in use. Please try again later."
msgstr "存储的连接都在使用中，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/pool.py
msgid "The storage has been closed."
msgstr "存储已经关闭了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/qiniu.py
msgid "Qiniu Kodo"
msgstr "七牛云 Kodo"

#: apps/storages/drivers/qiniu.py
msgid "S3 endpoint"
msgstr "S3 服务域名"

#: apps/storages/drivers/qiniu.py
msgid ""
"The S3 endpoint of the bucket's region, with the scheme, like https://s3.cn-"
"east-1.qiniucs.com (East China, Zhejiang), https://s3.cn-north-1.qiniucs.com "
"(North China, Hebei) or https://s3.cn-south-1.qiniucs.com (South China, "
"Guangdong)."
msgstr ""
"空间所在区域的 S3 服务域名，要带协议，例如 https://s3.cn-east-1.qiniucs.com"
"（华东-浙江）、https://s3.cn-north-1.qiniucs.com（华北-河北）、https://s3.cn-"
"south-1.qiniucs.com（华南-广东）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/qiniu.py
msgid ""
"The bucket's S3 name, shown in the Qiniu console's \"Bucket overview\"; when "
"the bucket name is globally unique, it's the bucket name."
msgstr ""
"空间的 S3 空间名，在七牛控制台「空间概览」里看；空间名称全局唯一时就是空间名"
"称。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/qiniu.py
msgid "S3 bucket name"
msgstr "S3 空间名"

#: apps/storages/drivers/qiniu.py
msgid ""
"The CDN or origin domain bound to this bucket, written as https://domain. "
"Qiniu's S3 endpoint doesn't allow anonymous access, so download links use "
"this domain: with Qiniu's download token for private buckets, plain links "
"for public ones. When empty, S3-signed links are used. Buckets created since "
"April 8, 2026 don't allow downloading .apk, .ipa, .exe and similar files "
"through the S3 domain: such files need this domain, and downloads through "
"the site fail for them."
msgstr ""
"绑定到这个空间的 CDN 加速域名或源站域名，写成 https://域名。七牛的 S3 服务域"
"名不支持匿名访问，下载链接走这个域名：私有空间带七牛的下载凭证，公开空间是普"
"通链接。不填时用 S3 签名链接。2026 年 4 月 8 日起创建的空间不允许通过 S3 服务"
"域名下载 .apk、.ipa、.exe 等文件：这类文件要用这里的域名，代理下载会失败。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid "Please fill in %(what)s."
msgstr "请填写%(what)s。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(what)s should be http(s)://host[:port], without a path or query, like "
"%(example)s."
msgstr ""
"%(what)s要写成 http(s)://主机[:端口]，不带路径和参数，例如 %(example)s。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(label)s can only have English letters, digits and symbols, without spaces."
msgstr "%(label)s只能有英文字母、数字和符号，不能有空格。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "The XML from the storage has a DTD, so it isn't parsed."
msgstr "存储返回的 XML 带 DTD，拒绝解析。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "What the storage returned isn't valid XML."
msgstr "存储返回的内容不是有效的 XML。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "What the storage returned is too large."
msgstr "存储返回的内容太大了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The uploaded data is incomplete: %(missing)s byte short of the file size."
msgid_plural ""
"The uploaded data is incomplete: %(missing)s bytes short of the file size."
msgstr[0] "上传的数据不完整：比文件大小少了 %(missing)s 个字节。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid "The connection broke while reading the storage's data (%(error)s)."
msgstr "读取存储的数据时连接中断（%(error)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "the AccessKey doesn't exist"
msgstr "AccessKey 不存在"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "the signature is wrong; please check the SecretKey and the region"
msgstr "签名不对，请检查 SecretKey 和区域"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "these keys have no permission for this"
msgstr "这对密钥没有权限做这个操作"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "access to this bucket has been blocked"
msgstr "这个存储桶已经被禁止访问"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"something is wrong with the account; please look in the provider's console"
msgstr "账号有问题，请到服务商的控制台查看"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "the temporary key is invalid"
msgstr "临时密钥无效"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "the temporary key has expired"
msgstr "临时密钥已经过期"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "the temporary key needs refreshing"
msgstr "临时密钥需要刷新"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"the server's clock is too far from the storage's; please correct the "
"server's time"
msgstr "服务器的时间和存储相差太多，请校准服务器时间"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "the request has expired; please correct the server's time"
msgstr "请求已经过期，请校准服务器时间"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The bucket %(bucket)s doesn't exist (NoSuchBucket). Please check the bucket "
"name in the storage source's settings."
msgstr ""
"存储桶 %(bucket)s 不存在（NoSuchBucket），请检查存储源设置里的存储桶名称。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid "region %(region)s"
msgstr "区域 %(region)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "the Endpoint of the bucket's region"
msgstr "存储桶所在区域的 Endpoint"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The bucket isn't at this Endpoint (%(code)s). Please use %(where)s instead."
msgstr "存储桶不在这个 Endpoint（%(code)s），请改用 %(where)s。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid "Wrong region (%(code)s): %(detail)s"
msgstr "区域不对（%(code)s）：%(detail)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "please check the region in the storage source's settings"
msgstr "请检查存储源设置里的区域"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The storage doesn't allow downloading .apk and .ipa files through the "
"bucket's default domain (%(code)s); a custom or CDN domain bound to the "
"bucket is needed for them."
msgstr ""
"存储不允许通过存储桶的默认域名下载 .apk、.ipa 文件（%(code)s），这类文件要用"
"绑定到存储桶的自定义域名或 CDN 加速域名下载。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "please check the AccessKey, the SecretKey and the bucket's permissions"
msgstr "请检查 AccessKey、SecretKey 和存储桶的权限"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "The file is too large for the storage (EntityTooLarge)."
msgstr "文件太大，存储不接受（EntityTooLarge）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "The path is too long for the storage (KeyTooLongError)."
msgstr "路径太长，存储不接受（KeyTooLongError）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(count)s object can't be deleted: its name has both a . or .. part and "
"control characters (like %(example)s). Please delete it in the provider's "
"console."
msgid_plural ""
"%(count)s objects can't be deleted: their names have both a . or .. part and "
"control characters (like %(example)s). Please delete them in the provider's "
"console."
msgstr[0] ""
"有 %(count)s 个对象删不掉：名字里既有 . 或 .. 这样的一段，又有控制字符（例如 "
"%(example)s），请用服务商的控制台删除。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(count)s object wasn't deleted (like %(example)s): %(message)s"
msgid_plural ""
"%(count)s objects weren't deleted (like %(example)s): %(message)s"
msgstr[0] "有 %(count)s 个对象没删掉（例如 %(example)s）：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "The storage gave no UploadId for the multipart upload."
msgstr "存储没有给出分片上传的 UploadId。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "The storage gave no ETag for a part."
msgstr "存储没有给出分片的 ETag。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"The storage's file list pages are wrong (NextContinuationToken didn't "
"change)."
msgstr "存储的文件列表分页不对（NextContinuationToken 没有变）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"The storage's file list pages are wrong (no position for the next page)."
msgstr "存储的文件列表分页不对（没有下一页的位置）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "The AccessKey ID from \"Access keys\" in the provider's console."
msgstr "服务商控制台「访问密钥」里的 AccessKey ID。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "The SecretKey (AccessKey Secret) that goes with the AccessKey."
msgstr "和 AccessKey 配对的 SecretKey（AccessKey Secret）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"The folder in the bucket that is this storage source's root, like / or /"
"folder1."
msgstr "存储桶里的哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Private bucket"
msgstr "私有空间"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"A private bucket's download links are signed and expire; a public bucket's "
"(public read) are plain addresses that don't."
msgstr ""
"私有空间的下载链接带签名、会过期；公开空间（公共读）的下载链接是不过期的普通"
"地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"For browsers to upload straight to the bucket, the bucket must allow this "
"site's cross-origin requests (CORS): origin this site's address, methods "
"PUT, GET and HEAD, headers *, exposed header ETag. Click \"Allow direct "
"uploads from this site (set CORS)\" to add it, or set it in the provider's "
"console."
msgstr ""
"浏览器直接上传到存储桶时，存储桶要允许本站的跨域请求（CORS）：来源填本站地"
"址，方法 PUT、GET、HEAD，请求头 *，暴露头 ETag。可以点「允许本站直传（设置跨"
"域）」自动添加，也可以在服务商的控制台里设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Bucket name"
msgstr "存储桶名称"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"Optional. A CDN domain or custom domain bound to the bucket, written as "
"https://domain. When set, download links use it. Links of a private bucket "
"are still signed for the bucket's own address, so the CDN must send the "
"bucket's domain as Host when fetching from the origin, without origin "
"authentication."
msgstr ""
"可选。CDN 加速域名或绑定到存储桶的自定义域名，写成 https://域名。填了以后下载"
"链接改用这个域名。私有空间的链接仍按存储桶自己的地址签名，所以 CDN 回源时 "
"Host 要用存储桶的域名，并且不要开启回源鉴权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "S3-compatible storage"
msgstr "S3 兼容存储"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"The S3 API's address, with http:// or https://, like https://s3.us-"
"east-1.amazonaws.com, https://<account ID>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com or "
"http://192.168.1.10:9000."
msgstr ""
"S3 接口的地址，要带 http:// 或 https://，例如 https://s3.us-"
"east-1.amazonaws.com、https://<账号 ID>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com、http://"
"192.168.1.10:9000。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"The region for signing, like us-east-1 or auto (Cloudflare R2). When empty, "
"it's taken from an AWS Endpoint, or us-east-1 otherwise."
msgstr ""
"签名用的区域，例如 us-east-1、auto（Cloudflare R2）。留空时从 AWS 的 "
"Endpoint 里取，取不到就用 us-east-1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Addressing style"
msgstr "访问方式"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Virtual-hosted style (bucket.Endpoint)"
msgstr "虚拟主机风格（存储桶名.Endpoint）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Path style (Endpoint/bucket)"
msgstr "路径风格（Endpoint/存储桶名）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"AWS and most cloud services use virtual-hosted style; self-hosted services "
"(MinIO, Ceph and so on) usually use path style. Path style is used anyway "
"when the Endpoint is an IP address or the bucket name can't be part of a "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"AWS 和大多数云服务用虚拟主机风格；自建的服务（MinIO、Ceph 等）一般用路径风"
"格。Endpoint 是 IP 地址、或存储桶名不能做域名时，自动用路径风格。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"Optional, written as https://domain. When set, download links use it. With "
"virtual-hosted style it is the bucket's CDN or custom domain, and private "
"links are still signed for the bucket's own address, so the CDN must send "
"the bucket's domain as Host when fetching from the origin, without origin "
"authentication; with path style it is the S3 service's public address (MinIO "
"behind an Nginx reverse proxy, say, which must keep the Host header), and "
"download links and direct uploads are signed for it."
msgstr ""
"可选，写成 https://域名。填了以后下载链接改用这个域名。虚拟主机风格时，它是存"
"储桶的 CDN 或自定义域名，私有空间的链接仍按存储桶自己的地址签名，所以 CDN 回"
"源时 Host 要用存储桶的域名，并且不要开启回源鉴权；路径风格时，它是 S3 服务对"
"外的地址（例如 Nginx 反向代理后的 MinIO，代理要保留 Host 请求头），下载链接和"
"浏览器直传都按它签名。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Don't verify the TLS certificate"
msgstr "不校验 TLS 证书"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"Only for a self-hosted S3 service with a self-signed certificate; don't turn "
"it on for cloud services."
msgstr "只用于自建的、用自签名证书的 S3 服务；云服务不要打开。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "List buckets"
msgstr "列出存储桶"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Show CORS settings"
msgstr "查看跨域设置"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Allow direct uploads from this site (set CORS)"
msgstr "允许本站直传（设置跨域）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"Leave the bucket name out of the Endpoint: enter the service's address, and "
"the bucket name on its own."
msgstr "Endpoint 里不要带存储桶名：填服务的地址，存储桶名单独填。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "The region can only have letters, digits, - and _, like us-east-1."
msgstr "区域只能有字母、数字、- 和 _，例如 us-east-1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Please fill in the bucket name."
msgstr "请填写存储桶名称。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"Invalid bucket name: it can't have spaces or the characters /, \\, ?, # and "
"%."
msgstr "存储桶名称不对：不能有空格、/、\\、?、#、% 这些字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid "Please fill in %(labels)s first."
msgstr "请先填写%(labels)s。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "These keys have no buckets."
msgstr "这对密钥下面没有存储桶。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(bucket)s (created %(created)s)"
msgstr "%(bucket)s（%(created)s 创建）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"This bucket has no CORS rules yet, so browsers can't upload to it directly."
msgstr "这个存储桶还没有跨域（CORS）规则，浏览器不能直接上传。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(index)s. Origins %(origins)s; methods %(methods)s; headers %(headers)s; "
"exposed headers %(exposed)s"
msgstr ""
"%(index)s. 来源 %(origins)s；方法 %(methods)s；请求头 %(headers)s；暴露头 "
"%(exposed)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "The bucket's CORS rules now:\n"
msgstr "存储桶现在的跨域规则：\n"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "This site's address (origin) is missing, so CORS can't be set."
msgstr "缺少本站的地址（origin），无法设置跨域。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid "The bucket already allows cross-origin uploads from %(origin)s."
msgstr "存储桶已经允许 %(origin)s 跨域上传了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid "Cross-origin uploads and downloads from %(origin)s are allowed now."
msgstr "已经允许 %(origin)s 跨域上传和下载。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The path is too long: a full object storage path is at most %(limit)s byte."
msgid_plural ""
"The path is too long: a full object storage path is at most %(limit)s bytes."
msgstr[0] "路径太长了：对象存储的完整路径最多 %(limit)s 个字节。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "The file is too large: object storage takes at most 48.8 TiB per file."
msgstr "文件太大了：对象存储的单个文件最大 48.8 TiB。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"MinIO's S3 API address (not the web console's), with the scheme, like http://"
"192.168.1.10:9000."
msgstr ""
"MinIO 的 S3 接口地址（不是网页控制台的地址），要带协议，例如 http://"
"192.168.1.10:9000。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Service address"
msgstr "服务地址"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "MINIO_SITE_REGION when MinIO has it set; otherwise keep us-east-1."
msgstr "MinIO 设置了 MINIO_SITE_REGION 时填它，否则保持 us-east-1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"MinIO has no CORS settings per bucket: it takes cross-origin requests from "
"every origin, unless MINIO_API_CORS_ALLOW_ORIGIN (or the setting api "
"cors_allow_origin) names some; then this site's address must be among them "
"for browsers to upload straight to the bucket."
msgstr ""
"MinIO 没有按存储桶的跨域设置：它接受所有来源的跨域请求，除非 "
"MINIO_API_CORS_ALLOW_ORIGIN（或配置项 api cors_allow_origin）指定了来源；指定"
"了的话，其中要有本站地址，浏览器才能直接上传到存储桶。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"Optional. MinIO's public address, like https://minio.example.com behind an "
"Nginx reverse proxy (which must keep the Host header). Fill it in when the "
"service address is internal: download links and direct uploads are signed "
"for it."
msgstr ""
"可选。MinIO 对外的地址，例如 Nginx 反向代理后的 https://minio.example.com（代"
"理要保留 Host 请求头）。服务地址是内网地址时填它：下载链接和浏览器直传都按它"
"签名。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Turn on when MinIO uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "MinIO 用自签名证书时打开。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Alibaba Cloud OSS"
msgstr "阿里云 OSS"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"The OSS region endpoint, with the scheme, like https://oss-cn-"
"hangzhou.aliyuncs.com; when the server is an Alibaba Cloud ECS in the same "
"region, the internal endpoint https://oss-cn-hangzhou-internal.aliyuncs.com "
"works too: the site then reads and writes over the internal network, while "
"download links and direct uploads use the public endpoint."
msgstr ""
"OSS 的地域节点，要带协议，例如 https://oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com；服务器在"
"同地域的阿里云 ECS 上时可以用内网节点 https://oss-cn-hangzhou-"
"internal.aliyuncs.com：这时本站读写走内网，下载链接和浏览器直传仍用外网节点。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgctxt "Aliyun, DogeCloud"
msgid "The bucket's name."
msgstr "存储空间（Bucket）的名称。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"Optional. A custom or CDN domain bound to the bucket, written as https://"
"domain. When set, download links use it; private links use OSS's own "
"signatures, which aren't tied to a host, so custom domains work too."
msgstr ""
"可选。绑定到存储空间的自定义域名或 CDN 加速域名，写成 https://域名。填了以后"
"下载链接改用这个域名；私有空间的链接用 OSS 自己的签名，不绑定主机，所以自定义"
"域名也能用。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Tencent Cloud COS"
msgstr "腾讯云 COS"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"The COS region endpoint, with the scheme, like https://cos.ap-"
"guangzhou.myqcloud.com."
msgstr "COS 的地域节点，要带协议，例如 https://cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "The SecretId from Tencent Cloud's \"Access management → API keys\"."
msgstr "腾讯云「访问管理 → API 密钥」里的 SecretId。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "The SecretKey that goes with the SecretId."
msgstr "和 SecretId 配对的 SecretKey。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "The bucket's full name with the APPID, like examplebucket-1250000000."
msgstr "存储桶的完整名称，带 APPID，例如 examplebucket-1250000000。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"Turn on for private-read buckets: download links are signed and expire. Turn "
"it off when you use a custom CDN domain with origin authentication on in "
"Tencent Cloud."
msgstr ""
"私有读的存储桶打开：下载链接带签名、会过期。用自定义 CDN 域名并在腾讯云开启了"
"回源鉴权时，请关闭这个选项。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"Optional. A CDN domain or custom domain bound to the bucket, written as "
"https://domain. When set, download links use it. Links of a private bucket "
"are still signed for the bucket's own address, so the CDN must send the "
"bucket's domain as Host when fetching from the origin, without origin "
"authentication. Tencent Cloud CDN's \"origin authentication\" conflicts with "
"private bucket signatures here: only one of them can be used. Buckets "
"created since 2024 don't allow downloading .apk and .ipa files through their "
"default domain, except over Tencent Cloud's internal network: such files "
"need this domain, and downloads through the site fail for them."
msgstr ""
"可选。CDN 加速域名或绑定到存储桶的自定义域名，写成 https://域名。填了以后下载"
"链接改用这个域名。私有空间的链接仍按存储桶自己的地址签名，所以 CDN 回源时 "
"Host 要用存储桶的域名，并且不要开启回源鉴权。腾讯云 CDN 的「回源鉴权」和这里"
"的私有空间签名会冲突，二者只能用一个。2024 年起创建的存储桶不允许通过默认域名"
"下载 .apk、.ipa 文件（腾讯云内网访问除外）：这类文件要用这里的域名，代理下载"
"会失败。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"A COS bucket name must include the APPID, written as name-APPID, like "
"examplebucket-1250000000."
msgstr ""
"COS 的存储桶名称要带 APPID，写成 名称-APPID，例如 examplebucket-1250000000。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid "Huawei Cloud OBS"
msgstr "华为云 OBS"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"The OBS endpoint, with the scheme, like https://obs.cn-"
"north-4.myhuaweicloud.com."
msgstr ""
"OBS 的终端节点，要带协议，例如 https://obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgctxt "Huawei Cloud"
msgid "The bucket's name."
msgstr "桶（Bucket）的名称。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgctxt "Huawei Cloud"
msgid "Bucket name"
msgstr "桶名称"

#: apps/storages/drivers/s3.py
msgid ""
"Buckets created after December 30, 2023 don't allow downloading .apk "
"and .ipa files through their default domain over the internet: such files "
"need a custom domain here, and downloads through the site fail for them."
msgstr ""
"2023 年 12 月 30 日以后创建的存储桶不允许通过默认域名从公网下载 .apk、.ipa 文"
"件：这类文件要在这里填自定义域名，代理下载会失败。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "Seafile"
msgstr "Seafile"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "The address of the Seafile server, as it is opened in a browser."
msgstr "Seafile 服务器的地址，就是在浏览器里打开它的那个地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "The account's email address (or username)."
msgstr "账号的邮箱（或用户名）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid ""
"Instead of the username and password: the account's API token. Accounts with "
"two-factor authentication need it."
msgstr "代替用户名和密码：账号的 API 令牌。开了两步验证的账号要用它。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "Library"
msgstr "资料库"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid ""
"The name or ID of the library to show. Empty: every library of the account, "
"as the folders of the root."
msgstr ""
"要显示的资料库的名称或 ID。留空时把账号的所有资料库显示为根目录下的文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "Library password"
msgstr "资料库密码"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "For an encrypted library."
msgstr "用于加密的资料库。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid ""
"With a library: its folder that is this storage source's root, like / or /"
"folder1."
msgstr ""
"填了资料库时：资料库里哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid ""
"The address should start with http:// or https://, like https://"
"seafile.example.com."
msgstr "地址要以 http:// 或 https:// 开头，比如 https://seafile.example.com。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "Give the username and password, or the token."
msgstr "请填写用户名和密码，或者令牌。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "A base path needs a library."
msgstr "要先填资料库，才能设基路径。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid ""
"This Seafile account uses two-factor authentication: give its API token "
"instead of the password."
msgstr "这个 Seafile 账号开了两步验证：请改填它的 API 令牌，不用密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "Seafile refused the username or password."
msgstr "Seafile 不接受这个用户名或密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The library %(library)s is encrypted: give its password in the storage "
"source's settings."
msgstr "资料库 %(library)s 是加密的：请在存储源设置里填写它的密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "Seafile refused the library password."
msgstr "Seafile 不接受这个资料库密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "Seafile refused the token. Please check the storage source's settings."
msgstr "Seafile 不接受这个令牌，请检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "The file is larger than the Seafile server takes (its max_upload_size)."
msgstr "文件超过了 Seafile 服务器允许上传的大小（它的 max_upload_size）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "The Seafile account is out of space."
msgstr "Seafile 账号的空间不够了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
#, python-format
msgid "Seafile refused this: %(message)s"
msgstr "Seafile 拒绝了这个操作：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
#, python-format
msgid "Seafile refused this (HTTP %(status)s): %(message)s"
msgstr "Seafile 拒绝了这个操作（HTTP %(status)s）：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
#, python-format
msgid "Seafile failed (HTTP %(status)s). Please try again later."
msgstr "Seafile 出错了（HTTP %(status)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
#, python-format
msgid "Seafile has no library %(library)s for this account."
msgstr "这个 Seafile 账号没有资料库 %(library)s。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "The storage source's root folder can't be changed."
msgstr "存储源的根目录不能修改。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid "Libraries are made, renamed and deleted in Seafile itself."
msgstr "资料库要在 Seafile 里新建、改名和删除。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/seafile.py
msgid ""
"Seafile asked for the library's password again during the upload. Please "
"upload the file again."
msgstr "Seafile 在上传过程中要求重新提供资料库密码，请重新上传这个文件。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid ""
"PuTTY .ppk private keys aren't supported: convert it to OpenSSH format with "
"PuTTYgen (Conversions → Export OpenSSH key) first."
msgstr ""
"不支持 PuTTY 的 .ppk 私钥：请用 PuTTYgen 转成 OpenSSH 格式（Conversions → "
"Export OpenSSH key）后再填。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "This private key is password-protected. Please fill in its passphrase."
msgstr "这个私钥有密码保护，请填写私钥密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "This kind of private key isn't supported."
msgstr "不支持这种私钥。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "The passphrase is wrong, or the private key is malformed."
msgstr "私钥密码不对，或者私钥的格式不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "The private key is malformed."
msgstr "私钥的格式不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid ""
"This kind of private key isn't supported: please use an Ed25519, ECDSA or "
"RSA key."
msgstr "不支持这种私钥：请用 Ed25519、ECDSA 或 RSA 私钥。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "timed out waiting for the server's answer"
msgstr "等待服务器回答超时"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "The SSH server's domain or IP."
msgstr "SSH 服务器的域名或 IP。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid ""
"Fill in the password, the private key or both; both when the server asks for "
"both."
msgstr "密码和私钥至少填一个；服务器要求两个都要时就都填。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "Private key"
msgstr "私钥"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid ""
"The whole private key in OpenSSH or PEM format (Ed25519, ECDSA or RSA). "
"Convert PuTTY .ppk keys to OpenSSH format with PuTTYgen first."
msgstr ""
"OpenSSH 或 PEM 格式的私钥全文（Ed25519、ECDSA 或 RSA）。PuTTY 的 .ppk 私钥请"
"先用 PuTTYgen 转成 OpenSSH 格式。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "Private key passphrase"
msgstr "私钥密码"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "Fill in when the private key is password-protected."
msgstr "私钥有密码保护时填写。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "Host key fingerprint"
msgstr "主机密钥指纹"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid ""
"Confirms that the server connected to is the real one. When empty, the first "
"connection notes the server's fingerprint and later connections are refused "
"if it changes. You can also run ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/"
"ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub on the server and enter the fingerprint it shows."
msgstr ""
"用来确认连上的是真的服务器。留空时，第一次连接会记下服务器的指纹，以后指纹变"
"了就拒绝连接。也可以在服务器上运行 ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/"
"ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub，把显示的指纹填进来。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid ""
"The folder on the server that is the storage's root, as an absolute path "
"like /home/user/files."
msgstr ""
"服务器上的哪个文件夹作为存储的根目录，填绝对路径，例如 /home/user/files。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid ""
"The most SSH connections to the server at once; keep it below what the "
"server allows (OpenSSH's MaxStartups). Each download in progress takes one "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"同时连到服务器的 SSH 连接数上限，要小于服务器允许的数量（OpenSSH 的 "
"MaxStartups）。每个正在进行的下载占用一个连接。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid ""
"All connections to the SFTP server are in use (downloads hold theirs until "
"done). Please try again later, or raise \"Max connections\"."
msgstr ""
"SFTP 服务器的连接都在使用中（下载会一直占着连接），请稍后再试，或者调大「最大"
"连接数」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "Only the domain or IP, like sftp.example.com."
msgstr "只填域名或 IP，例如 sftp.example.com。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "Please fill in the username."
msgstr "请填写用户名。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "Fill in at least the password or the private key."
msgstr "密码和私钥至少要填一个。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid ""
"The fingerprint is malformed: it should look like ssh-ed25519 SHA256:xxxx "
"(as ssh-keygen -lf shows it)."
msgstr ""
"指纹的格式不对，应该像 ssh-ed25519 SHA256:xxxx（ssh-keygen -lf 显示的那样）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "The SFTP storage has no server address set."
msgstr "SFTP 存储没有设置服务器地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid ""
"The SFTP storage's base path is set wrong. Please ask the administrator to "
"check the storage source's settings."
msgstr "SFTP 存储的基路径设置得不对，请管理员检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "Couldn't connect to the SFTP server %(host)s:%(port)s: %(error)s"
msgstr "连不上 SFTP 服务器 %(host)s:%(port)s：%(error)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The SFTP server %(host)s:%(port)s didn't finish the handshake within "
"%(seconds)s second (timed out). Please check the address and port, or try "
"again later."
msgid_plural ""
"The SFTP server %(host)s:%(port)s didn't finish the handshake within "
"%(seconds)s seconds (timed out). Please check the address and port, or try "
"again later."
msgstr[0] ""
"SFTP 服务器 %(host)s:%(port)s 在 %(seconds)s 秒内没有完成握手（超时），请检查"
"地址和端口，或者稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The SFTP server %(host)s:%(port)s accepted the login, but SFTP didn't start "
"(%(error)s). The account may not be allowed SFTP, or its login shell prints "
"text (nologin, or an echo in .bashrc) where SFTP's data should be; OpenSSH's "
"\"Subsystem sftp internal-sftp\" doesn't go through the shell."
msgstr ""
"SFTP 服务器 %(host)s:%(port)s 登录成功了，但 SFTP 没有启动（%(error)s）。可能"
"是这个账号不允许用 SFTP，或者它的登录 shell 会打印文字（nologin，或"
"者 .bashrc 里的 echo），占了 SFTP 数据的位置；OpenSSH 设成「Subsystem sftp "
"internal-sftp」就不经过 shell。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The SFTP server %(host)s:%(port)s and this program have no encryption "
"algorithm in common (%(error)s). Servers that offer only old ones, such as "
"ssh-rsa and diffie-hellman-group14-sha1 with SHA-1 (OpenSSH before 7.2), "
"need updating."
msgstr ""
"SFTP 服务器 %(host)s:%(port)s 和本程序没有都支持的加密算法（%(error)s）。只提"
"供旧算法的服务器（例如用 SHA-1 的 ssh-rsa、diffie-hellman-group14-sha1，"
"OpenSSH 7.2 以前的版本）需要升级。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Setting up the connection to the SFTP server %(host)s:%(port)s failed: "
"%(error)s"
msgstr "和 SFTP 服务器 %(host)s:%(port)s 建立连接失败：%(error)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid ""
"The host key fingerprint in the storage source's settings is malformed. "
"Please ask the administrator to check it."
msgstr "存储源设置里的主机密钥指纹格式不对，请管理员检查。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The SFTP server's host key doesn't match the saved fingerprint; the server's "
"is now %(fingerprint)s. Someone may be posing as the server; if the server "
"really changed its key, the administrator should check it and put the new "
"fingerprint in the storage source's settings (or clear it to note it on the "
"next connection)."
msgstr ""
"SFTP 服务器的主机密钥和保存的指纹对不上，服务器现在的是 %(fingerprint)s。可能"
"有人在冒充服务器；如果确实是服务器换了密钥，请管理员核对后在存储源设置里改成"
"新的指纹（或者清空，下次连接时重新记下）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"SFTP login failed: the server doesn't accept private keys (it accepts: "
"%(methods)s). Please fill in the password."
msgstr ""
"SFTP 登录失败：服务器不接受私钥登录（它接受的是：%(methods)s）。请填写密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "SFTP login failed: the server doesn't accept this private key."
msgstr "SFTP 登录失败：服务器不接受这个私钥。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"SFTP login failed: the server doesn't accept passwords (it accepts: "
"%(methods)s). Please fill in a private key."
msgstr ""
"SFTP 登录失败：服务器不接受密码登录（它接受的是：%(methods)s）。请填写私钥。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "SFTP login failed: wrong username or password."
msgstr "SFTP 登录失败：用户名或密码不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "SFTP login failed: wrong username, password or private key."
msgstr "SFTP 登录失败：用户名、密码或私钥不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "The connection to the SFTP server failed: %(reason)s"
msgstr "和 SFTP 服务器的连接出错了：%(reason)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "The file permissions on the SFTP server don't allow this."
msgstr "SFTP 服务器上的文件权限不允许这个操作。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "The SFTP server refused this: %(detail)s"
msgstr "SFTP 服务器拒绝了这个操作：%(detail)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
#, python-format
msgid "The SFTP server's answer is wrong: %(error)s"
msgstr "SFTP 服务器的回答不对：%(error)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "The SFTP server sent a path that isn't UTF-8."
msgstr "SFTP 服务器发来的路径不是 UTF-8。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid "Names in SFTP storage can't contain \\."
msgstr "SFTP 存储的名字里不能有 \\。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/sftp.py
msgid ""
"The base path set doesn't exist on the SFTP server. Please ask the "
"administrator to check the storage source's settings."
msgstr "SFTP 服务器上没有设置的基路径，请管理员检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "its password has expired"
msgstr "它的密码已经过期"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "its password must be changed first"
msgstr "要先修改它的密码"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "it is disabled"
msgstr "它被停用了"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "it has expired"
msgstr "它已经过期"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "it is locked out after too many wrong passwords"
msgstr "密码错误的次数太多，它被锁定了"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "a restriction of the account forbids this logon"
msgstr "账号的限制不允许这次登录"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "it may not log on at this time"
msgstr "现在不是它可以登录的时间"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "it may not log on from this computer"
msgstr "它不能从这台计算机登录"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "it may not log on over the network"
msgstr "它不能通过网络登录"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "SMB (Windows share)"
msgstr "SMB（Windows 共享）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "Server"
msgstr "服务器"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "The server's name or IP address."
msgstr "服务器的名称或 IP 地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "Shared folder"
msgstr "共享文件夹"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "The name of the shared folder on that server."
msgstr "服务器上共享文件夹的名称。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid ""
"DOMAIN\\user or user@domain for a domain account. Empty: the server's guest "
"account."
msgstr "域账号写成 域\\用户名 或 用户名@域。留空时用服务器的来宾账号。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "Encrypt"
msgstr "加密"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid ""
"Ask for SMB 3's encryption of everything sent (the server must have it)."
msgstr "要求用 SMB 3 的加密传输所有内容（服务器要支持）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid ""
"The folder of the share that is this storage source's root, like / or /"
"folder1."
msgstr "共享文件夹里的哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "Give the server's name or IP address, without \\\\ or smb://."
msgstr "请填写服务器的名称或 IP 地址，不要带 \\\\ 或 smb://。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "Give the name of the shared folder only, like public."
msgstr "只填共享文件夹的名称，比如 public。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid ""
"The server's guest account can't encrypt: please fill in a username, or turn "
"this off."
msgstr "服务器的来宾账号不能加密：请填写用户名，或者关掉这一项。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "The SMB server refused the username or password."
msgstr "SMB 服务器不接受这个用户名或密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
#, python-format
msgid "The server %(host)s has no share named %(share)s."
msgstr "服务器 %(host)s 上没有名为 %(share)s 的共享文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "The SMB server refused this: no permission."
msgstr "SMB 服务器拒绝了这个操作：没有权限。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A link on the SMB server leads to %(target)s, which can't be followed from "
"here."
msgstr "SMB 服务器上的一个链接指向 %(target)s，本站没法跟过去。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
#, python-format
msgid "The SMB server refused the account %(username)s: %(reason)s."
msgstr "SMB 服务器拒绝了账号 %(username)s：%(reason)s。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "The file is in use on the SMB server. Please try again later."
msgstr "这个文件在 SMB 服务器上正被使用，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "The SMB share is out of space."
msgstr "SMB 共享文件夹的空间不够了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "This account's quota on the SMB share is used up."
msgstr "这个账号在 SMB 共享文件夹上的配额用完了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
msgid "The SMB server doesn't accept this name."
msgstr "SMB 服务器不接受这个名字。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
#, python-format
msgid "The SMB server %(host)s answered with an error (%(status)s)."
msgstr "SMB 服务器 %(host)s 返回了错误（%(status)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
#, python-format
msgid "Couldn't reach the SMB server %(host)s: %(message)s"
msgstr "连不上 SMB 服务器 %(host)s：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/smb.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s couldn't be replaced: the file may be open in another program, or "
"this account may not change it."
msgstr ""
"没能替换 %(name)s：这个文件可能正被别的程序打开着，或者这个账号不能修改它。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
msgid "Teldrive"
msgstr "Teldrive"

#: apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
msgid ""
"The address of the Teldrive server, as it is opened in a browser. It must be "
"Teldrive 2.0 or later."
msgstr ""
"Teldrive 服务器的地址，就是在浏览器里打开它的那个地址。要是 Teldrive 2.0 或更"
"新的版本。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
msgid ""
"In Teldrive, open Settings → API keys, create a key and copy its secret, "
"which Teldrive shows only once. HFile then acts as the account that made the "
"key."
msgstr ""
"在 Teldrive 里打开「设置 → API 密钥」，创建一个 API 密钥并复制它（Teldrive 只"
"显示一次）。HFile 会以创建这个密钥的账号来操作。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
msgid ""
"The folder in Teldrive that is this storage source's root, like / or /"
"folder1."
msgstr "Teldrive 里哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
msgid "Upload part size (MiB)"
msgstr "上传分片大小（MiB）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
msgid ""
"Teldrive keeps a file in Telegram in parts of this size, each uploaded in "
"one request; Telegram takes at most 2000 MiB. Make it smaller than the "
"largest request a proxy in front of Teldrive lets through, and small enough "
"to upload within an hour, after which Teldrive ends a request by default."
msgstr ""
"Teldrive 把文件按这个大小分片存进 Telegram，每个分片用一个请求上传；Telegram "
"最多收 2000 MiB。Teldrive 前面有代理时，要比代理放行的最大请求小；还要能在一"
"小时内传完，Teldrive 默认一个请求超过一小时就中断。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
msgid ""
"The address should start with http:// or https://, like https://"
"drive.example.com."
msgstr "地址要以 http:// 或 https:// 开头，比如 https://drive.example.com。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
msgid ""
"A Teldrive API key has only ASCII letters, digits and symbols. Please copy "
"it again from Teldrive."
msgstr ""
"Teldrive 的 API 密钥只有英文字母、数字和半角符号，请从 Teldrive 重新复制一"
"遍。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The answer from %(service)s couldn't be understood: is the address that of a "
"Teldrive server?"
msgstr "%(service)s 返回的数据看不懂：这个地址是 Teldrive 服务器吗？"

#: apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
msgid ""
"Teldrive refused the API key: it may have been revoked, or have expired. "
"Please make a new one in Teldrive (Settings → API keys) and save it in the "
"storage source's settings."
msgstr ""
"Teldrive 不接受这个 API 密钥：它可能已被撤销，或者已经过期。请在 Teldrive 里"
"（「设置 → API 密钥」）新建一个，填到存储源的设置里。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
msgid ""
"Teldrive's web server, or a proxy in front of it, refused an upload part as "
"too large (HTTP 413). Make the storage source's upload part size smaller, or "
"that server's limit larger (Teldrive's documentation sets nginx's "
"client_max_body_size to 0)."
msgstr ""
"Teldrive 的网页服务器或它前面的代理嫌上传的分片太大，拒绝了（HTTP 413）。请把"
"存储源的上传分片大小调小，或者把那个服务器的限制调大（Teldrive 的文档里把 "
"nginx 的 client_max_body_size 设成 0）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
#, python-format
msgid "Teldrive refused this (HTTP %(status_code)s): %(message)s"
msgstr "Teldrive 拒绝了这个操作（HTTP %(status_code)s）：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/teldrive.py
msgid ""
"No Teldrive API answered at this address (HTTP 404). Please check the "
"address: it must be that of a Teldrive server, version 2.0 or later."
msgstr ""
"这个地址上没有 Teldrive 的接口（HTTP 404）。请检查地址：要是 Teldrive 服务器"
"的地址，版本 2.0 或更新。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
#, python-format
msgid " (%(code)s %(message)s)"
msgstr "（%(code)s %(message)s）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
#, python-format
msgid " (%(message)s)"
msgstr "（%(message)s）"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The UpYun service doesn't exist%(detail)s. Please check the service name."
msgstr "又拍云的服务不存在%(detail)s，请检查服务名称。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"UpYun refused the request%(detail)s: please check the operator name and "
"password."
msgstr "又拍云拒绝了请求%(detail)s：请检查操作员名称和密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The UpYun operator lacks this permission%(detail)s. Please give it read, "
"write and delete permissions in the service's operator authorization."
msgstr ""
"又拍云的操作员没有这个权限%(detail)s，请在服务的操作员授权里给它读取、写入和"
"删除权限。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The server's clock is too far from UpYun's%(detail)s. Please correct the "
"server's time."
msgstr "服务器时间和又拍云相差太多%(detail)s，请校准服务器时间。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
#, python-format
msgid "UpYun refused the request%(detail)s."
msgstr "又拍云拒绝了请求%(detail)s。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
#, python-format
msgid "UpYun doesn't accept this name%(detail)s."
msgstr "又拍云不接受这个名字%(detail)s。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
#, python-format
msgid "The UpYun storage is full%(detail)s."
msgstr "又拍云的存储空间满了%(detail)s。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
#, python-format
msgid "UpYun is busy%(detail)s. Please try again later."
msgstr "又拍云繁忙%(detail)s，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
#, python-format
msgid "UpYun failed (HTTP %(status)s)%(detail)s. Please try again later."
msgstr "又拍云出错（HTTP %(status)s）%(detail)s，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
#, python-format
msgid "UpYun refused the request (HTTP %(status)s)%(detail)s."
msgstr "又拍云拒绝了请求（HTTP %(status)s）%(detail)s。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "UpYun"
msgstr "又拍云"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "Service name"
msgstr "服务名称"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid ""
"The name of the UpYun storage service. Direct uploads from the browser use "
"UpYun's form API, so no CORS settings are needed."
msgstr "又拍云云存储服务的名称。浏览器直传走又拍云的表单接口，不用设置跨域。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "Operator"
msgstr "操作员"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid ""
"An operator added in the service's \"Operator authorization\", with read, "
"write and delete permissions."
msgstr "在服务的「操作员授权」里添加的操作员，要有可读取、可写入和可删除权限。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "Operator password"
msgstr "操作员密码"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid ""
"The folder in the service that is this storage source's root, like / or /"
"folder1."
msgstr "服务里的哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid ""
"The CDN domain bound to the service, written as https://domain. When empty, "
"UpYun's test domain for the service, http://service-name.test.upcdn.net, is "
"used, which is only good for trying it out."
msgstr ""
"服务绑定的加速域名，写成 https://域名。不填时用又拍云给服务的测试域名 http://"
"服务名称.test.upcdn.net，只适合试用。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "Token hotlink protection key"
msgstr "Token 防盗链密钥"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid ""
"After turning it on in UpYun's \"Access control → Token hotlink "
"protection\", enter its key here, and download links get a time-limited _upt "
"signature."
msgstr ""
"在又拍云的「访问控制 → Token 防盗链」里开启后，把那里的密钥填在这里，下载链接"
"就会带上有时效的 _upt 签名。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "Please fill in the service name."
msgstr "请填写服务名称。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "The service name can't have spaces or the characters / \\ ? # % &."
msgstr "服务名称里不能有空格和 / \\ ? # % & 这些字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "Please fill in the operator password."
msgstr "请填写操作员密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
#, python-format
msgid "Connecting to UpYun failed (%(error)s): %(detail)s"
msgstr "连接又拍云失败（%(error)s）：%(detail)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
#, python-format
msgid "Reading UpYun's answer failed (%(error)s)."
msgstr "读取又拍云的回应失败（%(error)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "UpYun's file list couldn't be understood."
msgstr "又拍云的文件列表看不懂。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "UpYun's file list pages are wrong."
msgstr "又拍云的文件列表分页不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "The range UpYun returned (Content-Range) is wrong."
msgstr "又拍云返回的范围（Content-Range）不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "The file is too large for UpYun's chunked upload."
msgstr "文件太大了：又拍云的分块上传放不下。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/upyun.py
msgid "UpYun gave no chunked upload ID (X-Upyun-Multi-Uuid)."
msgstr "又拍云没有给出分块上传的任务标识（X-Upyun-Multi-Uuid）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/url_tree.py
msgid ""
"The file's address isn't a valid web address. Please correct it in the "
"storage source's settings."
msgstr "文件的地址不是有效的网址，请在存储源的设置里改正。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/url_tree.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Line %(line)s: indent with two spaces a level, one level deeper than the "
"folder above at most."
msgstr "第 %(line)s 行：每深一层缩进两个空格，最多比上面的文件夹深一层。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/url_tree.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Line %(line)s: a folder ends with \":\", a file has an http:// or https:// "
"address."
msgstr ""
"第 %(line)s 行：文件夹以「:」结尾，文件要有 http:// 或 https:// 开头的地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/url_tree.py
#, python-format
msgid "Line %(line)s: the address isn't a valid web address."
msgstr "第 %(line)s 行：地址不是有效的网址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/url_tree.py
#, python-format
msgid "Line %(line)s: the name is missing or can't be used."
msgstr "第 %(line)s 行：没有名字，或者这个名字不能用。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/url_tree.py
#, python-format
msgid "Line %(line)s: %(name)s is in this folder already."
msgstr "第 %(line)s 行：这个文件夹里已经有 %(name)s 了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/url_tree.py
msgid "Give at least one file or folder."
msgstr "请至少填一个文件或文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/url_tree.py
msgid "URL tree"
msgstr "URL 树"

#: apps/storages/drivers/url_tree.py
msgid ""
"One per line, two spaces of indent a folder deeper. A folder: name: (with "
"the \":\"). A file: its address, or name:address, or name:size in "
"bytes:address."
msgstr ""
"一行一个，每深一层文件夹缩进两个空格。文件夹写成 名字:（带「:」）。文件写它的"
"地址，或者 名字:地址，或者 名字:字节数:地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/url_tree.py
msgid "Ask for sizes in listings"
msgstr "列表时查询大小"

#: apps/storages/drivers/url_tree.py
msgid ""
"Ask the servers for the size of the files without one (HEAD) when a folder "
"is listed, not only when a file is opened."
msgstr ""
"列出文件夹时就向服务器查询没写大小的文件的大小（HEAD），而不只是在打开文件时"
"查。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/url_tree.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The web server refused access (HTTP %(status)s); the link may have expired."
msgstr "网页服务器拒绝访问（HTTP %(status)s），链接可能已经过期。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "Please fill in the WebDAV address."
msgstr "请填写 WebDAV 地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The address can't contain control characters such as line breaks."
msgstr "地址里不能有换行符这类控制字符。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The server address can't contain spaces."
msgstr "服务器地址里不能有空格。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The address must start with http:// or https://."
msgstr "地址要以 http:// 或 https:// 开头。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The address has no server."
msgstr "地址里没有服务器。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "Put the username and password in the fields below, not in the address."
msgstr "用户名和密码请填在下面的栏里，不要写进地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The address can't have a part after ? or #."
msgstr "地址里不能有 ? 或 # 后面的部分。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The port in the address is wrong."
msgstr "地址里的端口不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The address's path can't have . or .."
msgstr "地址的路径里不能有 . 或 ..。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The server's name in the address is wrong."
msgstr "地址里的服务器名不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid ""
"The WebDAV server puts the rest of this folder's listing at an address HFile "
"doesn't follow."
msgstr "WebDAV 服务器把这个文件夹列表的后面部分放在了 HFile 不会去读的地址。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The WebDAV server ended the transfer early."
msgstr "WebDAV 服务器提前结束了传输。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
#, python-format
msgid "Reading the file from the WebDAV server failed: %(error)s"
msgstr "从 WebDAV 服务器读文件时出错了：%(error)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "WebDAV address"
msgstr "WebDAV 地址"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid ""
"With the path on the server: the folder at this address is the storage's "
"root. For Nextcloud, say, https://domain/remote.php/dav/files/username/; for "
"Synology, https://domain:5006/shared-folder/."
msgstr ""
"包括服务器上的路径，这个地址对应的文件夹就是存储的根目录。例如 Nextcloud 是 "
"https://域名/remote.php/dav/files/用户名/，群晖是 https://域名:5006/共享文件"
"夹/。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid ""
"For services with two-step verification on, such as Nextcloud, enter an "
"\"app password\" here."
msgstr "Nextcloud 等开了两步验证的服务，这里要填「应用密码」。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid ""
"Verifies the server's certificate over https. It can be turned off for "
"servers with self-signed certificates such as NASes, but then someone could "
"pose as the server."
msgstr ""
"用 https 时校验服务器的证书。NAS 等用自签名证书的服务器可以关掉，但这样连接可"
"能被人冒充。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The username can't contain a colon."
msgstr "用户名里不能有冒号。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid ""
"The WebDAV address is set wrong. Please ask the administrator to check the "
"storage source's settings."
msgstr "WebDAV 地址设置得不对，请管理员检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "Names in WebDAV storage can't contain \\."
msgstr "WebDAV 存储的名字里不能有 \\。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The WebDAV server didn't answer in time. Please try again later."
msgstr "WebDAV 服务器没有及时回答，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The WebDAV server redirected too many times."
msgstr "WebDAV 服务器的跳转太多了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The WebDAV server wants a new login. Please upload again."
msgstr "WebDAV 服务器要求重新登录，请再上传一次。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
#, python-format
msgid "Couldn't connect to the WebDAV server: %(error)s: %(detail)s"
msgstr "连不上 WebDAV 服务器：%(error)s: %(detail)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid ""
"This WebDAV server only accepts Windows NTLM / Negotiate logins, which HFile "
"doesn't support."
msgstr ""
"这个 WebDAV 服务器只接受 Windows 的 NTLM / Negotiate 登录，HFile 不支持这种登"
"录方式。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The WebDAV server doesn't accept this username and password."
msgstr "WebDAV 服务器不接受这个用户名和密码。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
#, python-format
msgid "The WebDAV server refused this (%(what)s)."
msgstr "WebDAV 服务器拒绝了这个操作（%(what)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
#, python-format
msgid "The file is locked. Please try again later (%(what)s)."
msgstr "文件被锁定了，请稍后再试（%(what)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
#, python-format
msgid "The WebDAV server is out of space (%(what)s)."
msgstr "WebDAV 服务器的空间不够了（%(what)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
#, python-format
msgid "The file is too large for the WebDAV server (%(what)s)."
msgstr "文件太大，WebDAV 服务器不接受（%(what)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The WebDAV server redirects to another address (%(what)s). Please check the "
"storage source's WebDAV address."
msgstr ""
"WebDAV 服务器要求跳转到别的地址（%(what)s），请检查存储源的 WebDAV 地址。"

