msgid ""
"The folder at the WebDAV address doesn't exist. Please ask the administrator "
"to check the storage source's settings."
msgstr "WebDAV 地址对应的文件夹不存在，请管理员检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid ""
"This WebDAV address isn't a folder. Please ask the administrator to check "
"the storage source's settings."
msgstr "这个 WebDAV 地址不是文件夹，请管理员检查存储源的设置。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The range the WebDAV server sent is wrong."
msgstr "WebDAV 服务器发来的范围不对。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "The WebDAV server doesn't allow creating this folder (405)."
msgstr "WebDAV 服务器不让建这个文件夹（405）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid ""
"The WebDAV server asked for Digest login, which is now used. Please upload "
"again."
msgstr "WebDAV 服务器要求换用 Digest 登录，已经换好了，请再上传一次。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
#, python-format
msgid "The WebDAV server doesn't allow uploading files here (%(what)s)."
msgstr "WebDAV 服务器不让往这里上传文件（%(what)s）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The WebDAV server refused the upload (%(what)s). IIS answers so to a file "
"over its size limit (maxAllowedContentLength, about 28.6 MB unless set "
"higher)."
msgstr ""
"WebDAV 服务器拒绝了这次上传（%(what)s）。IIS 对超过它大小上限的文件会这样回答"
"（maxAllowedContentLength，没调高时约 28.6 MB）。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/webdav.py
msgid "Some files in the folder couldn't be deleted."
msgstr "文件夹里有些文件没能删掉。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid "Yandex Disk"
msgstr "Yandex Disk"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid ""
"Of your app on Yandex OAuth (https://oauth.yandex.com/client/new): choose "
"the Yandex Disk REST API's permissions to read and write anywhere on the "
"disk, and add this site's authorization callback URL as a Redirect URI."
msgstr ""
"你在 Yandex OAuth（https://oauth.yandex.com/client/new）上建的应用的：权限选 "
"Yandex Disk REST API 的读写整个网盘，并把本站的授权回调地址加到 Redirect "
"URI。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid "The client secret of the same app."
msgstr "同一个应用的客户端密钥。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid ""
"With the client ID and secret filled in, click \"Authorize\", log in to "
"Yandex and allow the app: it's filled in for you."
msgstr ""
"填好客户端 ID 和密钥后点「授权」，登录 Yandex 并允许这个应用，就会自动填好。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid ""
"Filled in when authorizing. Yandex gives a new one with every new access "
"token; HFile saves it itself."
msgstr ""
"授权时自动填好。Yandex 每次给新的访问令牌时都会一起换一个新的，HFile 自己保"
"存。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid ""
"The folder of the disk that is this storage source's root, like / or /"
"folder1."
msgstr "网盘里的哪个文件夹作为这个存储源的根目录，例如 / 或 /文件夹1。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid "Yandex gave no refresh token. Please authorize again."
msgstr "Yandex 没有给出刷新令牌，请重新授权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Yandex's authorization service is unavailable for now (HTTP "
"%(status_code)s). Please try again later."
msgstr "Yandex 的授权服务暂时不可用（HTTP %(status_code)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid ""
"Yandex's authorization has expired or been revoked (invalid_grant). Please "
"authorize again in the storage source's settings."
msgstr ""
"Yandex 的授权已经失效或者被撤销了（invalid_grant），请在存储源设置里重新授"
"权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Yandex refused the authorization (%(code)s). Please check the client ID and "
"secret."
msgstr "Yandex 拒绝了授权（%(code)s），请检查客户端 ID 和密钥。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid ""
"Not authorized yet: click \"Authorize\" in the storage source's settings and "
"log in to Yandex."
msgstr "还没有授权：请在存储源设置里点「授权」登录 Yandex。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid ""
"Yandex Disk refused the authorization. Please authorize again in the storage "
"source's settings."
msgstr "Yandex Disk 不接受现在的授权，请在存储源设置里重新授权。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid "The Yandex Disk is out of space."
msgstr "Yandex Disk 的空间不够了。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid ""
"Too many requests to Yandex Disk: it is rate-limiting them. Please try again "
"later."
msgstr "请求 Yandex Disk 太频繁，被限流了，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
#, python-format
msgid "Yandex Disk failed (HTTP %(status)s). Please try again later."
msgstr "Yandex Disk 出错了（HTTP %(status)s），请稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
#, python-format
msgid "Yandex Disk refused this (%(code)s): %(message)s"
msgstr "Yandex Disk 拒绝了这个操作（%(code)s）：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid "Yandex Disk couldn't finish this."
msgstr "Yandex Disk 没能完成这个操作。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
msgid ""
"Yandex Disk is still working on this. Please refresh in a while to see the "
"result."
msgstr "Yandex Disk 还在处理，请过一会儿刷新看看结果。"

#: apps/storages/drivers/yandex.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The name is too long: Yandex Disk takes names of at most %(limit)s "
"characters."
msgstr "名字太长了：Yandex Disk 的名字最多 %(limit)s 个字符。"

#: apps/storages/grants.py
msgid "The root folder should be text."
msgstr "根目录应该是文字。"

