msgstr "这种存储不用授权。"

#: apps/storages/templates/storages/manage/storages.html
msgid ""
"A storage source is a place put on the site: a folder on the server, an "
"object storage bucket, a cloud drive and so on. Its alias is its name in "
"addresses (<code>/alias/folder/file</code>). Drag the handles on the left to "
"change the order; users see storage sources in this order too."
msgstr ""
"存储源是挂到网站上的一个地方：服务器上的文件夹、对象存储的存储桶、网盘等。别"
"名就是它在网址里的名字（<code>/别名/文件夹/文件</code>）。拖动左边的把手调整"
"顺序，用户看到的存储源也按这个顺序排。"

#: apps/storages/templates/storages/manage/storages.html
msgid "How to write an <strong>expression</strong> (not case-sensitive):"
msgstr "<strong>表达式</strong>的写法（不分大小写）："

#: apps/storages/templates/storages/manage/storages.html
msgid ""
"<code>*</code> is any characters within a part, <code>?</code> is one "
"character, <code>**</code> spans any number of parts; any other character "
"stands for itself."
msgstr ""
"<code>*</code> 是一段里的任意字符，<code>?</code> 是一个字符，<code>**</"
"code> 可以跨过任意多段；别的字符就是它自己。"

#: apps/storages/templates/storages/manage/storages.html
msgid ""
"<code>/dir</code> is the folder itself, <code>/dir/*</code> what is directly "
"in it, <code>/dir/**</code> everything below it (not itself)."
msgstr ""
"<code>/dir</code> 是文件夹本身，<code>/dir/*</code> 是直接在它里面的东西，"
"<code>/dir/**</code> 是它下面的所有东西（不含它自己）。"

#: apps/storages/templates/storages/manage/storages.html
msgid ""
"<code>*.txt</code> is the .txt files in the root, <code>**/*.txt</code> or "
"<code>**.txt</code> .txt files anywhere, <code>**/private</code> anything "
"anywhere named private."
msgstr ""
"<code>*.txt</code> 是根目录下的 .txt 文件，<code>**/*.txt</code> 或 "
"<code>**.txt</code> 是任何地方的 .txt 文件，<code>**/private</code> 是任何地"
"方叫 private 的东西。"

#: apps/storages/templates/storages/manage/storages.html
msgid ""
"Dots and spaces at the end of names don't count (Windows-like storages treat "
"<code>secret.</code> as <code>secret</code>), so <code>/secret</code> also "
"covers <code>/Secret.</code>; <code>\\</code> separates parts just like "
"<code>/</code>."
msgstr ""
"名字末尾的点和空格不算（Windows 一类的存储把 <code>secret.</code> 当成 "
"<code>secret</code>），所以 <code>/secret</code> 也管得到 <code>/Secret.</"
"code>；<code>\\</code> 和 <code>/</code> 一样是分隔符。"

#: apps/storages/templates/storages/manage/storages.html
msgid ""
"Expressions are paths in the storage source, from its root (the base path), "
"whatever the user's own root folder. Filter rules apply to users without the "
"\"Ignore hiding\" permission, and to every visitor in shared folders. All "
"three modes keep what matches out of the lists:"
msgstr ""
"表达式写的是存储源里的路径，从存储源的根目录（基路径）算起，和用户自己的根目"
"录无关。过滤规则对没有「忽略隐藏」权限的用户生效，分享出去的文件夹里对所有访"
"问者生效。三种模式都会让匹配的东西不出现在列表里："

#: apps/storages/templates/storages/manage/storages.html
msgid ""
"<strong>Hide only</strong>: not in the lists, but anyone who knows the path "
"can still open and download it."
msgstr "<strong>仅隐藏</strong>：列表里看不到，知道路径的人照样能打开、下载。"

#: apps/storages/templates/storages/manage/storages.html
msgid ""
"<strong>Hide and block access</strong>: it and everything below it can't be "
"opened or downloaded, and nothing can be put in it; folders that may hold "
"such content can't be deleted, moved, copied or renamed as a whole (rules by "
"name like <code>**/name</code> go with the content and don't block folders, "
"but deleting a folder deletes such things in it too)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>隐藏并且不可访问</strong>：它和它下面的所有东西都打不开、下载不了，也"
"不能往里放东西；可能含有这类内容的文件夹不能整个删除、移动、复制或改名"
"（<code>**/名字</code> 这样按名字写的规则跟着内容走，不挡文件夹；但删除文件夹"
"时，里面这样的东西会一起删掉）。"

#: apps/storages/templates/storages/manage/storages.html
msgid ""
"<strong>Hide and block downloads</strong>: it and the files below it can't "
"be downloaded, previewed or given direct or short links, nor copied, moved "
"or renamed (a new name would make them downloadable)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>隐藏并且不可下载</strong>：它和它下面的文件不能下载、预览、生成直链或"
"短链，也不能复制、移动或改名（换个名字就能下载了）。"

#: apps/storages/templates/storages/manage/storages.html
msgid ""
"Expressions are paths in the storage source, from its root (the base path), "
"whatever the user's own root folder. A rule covers what it matches and "
"everything below: <code>/music</code> makes the music folder and everything "
"in it need the password; <code>/music/*</code> makes what is in music need "
"it, while music's own list can be seen as usual. <strong>The first matching "
"rule in order</strong> decides which password is needed, so put nested rules "
"first: <code>/music/private</code>, then <code>/music</code>."
msgstr ""
"表达式写的是存储源里的路径，从存储源的根目录（基路径）算起，和用户自己的根目"
"录无关。规则管它匹配的东西和下面的所有东西：<code>/music</code> 让 music 文件"
"夹和里面的所有东西都要密码；<code>/music/*</code> 让 music 里面的东西要密码，"
"music 本身的列表照常能看。<strong>按顺序找到的第一条</strong>匹配规则决定要哪"
"个密码，所以嵌套的规则要排在前面：先 <code>/music/私人</code>，再 <code>/"
"music</code>。"

#: apps/storages/templates/storages/manage/storages.html
msgid ""
"Once a visitor enters the right password, this browser remembers it (for 30 "
"days with \"Remember password\"); after the expression or password changes, "
"it must be entered again. Users with the \"Ignore passwords\" permission "
"don't need to. Deleting, moving, copying or renaming a whole folder needs "
"every password that may apply inside it entered first."
msgstr ""
"访问者输对一次密码，这个浏览器就记住了（勾「记住密码」时记 30 天）；改了表达"
"式或密码以后要重新输。有「忽略密码」权限的用户不用输。删除、移动、复制或改名"
"整个文件夹时，它里面可能有的每一条密码都要先输过。"

#: apps/storages/templates/storages/manage/storages.html
msgid ""
"When a folder is opened, the first rule in order that matches the folder "
"shows its readme above or below the list or in a dialog (Markdown). <code>/</"
"code> is the root, <code>/music</code> only the music folder, <code>/music/"
"**</code> every folder below it."
msgstr ""
"打开一个文件夹时，按顺序找到的第一条匹配这个文件夹的规则，它的文档显示在列表"
"的上面、下面或者弹窗里（Markdown）。<code>/</code> 是根目录，<code>/music</"
"code> 只是 music 文件夹，<code>/music/**</code> 是它下面的所有文件夹。"

#: apps/storages/templates/storages/manage/storages.html
msgid ""
"<strong>Relative paths</strong> count from the user's own root folder: for a "
"user whose root is /music, opening /music also matches a relative rule for "
"<code>/</code>. <strong>Absolute paths</strong> count from the storage "
"source, the same folder for everyone."
msgstr ""
"<strong>相对路径</strong>按用户自己的根目录算：根目录是 /music 的用户打开 /"
"music 时，相对路径 <code>/</code> 的规则也匹配。<strong>绝对路径</strong>按存"
"储源的路径算，对谁都是同一个文件夹。"

