msgstr "备份文件里有一行长得不正常，这不是 HFile 写的备份。"

#: apps/upgrades/backup.py
msgid "The backup is incomplete: the file ends before it was finished."
msgstr "备份不完整：文件在写完之前就断了。"

#: apps/upgrades/backup.py
msgid ""
"The backup file is damaged: decompressing it fails, so it can't be read."
msgstr "备份文件坏了：解压时出错，读不出来。"

#: apps/upgrades/backup.py
