msgstr "读不了这个文件：%(error)s"

#: apps/upgrades/backup.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This is a backup of a %(engine)s database; the site now uses %(current)s "
"([database] engine in the settings file), so it can't be restored into it."
msgstr ""
"这是 %(engine)s 数据库的备份，网站现在用的是 %(current)s（设置文件的 "
"[database] engine），不能恢复到它里面。"

#: apps/upgrades/backup.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The backup file has a statement a backup never writes: %(line)s… Nothing was "
"restored."
msgstr "备份文件里有备份不会写的语句：%(line)s……没有恢复。"

#: apps/upgrades/backup.py
msgid "Backups and restores can't run inside another transaction."
msgstr "备份和恢复不能在别的事务里面做。"

#: apps/upgrades/backup.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(count)s row points to data that doesn't exist (a foreign key): %(example)s."
msgid_plural ""
"%(count)s rows point to data that doesn't exist (foreign keys), like "
"%(example)s."
msgstr[0] "有 %(count)s 行指向不存在的数据（外键），比如 %(example)s。"

#: apps/upgrades/backup.py
msgid ""
"The backup file has a statement that ends the transaction. Nothing was "
"restored."
msgstr "备份文件里有结束事务的语句，没有恢复。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/backup.py
msgid ""
"Backs up the whole database into a .sql.gz file, by default in the backup "
"folder ([paths] backups in the settings file). Uploaded files aren't in it."
msgstr ""
"把整个数据库备份成一个 .sql.gz 文件，默认放在备份文件夹里（设置文件的 "
"[paths] backups）。上传的文件不在里面。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/backup.py
msgid ""
"Path of the backup file, ending in .sql.gz. By default in the backup folder, "
"named after the time"
msgstr "备份文件的路径，以 .sql.gz 结尾。默认在备份文件夹里按时间起名"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/backup.py
msgid "The backup file's name must end in .sql.gz."
msgstr "备份文件名要以 .sql.gz 结尾。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/backup.py
#, python-format
msgid "The backup failed: %(error)s"
msgstr "备份失败：%(error)s"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/backup.py
#, python-format
msgid "Backed up %(count)s table: %(path)s (%(size)s)"
msgid_plural "Backed up %(count)s tables: %(path)s (%(size)s)"
msgstr[0] "已备份 %(count)s 张表：%(path)s（%(size)s）"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The site is still running (with the same settings file %(path)s): nothing "
"was upgraded, the database is unchanged. Stop the site first (with %(stop)s, "
"say, or Ctrl+C in the terminal running it), and start it again after the "
"upgrade."
msgstr ""
"网站还在运行（用的是同一个设置文件 %(path)s），没有升级，数据库没有改动。先停"
"掉网站（比如 %(stop)s，或者在运行它的终端里按 Ctrl+C），升级完再启动它。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The site is still running (with the same settings file %(path)s): nothing "
"was restored, the database is unchanged. Stop the site first (with %(stop)s, "
"say, or Ctrl+C in the terminal running it), and start it again after the "
"restore."
msgstr ""
"网站还在运行（用的是同一个设置文件 %(path)s），没有恢复，数据库没有改动。先停"
"掉网站（比如 %(stop)s，或者在运行它的终端里按 Ctrl+C），恢复完再启动它。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
msgid ""
"Replaces the whole database with a backup file: drops all the tables there "
"are now and puts in the backup's. The database as it is now is saved to a "
"copy first. Stop the site first."
msgstr ""
"用备份文件替换整个数据库：删掉现在的全部表，换成备份里的。换之前先把现在的数"
"据库另存一份。要先停掉网站。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
msgid "Backup file (.sql.gz)"
msgstr "备份文件（.sql.gz）"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
msgid "Restore without asking"
msgstr "不再询问，直接恢复"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(file)s: %(error)s"
msgstr "%(file)s：%(error)s"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Backed up at %(created)s, %(engine)s database %(database)s, holding the "
"database of version %(schema)s"
msgstr ""
"备份于 %(created)s，%(engine)s 数据库 %(database)s，里面是 %(schema)s 版的数"
"据库"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid "Backed up at %(created)s, %(engine)s database %(database)s"
msgstr "备份于 %(created)s，%(engine)s 数据库 %(database)s"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid "Backup file: %(file)s"
msgstr "备份文件：%(file)s"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This drops all the tables in the database %(database)s and puts in the "
"backup's. Type yes to go on: "
msgstr ""
"这会删掉数据库 %(database)s 里现在的全部表，换成备份里的。输入 yes 继续："

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
msgid "Cancelled; the database is unchanged."
msgstr "已取消，数据库没有改动。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Couldn't save the current database first, so nothing was restored: %(error)s"
msgstr "没能先另存现在的数据库，所以没有恢复：%(error)s"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid "The current database is saved to %(path)s (%(count)s table)."
msgid_plural "The current database is saved to %(path)s (%(count)s tables)."
msgstr[0] "现在的数据库另存到了 %(path)s（%(count)s 张表）。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
msgid "Restored."
msgstr "已恢复。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The backup holds the database of version %(schema)s (this is %(version)s). "
"This version upgrades it to its own when it starts (with automatic upgrades "
"off, run the upgrade command first)."
msgstr ""
"备份里是 %(schema)s 版的数据库（现在运行的是 %(version)s）。这个版本启动时会"
"把它升级到自己的版本（自动升级关着时，先运行 upgrade 命令）。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py apps/upgrades/service.py
#: apps/upgrades/startup.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(names)s and others (%(count)s in all)"
msgid_plural "%(names)s and others (%(count)s in all)"
msgstr[0] "%(names)s 等 %(count)s 个"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(file)s: this backup comes from a newer version (%(version)s), with "
"migrations this program (%(current)s) doesn't have: %(names)s. This program "
"couldn't use it once restored, so nothing was restored and the database is "
"unchanged. Restore it with version %(version)s or newer."
msgstr ""
"%(file)s：这个备份来自更新的版本（%(version)s），里面有这个程序"
"（%(current)s）没有的迁移：%(names)s。恢复以后这个程序不能用它，所以没有恢"
"复，数据库没有改动。用 %(version)s 版或者更新的版本恢复它。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(file)s: this backup comes from a newer version, with migrations this "
"program (%(current)s) doesn't have: %(names)s. This program couldn't use it "
"once restored, so nothing was restored and the database is unchanged. "
"Restore it with a newer version."
msgstr ""
"%(file)s：这个备份来自更新的版本，里面有这个程序（%(current)s）没有的迁移："
"%(names)s。恢复以后这个程序不能用它，所以没有恢复，数据库没有改动。用更新的版"
"本恢复它。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid "The restore failed: %(error)s"
msgstr "恢复失败：%(error)s"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
msgid "The database is unchanged."
msgstr "数据库没有改动。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
msgid "Putting the database back as it was before the restore…"
msgstr "正在把数据库换回恢复之前的样子……"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid "Putting back the database from before the restore failed too: %(error)s"
msgstr "换回恢复之前的数据库也失败了：%(error)s"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The database is now incomplete and the site can't use it. Once the problem "
"is fixed and the site stopped, restore %(path)s (saved before the restore) "
"with the restore command."
msgstr ""
"数据库现在不完整，网站不能用它。排除问题、停掉网站以后，用 restore 命令恢复 "
"%(path)s（恢复之前另存的）。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/restore.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The database is back as it was before the restore (%(path)s). A restore "
"while the site runs fails on the data the site writes: stop the site before "
"restoring."
msgstr ""
"数据库已经换回恢复之前的样子（%(path)s），和恢复前一样。网站开着时恢复，网站"
"写进去的数据会让恢复失败：先停掉网站再恢复。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/upgrade.py
msgid ""
"Upgrades the database to this version of the program: backs up the whole "
"database first, and restores the backup if a migration fails."
msgstr "把数据库升级到这个版本的程序：先备份整个数据库，迁移出错就恢复备份。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/upgrade.py
msgid ""
"Only check, don't change the database. Exit status: 0 no upgrade needed, 1 "
"an upgrade is needed, 2 the database is newer than the program, 3 not an "
"HFile database, 4 the database can't be read."
msgstr ""
"只检查，不改数据库。退出码：0 不用升级，1 需要升级，2 数据库比程序新，3 不是 "
"HFile 的数据库，4 读不了数据库。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/upgrade.py
#, python-format
msgid "The database is at version %(version)s already; no upgrade needed."
msgstr "数据库已经是 %(version)s 版的，不用升级。"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/upgrade.py
#, python-format
msgid "Program version: %(version)s"
msgstr "程序版本：%(version)s"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/upgrade.py
#, python-format
msgid "Last database upgrade: %(version)s, %(time)s"
msgstr "数据库上次升级：%(version)s，%(time)s"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/upgrade.py
#, python-format
msgid "Upgrade needed: %(count)s migration"
msgid_plural "Upgrade needed: %(count)s migrations"
msgstr[0] "需要升级：%(count)s 个迁移"

#: apps/upgrades/management/commands/upgrade.py
msgid "The database needs no upgrade."
msgstr "数据库不用升级。"

#: apps/upgrades/models.py apps/web/templates/web/manage/version.html
msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

#: apps/upgrades/models.py
msgid "Previous version"
msgstr "原来的版本"

#: apps/upgrades/models.py
msgid "Migrations applied"
msgstr "执行的迁移"

#: apps/upgrades/models.py apps/web/templates/web/manage/version.html
msgid "Backup before upgrade"
msgstr "升级前的备份"

#: apps/upgrades/models.py
msgid "Started at"
msgstr "开始时间"

#: apps/upgrades/models.py apps/web/templates/web/manage/version.html
msgid "Finished at"
msgstr "完成时间"

#: apps/upgrades/models.py apps/web/templates/web/manage/version.html
msgid "Upgrade history"
msgstr "升级记录"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
msgid ""
"This program can't log in to MySQL with mysql_native_password. Switch this "
"user to caching_sha2_password with MySQL's admin account: ALTER USER "
"'username'@'%' IDENTIFIED WITH caching_sha2_password BY 'password';"
msgstr ""
"这个程序不支持用 mysql_native_password 登录 MySQL。用 MySQL 的管理员账号把这"
"个用户换成 caching_sha2_password：ALTER USER '用户名'@'%' IDENTIFIED WITH "
"caching_sha2_password BY '密码';"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
msgid ""
"MySQL has no TLS, and this user has caching_sha2_password (MySQL 8.4's "
"default): after MySQL restarts or the password changes, the first login must "
"use an encrypted connection. Turn on MySQL's TLS (on by default in MySQL "
"8.4); or first log in once as this user with the mysql client on the machine "
"MySQL runs on, and connecting works after that (after every restart of "
"MySQL, log in like that again)."
msgstr ""
"MySQL 没有开 TLS，这个用户又用的是 caching_sha2_password（MySQL 8.4 的默"
"认）：MySQL 重启或者改过密码以后，第一次登录必须走加密的连接。打开 MySQL 的 "
"TLS（MySQL 8.4 默认是开着的）；或者先在 MySQL 所在的机器上用 mysql 客户端以这"
"个用户登录一次，之后就能连了（MySQL 再重启以后，还要再这样登录一次）。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
msgid ""
"Check tls and ca in [database] of the settings file config.toml: MySQL must "
"have TLS on; ca must be the certificate of the CA that signed MySQL's server "
"certificate (PEM), readable by this program; with tls = verify_identity, "
"host must also match the name on the certificate."
msgstr ""
"检查设置文件 config.toml 里 [database] 的 tls 和 ca：MySQL 要开着 TLS；ca 要"
"是签发 MySQL 服务器证书的 CA 证书（PEM 格式），这个程序要能读到它；tls 是 "
"verify_identity 时，host 还要和证书上的名字一样。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Can't read the database file %(path)s (%(error)s). Check file in [database] "
"of the settings file config.toml, and that the file and its folder can be "
"read and written."
msgstr ""
"读不了数据库文件 %(path)s（%(error)s）。检查设置文件 config.toml 里 "
"[database] 的 file，还有这个文件和它所在的文件夹能不能读写。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid "Can't connect to the database (%(error)s). %(hint)s"
msgstr "连不上数据库（%(error)s）。%(hint)s"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Can't read the database (%(error)s). Check host, port, name, user and "
"password in [database] of the settings file config.toml."
msgstr ""
"读不了数据库（%(error)s）。检查设置文件 config.toml 里 [database] 的 host、"
"port、name、user 和 password。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The database %(name)s has other tables (%(tables)s and more), but it isn't "
"an HFile database: nothing was upgraded or changed. Check name (for SQLite, "
"file) in [database] of the settings file config.toml for a typo."
msgstr ""
"数据库 %(name)s 里已经有别的表（%(tables)s 等），但它不是 HFile 的数据库，没"
"有升级，也没有改动。检查设置文件 config.toml 里 [database] 的 name（SQLite "
"是 file）有没有写错。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
msgid "Got a signal to stop: stopping once the restore is done…"
msgstr "收到停止的信号：等恢复做完再停……"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The database was upgraded by version %(version)s and has migrations this "
"program (%(current)s) doesn't have: %(names)s. An older program could break "
"on a newer database, so it stops here."
msgstr ""
"数据库已经被 %(version)s 版升级过，里面有这个程序（%(current)s）没有的迁移："
"%(names)s。旧版程序用新版的数据库可能出错，所以停在这里。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Go back to the newer program; to use this version anyway, first restore the "
"database from the backup taken before the upgrade (the restore command). "
"Backups are in %(folder)s, with the date and the version upgraded to in "
"their names."
msgstr ""
"请换回新版程序；一定要用这个版本的话，先用升级前的备份恢复数据库（restore 命"
"令），备份在 %(folder)s，文件名里有日期和升级到的版本。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The database was upgraded by a newer version and has migrations this program "
"(%(current)s) doesn't have: %(names)s. An older program could break on a "
"newer database, so it stops here."
msgstr ""
"数据库已经被更新的版本升级过，里面有这个程序（%(current)s）没有的迁移："
"%(names)s。旧版程序用新版的数据库可能出错，所以停在这里。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Go back to the newer program; to use this version anyway, first restore the "
"database from the backup taken before the upgrade (the restore command). "
"Backups are in %(folder)s, with the date and the version upgraded to in "
"their names. If the version hasn't changed, this program may have been "
"packaged without some migration files."
msgstr ""
"请换回新版程序；一定要用这个版本的话，先用升级前的备份恢复数据库（restore 命"
"令），备份在 %(folder)s，文件名里有日期和升级到的版本。如果没有换过版本，可能"
"是这个程序打包时漏了迁移文件。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
msgid ""
"Another process is upgrading or restoring this database; waiting for it to "
"finish…"
msgstr "另一个进程正在升级或恢复这个数据库，等它结束……"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Waited %(seconds)s second, and another process is still upgrading or "
"restoring this database. Try again once it's done."
msgid_plural ""
"Waited %(seconds)s seconds, and another process is still upgrading or "
"restoring this database. Try again once it's done."
msgstr[0] ""
"等了 %(seconds)s 秒，另一个进程还在升级或恢复这个数据库。等它结束后再试。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The database file's folder %(folder)s doesn't exist or can't be written to "
"(%(error)s). Check file in [database] of the settings file config.toml."
msgstr ""
"数据库文件所在的文件夹 %(folder)s 不存在，或者不能写入（%(error)s）。检查设置"
"文件 config.toml 里 [database] 的 file。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The lock file %(path)s can't be used (%(error)s). It only keeps two "
"processes from upgrading or restoring at the same time and holds no data: it "
"may be left from a run as another user (root, say). Delete it, or make it "
"writable by the user running the site, and try again."
msgstr ""
"锁文件 %(path)s 用不了（%(error)s）。它只用来让两个进程不同时升级或恢复，里面"
"没有数据：可能是用别的用户（比如 root）运行过留下的。删掉它，或者改成运行网站"
"的用户能写的，再试一次。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"HFile %(version)s starts on this database for the first time (it was "
"%(previous)s); the database needs no changes."
msgstr ""
"HFile %(version)s 第一次在这个数据库上启动（原来是 %(previous)s），数据库不用"
"改。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"HFile %(version)s starts on this database for the first time; the database "
"needs no changes."
msgstr "HFile %(version)s 第一次在这个数据库上启动，数据库不用改。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The database's migration history is inconsistent; nothing was upgraded: "
"%(error)s"
msgstr "数据库的迁移记录前后不一致，没有升级：%(error)s"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A new, empty database (%(name)s): creating the tables (%(count)s migration)…"
msgid_plural ""
"A new, empty database (%(name)s): creating the tables (%(count)s migrations)…"
msgstr[0] "新的空数据库（%(name)s）：建表（%(count)s 个迁移）……"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Upgrading the database to %(version)s (from %(previous)s): %(count)s "
"migration…"
msgid_plural ""
"Upgrading the database to %(version)s (from %(previous)s): %(count)s "
"migrations…"
msgstr[0] "升级数据库到 %(version)s（原来是 %(previous)s）：%(count)s 个迁移……"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid "Upgrading the database to %(version)s: %(count)s migration…"
msgid_plural "Upgrading the database to %(version)s: %(count)s migrations…"
msgstr[0] "升级数据库到 %(version)s：%(count)s 个迁移……"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid "The database is upgraded to %(version)s, in %(seconds)s seconds."
msgstr "数据库已升级到 %(version)s，用时 %(seconds)s 秒。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid "Backing up the whole database first: %(path)s"
msgstr "先备份整个数据库：%(path)s"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The backup failed; nothing was upgraded, the database is unchanged: %(error)s"
msgstr "备份失败，没有升级，数据库没有改动：%(error)s"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Backups go to %(folder)s; [paths] backups in the settings file config.toml "
"can set another folder, one that can be written to."
msgstr ""
"备份放在 %(folder)s，可以在设置文件 config.toml 里用 [paths] backups 换一个能"
"写入的文件夹。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid "Backed up %(count)s table (%(size)s)."
msgid_plural "Backed up %(count)s tables (%(size)s)."
msgstr[0] "已备份 %(count)s 张表（%(size)s）。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
msgid "The upgrade was interrupted."
msgstr "升级被中断。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid "The upgrade failed: %(error)s"
msgstr "升级失败：%(error)s"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
msgid "Restoring the database to before the upgrade…"
msgstr "正在把数据库恢复到升级前……"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The database may now be only half upgraded, and neither this version nor the "
"previous one can use it. Once the problem is fixed, restore the backup from "
"before the upgrade with the restore command: %(path)s"
msgstr ""
"数据库现在可能只升级了一半，这个版本和原来的版本都不能用它。排除问题后，用 "
"restore 命令恢复升级前的备份：%(path)s"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
msgid ""
"The database may now be only half upgraded, and neither this version nor the "
"previous one can use it. Once the problem is fixed, drop all the tables in "
"the database and start again."
msgstr ""
"数据库现在可能只升级了一半，这个版本和原来的版本都不能用它。排除问题后，删掉"
"数据库里的全部表再启动。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid "Restoring failed too: %(error)s"
msgstr "恢复也失败了：%(error)s"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The database is restored to before the upgrade; the previous version "
"(%(previous)s) can go on using it. Please send the output above to the "
"developers."
msgstr ""
"数据库已经恢复到升级前，原来的版本（%(previous)s）可以接着用。请把上面的输出"
"发给开发者。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
msgid ""
"The database is restored to before the upgrade; the previous version can go "
"on using it. Please send the output above to the developers."
msgstr ""
"数据库已经恢复到升级前，原来的版本可以接着用。请把上面的输出发给开发者。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
msgid ""
"The database is empty again. Please send the output above to the developers."
msgstr "数据库已经恢复成空的。请把上面的输出发给开发者。"

#: apps/upgrades/service.py
#, python-format
msgid "Couldn't write the upgrade record: %(error)s"
msgstr "没能写入升级记录：%(error)s"

#: apps/upgrades/startup.py
#, python-format
msgid "The database needs an upgrade: %(count)s migration to go (%(names)s)."
msgid_plural ""
"The database needs an upgrade: %(count)s migrations to go (%(names)s)."
msgstr[0] "数据库要升级：还差 %(count)s 个迁移（%(names)s）。"

#: apps/upgrades/startup.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Run %(command)s first (it backs up the whole database before anything else), "
"or set [upgrade] auto = true in the settings file config.toml to have the "
"program upgrade by itself when it starts."
msgstr ""
"先运行 %(command)s（会先备份整个数据库），或者在设置文件 config.toml 里写 "
"[upgrade] auto = true，让程序启动时自己升级。"

#: apps/upgrades/startup.py
#, python-format
msgid "Note: %(message)s"
msgstr "注意：%(message)s"

#: apps/upgrades/startup.py
#, python-format
msgid "HFile %(version)s didn't start. %(message)s"
msgstr "HFile %(version)s 没有启动。%(message)s"

#: apps/uploads/apps.py
msgid "Expired upload sessions"
msgstr "过期的上传会话"

#: apps/uploads/checks.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Files being uploaded are kept in %(spool)s, which is inside the uploads "
"folder ([paths] uploads = %(media)s), so they could be downloaded through /"
"media/."
msgstr ""
"上传中的文件暂存在 %(spool)s，它在上传文件夹（[paths] uploads = %(media)s）里"
"面，可能被当作 /media/ 下载走。"

#: apps/uploads/checks.py
msgid ""
"Set [paths] uploads in the settings file to a folder of its own (the default "
"is uploads)."
msgstr "把设置文件里的 [paths] uploads 改成单独的文件夹（默认是 uploads）。"

#: apps/uploads/models.py
msgid "Through the site"
msgstr "经过本站"

#: apps/uploads/models.py
msgid "Direct from the browser"
msgstr "浏览器直传"

#: apps/uploads/models.py
msgid "Receiving"
msgstr "接收中"

#: apps/uploads/models.py
msgid "Waiting for the direct upload"
msgstr "等待直传完成"

#: apps/uploads/models.py
msgid "Writing to storage"
msgstr "写入存储中"

#: apps/uploads/models.py
msgid "Upload session"
msgstr "上传会话"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(where)s\" is a file, not a folder."
msgstr "「%(where)s」是一个文件，不是文件夹。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid ""
"This storage source's root folder is gone. Please ask the administrator to "
"check its settings."
msgstr "这个存储源的根目录不在了，请联系管理员检查它的设置。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid "Overwriting an existing file also needs the \"Delete\" permission."
msgstr "覆盖已有的文件还要有「删除」的权限。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid ""
"You have too many uploads going at once. Please wait for the earlier ones to "
"finish."
msgstr "从你这里同时进行的上传太多了，请等前面的传完再试。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Too many uploads at once (at most %(limit)s). Please wait for the earlier "
"ones to finish."
msgid_plural ""
"Too many uploads at once (at most %(limit)s). Please wait for the earlier "
"ones to finish."
msgstr[0] "同时进行的上传太多了（最多 %(limit)s 个），请等前面的传完再试。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid ""
"The server is out of disk space for uploads in progress. Please try again "
"later, or ask the administrator to free some space."
msgstr ""
"服务器上暂存上传文件的磁盘空间不够了，请稍后再试，或者请管理员清理磁盘。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid "A name can't contain /, or be only dots and spaces (like . or ..)."
msgstr "名字里不能有 /，也不能只有点和空格（比如 . 或 ..）。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(name)s\" is an existing folder; a file can't overwrite it."
msgstr "「%(name)s」是一个已经有的文件夹，不能用文件覆盖。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(name)s\" already exists."
msgstr "「%(name)s」已经存在了。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid ""
"The browser didn't send the session cookie, so it can't upload. Please allow "
"this site's cookies and try again."
msgstr "浏览器没有带上会话 Cookie，不能上传：请允许本站的 Cookie 再试。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid ""
"The upload's temporary file couldn't be created. Please try again later."
msgstr "上传的暂存文件建不起来，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid "There is no such upload; it may have expired or been canceled."
msgstr "没有这个上传，可能已经过期或者取消了。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid ""
"Every chunk needs a Content-Range header, like bytes 0-16777215/file-size."
msgstr "每一块都要带 Content-Range 请求头，比如 bytes 0-16777215/文件大小。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The file size in Content-Range (%(total)s) isn't the size given when the "
"upload started (%(size)s)."
msgstr "Content-Range 里的文件大小 %(total)s 和上传时说的 %(size)s 不一样。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid "The range in Content-Range is wrong."
msgstr "Content-Range 的范围不对。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
#, python-format
msgid "A chunk is at most %(limit)s byte."
msgid_plural "A chunk is at most %(limit)s bytes."
msgstr[0] "一块最多 %(limit)s 字节。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This chunk is in the wrong place: the next one should start at byte "
"%(received)s."
msgstr "这一块的位置不对：下一块应该从第 %(received)s 字节开始。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid "This upload is busy with another request. Please try again later."
msgstr "这个上传正在处理别的请求，请稍后再试。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid ""
"This upload goes straight from the browser to the storage; its data isn't "
"sent here."
msgstr "这个上传是浏览器直传的，数据不发到这里。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid "All of this upload's data has been received."
msgstr "这个上传的数据已经收齐了。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
#, python-format
msgid "The request's Content-Length should be this chunk's %(length)s byte."
msgid_plural ""
"The request's Content-Length should be this chunk's %(length)s bytes."
msgstr[0] "请求的内容长度（Content-Length）应该是这一块的 %(length)s 字节。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid "This chunk didn't arrive in full. Please send it again."
msgstr "这一块的数据没有收全，请重新发送这一块。"

#: apps/uploads/service.py
msgid ""
"The server couldn't write the temporary file (is the disk full?). Please try "
"again later."
