#: apps/web/templates/web/manage/version.html
msgid ""
"When a new version of the program starts, it checks the database first. If "
"the database structure has to change, it backs up the whole database to the "
"backup folder, then upgrades; if the upgrade fails, it restores the backup "
"and stops instead of starting, and the old version can go on running. Once a "
"newer version has upgraded the database, older versions refuse to start. "
"Uploaded files aren't in the backup. This page only shows what is there; it "
"can't upgrade or restore (use the upgrade, backup and restore commands)."
msgstr ""
"换上新版程序再启动时，它会先检查数据库。要改数据库结构的话，先把整个数据库备"
"份到备份文件夹，再升级；升级出错会自动恢复备份，然后停下不启动，原来的版本还"
"能接着用。数据库被新版本升级过以后，旧版本会拒绝启动。上传的文件不在备份里。"
"这里只能看，不能升级或恢复（用 upgrade、backup 和 restore 命令）。"

