#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"--config needs the path of a settings file after it, like --config /srv/"
"hfile/config.toml."
msgstr ""
"--config 后面要写设置文件的路径，比如 --config /srv/hfile/config.toml。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid "Must be text in double quotes; it is %(value)s now."
msgstr "要写成带英文双引号的文字，现在是 %(value)s。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid "Can't be empty or contain spaces."
msgstr "不能为空，也不能有空格。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Must be a whole number from %(low)s to %(high)s (no quotes); it is %(value)s "
"now."
msgstr "要写 %(low)s 到 %(high)s 之间的整数（不加引号），现在是 %(value)s。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid "Must be true or false (lower case, no quotes); it is %(value)s now."
msgstr "要写 true 或 false（小写，不加引号），现在是 %(value)s。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"Must be an IP, like \"0.0.0.0\" (all addresses) or \"127.0.0.1\" (this "
"machine only)."
msgstr ""
"要写一个 IP，比如 \"0.0.0.0\"（所有地址）或 \"127.0.0.1\"（只有本机）。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid "Can't contain control characters such as line breaks."
msgstr "里面不能有换行之类的控制字符。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid "The user %(user)s doesn't exist, so it has no home folder."
msgstr "%(user)s 这个用户不存在，找不到它的主目录。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid "A part of the path is too long: each name in it is at most 255 bytes."
msgstr "路径里有一段太长了：每一级的名字最多 255 个字节。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid "Must be \"sqlite\" or \"mysql\"; it is %(value)s now."
msgstr "要写 \"sqlite\" 或 \"mysql\"，现在是 %(value)s。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Must be \"preferred\", \"required\", \"verify_ca\" or \"verify_identity\"; "
"it is %(value)s now."
msgstr ""
"要写 \"preferred\"、\"required\"、\"verify_ca\" 或 \"verify_identity\"，现在"
"是 %(value)s。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid "Can only have English letters, digits and underscores, 64 at most."
msgstr "只能用英文字母、数字和下划线，最多 64 个。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Too short: at least %(limit)s character. Left empty, the setup wizard "
"generates one."
msgid_plural ""
"Too short: at least %(limit)s characters. Left empty, the setup wizard "
"generates one."
msgstr[0] "太短了，至少要 %(limit)s 个字符。空着的话，安装向导会生成一个。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(host)s\""
msgstr "「%(host)s」"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(hosts)s isn't a domain name or IP. A domain name in another script must "
"convert to the xn-- form: check how it is written, or write it in the xn-- "
"form."
msgid_plural ""
"%(hosts)s aren't domain names or IPs. A domain name in another script must "
"convert to the xn-- form: check how they are written, or write them in the "
"xn-- form."
msgstr[0] ""
"%(hosts)s不是域名或 IP。中文域名要能转成 xn-- 开头的形式：检查一下写法，或者"
"直接写成 xn-- 开头的形式。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(hosts)s isn't a domain name or IP."
msgid_plural "%(hosts)s aren't domain names or IPs."
msgstr[0] "%(hosts)s不是域名或 IP。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Must be a list, like [\"files.example.com\", \"127.0.0.1\"]; it is %(value)s "
"now."
msgstr ""
"要写成列表，比如 [\"files.example.com\", \"127.0.0.1\"]，现在是 %(value)s。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"Must start with https:// or http://, like \"https://files.example.com\"."
msgstr "要以 https:// 或 http:// 开头，比如 \"https://files.example.com\"。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"Ends with the domain name (and port), with no path after it, like \"https://"
"files.example.com\"."
msgstr ""
"只写到域名（和端口）为止，后面不要带路径，比如 \"https://"
"files.example.com\"。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid "The port can't be 0."
msgstr "端口不能是 0。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"The IP to listen on. \"0.0.0.0\" is every IPv4 address of this machine, \"::"
"\" every IPv6 address.\n"
"To let in only a reverse proxy on this machine (Nginx, Caddy), write "
"\"127.0.0.1\".\n"
"python manage.py runserver doesn't use this section."
msgstr ""
"监听的 IP。\"0.0.0.0\" 是这台机器所有的 IPv4 地址，\"::\" 是所有的 IPv6 地"
"址。\n"
"只让这台机器上的反向代理（Nginx、Caddy）连进来时，写 \"127.0.0.1\"。python "
"manage.py runserver 不看这一节。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"How many requests are handled at the same time; downloads through the site "
"have threads of their own"
msgstr "同时处理几个请求；经过本站的下载用自己的线程，不算在里面"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"How many reverse proxies are in front: 0 when the site faces the internet "
"itself, 1 behind a single Nginx or Caddy.\n"
"When it isn't 0, the visitor's IP is the one that many from the right in X-"
"Forwarded-For, and X-Forwarded-Proto\n"
"says whether it is https; the proxies must pass on these two headers and "
"Host. At 0 these headers are ignored,\n"
"as anyone can forge them."
msgstr ""
"前面有几层反向代理：直接对外是 0，前面只有一个 Nginx 或 Caddy 是 1。\n"
"不是 0 时，访问者的 IP 取 X-Forwarded-For 里从右数第这么多个，是不是 https "
"看 X-Forwarded-Proto，\n"
"代理要传这两个请求头和 Host。是 0 时这些请求头都不看，因为谁都能伪造。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"One line in the log for each request (as Go's Gin does): status, time taken, "
"the visitor's IP, method and address,\n"
"size, browser. The admin's address and the tokens and signatures in links "
"are not printed.\n"
"python manage.py runserver doesn't use this; it has its own."
msgstr ""
"每个请求在日志里打印一行（参照 Go 的 Gin）：状态码、用时、访问者的 IP、方法和"
"地址、大小、浏览器。\n"
"后台的地址和链接里的口令、签名不会打印出来。python manage.py runserver 不看这"
"一项，它有自己的。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"The kind of database: \"sqlite\" or \"mysql\".\n"
"sqlite: the data is kept in one file (file below), with no database server "
"to install; for a site without much traffic.\n"
"mysql: MySQL 8.4 or later, with host, port, name, user and password below."
msgstr ""
"数据库的类型：\"sqlite\" 或 \"mysql\"。\n"
"sqlite：数据存在一个文件里（下面的 file），不用另外装数据库，适合访问量不大的"
"站。\n"
"mysql：MySQL 8.4 以上，用下面的 host、port、name、user 和 password。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"The SQLite database file. Keep it on a disk of this machine, not in a folder "
"shared over the network.\n"
"The -wal and -shm files of the same name next to it are part of the database "
"too: while the program runs,\n"
"don't copy this file alone as a backup; use the backup command."
msgstr ""
"SQLite 的数据库文件。要放在这台机器自己的硬盘上，不能放在网络共享的文件夹"
"里。\n"
"旁边会多出同名的 -wal 和 -shm 文件，也是数据库的一部分：程序运行时不要只复制"
"这个文件当备份，用 backup 命令。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid "MySQL's address, or the path of a Unix socket (starting with /)."
msgstr "MySQL 的地址，也可以写 Unix 套接字的路径（以 / 开头）。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"Encryption (TLS) of the connection to MySQL: \"preferred\" encrypts when the "
"server has TLS on (MySQL's own default);\n"
"\"required\" always encrypts, or doesn't connect; \"verify_ca\" also checks "
"the server's certificate with ca below;\n"
"\"verify_identity\" also wants the name on the certificate to be host.\n"
"When MySQL is on another machine, use verify_ca or verify_identity: "
"encrypting without checking the certificate\n"
"doesn't stop a machine posing as the database."
msgstr ""
"MySQL 连接的加密（TLS）：\"preferred\" 服务器开着 TLS 就加密（MySQL 自己的默"
"认）；\"required\" 一定加密，不能加密就不连；\n"
"\"verify_ca\" 还用下面的 ca 校验服务器的证书；\"verify_identity\" 还要证书上"
"的名字和 host 一样。\n"
"MySQL 在另一台机器上时写 verify_ca 或 verify_identity：只加密不校验证书，挡不"
"住冒充数据库的机器。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"The CA certificate file (PEM) that checks the MySQL server's certificate; "
"needed when tls is verify_ca or verify_identity."
msgstr ""
"校验 MySQL 服务器证书用的 CA 证书文件（PEM 格式），tls 是 verify_ca 或 "
"verify_identity 时要写。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"The site's secret key: logins and the storage passwords kept in the database "
"depend on it.\n"
"Left empty, the program starts in setup mode (the whole site is the setup "
"page); the setup wizard writes one here.\n"
"Don't change it once installed: everyone would have to log in again, and the "
"encrypted passwords couldn't be read\n"
"any more."
msgstr ""
"网站的密钥：登录状态和存在数据库里的存储源密码都靠它。\n"
"空着时程序以安装模式启动（整个网站只有安装页面），安装向导会生成一个写进"
"来。\n"
"装好以后不要改：改了所有人都要重新登录，加密保存的密码也解不开了。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"The site's domain names or IPs: it answers only when it is opened at one of "
"them. The domain of url below is added by itself."
msgstr ""
"网站的域名或 IP，只有用这些地址打开网站才有回应。下面 url 里的域名会自动加"
"上。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"The site's public address, like \"https://files.example.com\". Full links "
"(direct links, shares) use it,\n"
"and it is an origin CSRF trusts; when it starts with https://, the login "
"cookies go over https only.\n"
"Empty: links use the address of each request."
msgstr ""
"网站对外的地址，比如 \"https://files.example.com\"。完整的链接（直链、分享）"
"用它，它也是 CSRF 信任的来源；\n"
"以 https:// 开头时，登录用的 Cookie 只走 https。空着：链接用每个请求自己的地"
"址。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"The address of the Django admin (Django's own admin site): /<this part>/.\n"
"Empty: a random one made from the secret key, printed when the program "
"starts.\n"
"Only English letters, digits, - and _. /admin/ is always a 404."
msgstr ""
"后台（Django 自带的管理后台）的地址：/<这一段>/。空着：由密钥算出一个随机的，"
"程序启动时会打印出来。\n"
"只能用英文字母、数字、- 和 _。/admin/ 永远是 404。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"Debug mode: an error shows its details on the page, and the API can be "
"browsed in a browser.\n"
"Turn it on only for development on your own computer."
msgstr ""
"调试模式：出错时页面上显示详细信息，接口能在浏览器里直接浏览。只在自己的电脑"
"上开发时打开。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"The files uploaded to the site itself (such as its logo and icon) are kept "
"in this folder. Their addresses are /media/….\n"
"When you change it, move the files of the old folder there too."
msgstr ""
"网站自己保存的上传文件（比如网站的 Logo 和图标）放在这个文件夹。网址是 /"
"media/…。\n"
"改到别处时，把原来文件夹里的文件也搬过去。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"Database backups: those made before an upgrade, and those of the backup "
"command"
msgstr "数据库的备份：升级前自动做的，和 backup 命令做的"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"The IP location database: the file downloaded on the admin page \"IP "
"location\" is kept in this folder"
msgstr "IP 归属地数据库：管理页「IP 归属地」下载的文件放在这里"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"When the database needs an upgrade at start: back it up, then upgrade it by "
"itself (README, \"Upgrading\").\n"
"Left out: true for the single-file program; false when running from source, "
"which upgrades with python manage.py upgrade."
msgstr ""
"启动时数据库要升级的话，先备份再自动升级（README「升级」）。\n"
"不写时：单文件程序是 true；从源码运行是 false，要用 python manage.py upgrade "
"升级。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"HFile's settings. A change takes effect when the program is started again.\n"
"It holds the database password and the site's secret key: don't send it to "
"anyone, and keep it out of code repositories.\n"
"The format is TOML: text in double quotes, numbers and true/false without.\n"
"Files and folders may be relative paths, from the folder of this file."
msgstr ""
"HFile 的设置。改了以后，重新启动程序才生效。\n"
"里面有数据库的密码和网站的密钥：不要发给别人，也不要放进代码仓库。\n"
"格式是 TOML：文字加英文双引号，数字和 true/false 不加。文件和文件夹可以写相对"
"路径，从这个文件所在的文件夹算起。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The settings file %(path)s doesn't seem to be HFile's: most of what is in it "
"isn't one of HFile's sections (%(sections)s) or settings, so it is probably "
"another program's file of the same name. HFile leaves it as it is."
msgstr ""
"设置文件 %(path)s 看起来不是 HFile 的：里面的内容大多不是 HFile 的节"
"（%(sections)s）或设置，多半是别的程序的同名文件。HFile 不会改动它。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"Put HFile in a folder of its own and start it there, where it creates a "
"settings file of its own; or choose another settings file with --config."
msgstr ""
"把 HFile 放进一个单独的文件夹里再运行，它会在那里新建自己的设置文件；或者用 "
"--config 指定另一个设置文件。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"[%(section)s]: There is no such section; check the spelling. The sections "
"are: %(sections)s."
msgstr "[%(section)s]：没有这一节，看看是不是写错了。可以有：%(sections)s。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s: Must be in a section, after a line such as [server]."
msgstr "%(name)s：要写在某一节下面，比如 [server] 那一行的后面。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"[%(section)s]: Must be a section (a line [%(section)s] on its own, with the "
"settings below it)."
msgstr "[%(section)s]：要写成一节（单独一行 [%(section)s]，下面再写设置）。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"[%(section)s] %(key)s: There is no such setting; check the spelling. This "
"section can have: %(keys)s."
msgstr ""
"[%(section)s] %(key)s：没有这个设置，看看是不是写错了。这一节可以有："
"%(keys)s。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid "Must be text in double quotes (its value isn't shown here)."
msgstr "要写成带英文双引号的文字（这里不显示它现在的值）。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid "[%(section)s] %(key)s: %(problem)s"
msgstr "[%(section)s] %(key)s：%(problem)s"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"[database] ca: With tls \"verify_ca\" or \"verify_identity\", name the CA "
"certificate file that checks the certificate."
msgstr ""
"[database] ca：tls 是 \"verify_ca\" 或 \"verify_identity\" 时，要写校验证书用"
"的 CA 证书文件。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"[database] ca: The certificate is checked only when tls is \"verify_ca\" or "
"\"verify_identity\"; tls is \"%(tls)s\" now, so ca isn't used."
msgstr ""
"[database] ca：只有 tls 是 \"verify_ca\" 或 \"verify_identity\" 时才校验证"
"书，现在 tls 是 \"%(tls)s\"，写了 ca 也不校验。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"[site] allowed_hosts: It is empty and so is url, so the site answers 400 at "
"any address. Write at least one domain name or IP (like [\"127.0.0.1\", "
"\"localhost\"]), or fill in url."
msgstr ""
"[site] allowed_hosts：是空的，url 也空着，用什么地址打开网站都会是 400。至少"
"写一个域名或 IP（比如 [\"127.0.0.1\", \"localhost\"]），或者填上 url。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid "The settings file %(path)s has %(count)s thing to fix:"
msgid_plural "The settings file %(path)s has %(count)s things to fix:"
msgstr[0] "设置文件 %(path)s 里有 %(count)s 处要改："

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid " (line %(line)s, column %(column)s)"
msgstr "（第 %(line)s 行第 %(column)s 个字符）"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid " (at the end of the file)"
msgstr "（在文件末尾）"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid "Can't read the settings file %(path)s: %(error)s."
msgstr "读不了设置文件 %(path)s：%(error)s。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid "The settings file %(path)s must be saved in UTF-8."
msgstr "设置文件 %(path)s 要用 UTF-8 编码保存。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The settings file %(path)s isn't valid: a list or table is nested too deep."
msgstr "设置文件 %(path)s 的格式不对：有一处列表或表格嵌套得太深了。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid "The settings file %(path)s isn't valid: %(error)s."
msgstr "设置文件 %(path)s 的格式不对：%(error)s。"

#: config/configfile.py
msgid ""
"The format is TOML: one \"name = value\" on each line, text in double "
"quotes, numbers and true/false without."
msgstr ""
"格式是 TOML：每行一个「名字 = 值」，文字要加英文双引号，数字和 true/false 不"
"加。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The folder %(folder)s doesn't exist, so the settings file can't be created "
"there. Create the folder first, or choose another place with --config."
msgstr ""
"文件夹 %(folder)s 不存在，没法在那里新建设置文件。先建好这个文件夹，或者用 --"
"config 换一个位置。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Can't create the settings file %(path)s: %(error)s. Choose a place that can "
"be written to with --config."
msgstr ""
"没法新建设置文件 %(path)s：%(error)s。用 --config 指定一个能写入的位置。"

#: config/configfile.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Some values can't be written into the settings file %(path)s as they are."
msgstr "有的值没法原样写进设置文件 %(path)s。"

#: config/database.py
#, python-format
msgid "SQLite, file %(path)s"
msgstr "SQLite，文件 %(path)s"

#: config/database.py
#, python-format
msgid "MySQL, %(name)s on %(server)s"
msgstr "MySQL，%(server)s 上的 %(name)s"

#: config/database.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The SQLite of this program is version %(version)s; at least %(minimum)s is "
"needed. Use MySQL, or a newer Python."
msgstr ""
"这个程序带的 SQLite 是 %(version)s 版，至少要 %(minimum)s。换用 MySQL，或者换"
"一个新一些的 Python。"
